<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">Tsaangi</book>
  <para style="rem">Tsaangi Revision</para>
  <para style="rem">TSC le groupe Tsaangi de Mossendjo et de Pointe-Noire, ROC. 2020. Albert Makita, Serge Mboungou, Gilbert Moukanou, Pierre Sanza</para>
  <para style="h">Mavaanga ma biluumbi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mavaanga ma Bilumbi bya Yisu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mavaanga</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mav</para>
  <para style="mt2">Libuuku li</para>
  <para style="mt1">Mavaanga ma</para>
  <para style="mt2">Biluumbi bya Yisu</para>
  <para style="imt">Kotili</para>
  <para style="ip">Muhanda a <char style="em">Mavaanga ma Biluumbi</char> li mu uya humbisa Musamu wu Mubwe wa Luuka. Nde li mu uyambila mu umweese buni biluumbi bi Yisu haatsindihi, byatsamuni tsaangu a nde. Mu ubaandiha hu Yeruselemi, titswene mu bitaanzi bya mu mivaanga mya Yeruselemi. Na humbisa, bo baataangili matsi ma maadinga mamba ma mubu ma bali mu uteele Meditarani. Buuna bo baakuhisi isalu hi Yisu haaviidi bo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 24:47-48">Luk 24.47-48</ref></char> et <char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 1:8">1.8</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Hu mbaandu muhanda a Mavaanga ma biluumbi, Yisu li mu ukuma hu yulu huli Nzambi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 1:9">1.9</ref></char>). Lolo yiniiyi, nde a hasaali mu itesi hi musunya ve. Ka nde li mu utsindaha Livupu la Ngidi li lili mu umata huli Nzambi, huli biluumbi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 2">2</ref></char>). Livupu mo liina lili uva matwala ma ukuhasa uta ibila mu mavaanga ma manene ma Nzambi hali mu usa. Bu limiitangila libuuku li Biluumbi tsoso na tsoso, Livupu la Ngidi lili mu ubita ba bamiisisa masumu mu uya huli Yisu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mu uto tee buli la <char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 12">12</ref></char>, <char style="em">Peetelo huli iluumbi</char> li mu umoonehele ŋa butima bwa ngu a dyambu mu libuuku li Biluumbi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Bayihi ba Yisu Bayudaayo bali. Bo bali mu uhwada mu uyene hu nzo a Nzambi yi yili hu Yeruselemi na utoyo mu mulongisi a bo. Ka, ni we Yisu, bo bali mu ubwana mbingisili yi yili mu umata huli bakuutu ba libundu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 3-8">3–8</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Buuna, ba baayaka Musamu wu Mubwe bali mu ubata matsyelo moosi hu Yude, hu Samariya, na hu lala. Bo bali mu uta ibila mu Musamu wu Mubwe napa huli ba bavele Bayudaayo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 8-12">8–12</ref></char>). Liina ni la kimuhili. Mu tangu mo yiina ndulu Bayudaayo baaba baayaba Nzambi huli siha vii. Bo bakatsima ti baatu ba manzambi makima utwala mu uyaba nde ve. Ka Yisu li mu uva bunyanga huli pasi muutu mu uba itwadi na Nzambi. Mabundu ma Bamukristo mali mu udibuma. Mo mali mu ufuna na ufuna, na mali mu ufuna mu Bayudaayo na mu bangoyi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Humata mu utsudu hya <char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 13">13</ref></char>, <char style="em">mutumu Pahuli </char> li mu ukisana Peetelo hutso a ngu musamu hu libuuku li Biluumbi. Pahuli ayaka teelili a Yisu Kristo (chapitre <char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 9">9</ref></char>). Libundu la Antioche li lili hu Syrie laasooli nde na bambaahi bakima mu uyata ibila hi Musamu wu Mubwe wa Yisu hu lala. Mabuli ma <char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 13-28">13–28</ref></char> mali mu uyambila mu midyenge mya nde mi uyalongese Musamu wu Mubwe. Bo bali mu uleele buni Musamu wu Mubwe ali mu utsamuha mu mambuha ma madiinga mubu a Meditarani na musyenge a Looma, hu hwaba kiti lituma la toto a bisu Looma.</para>
  <para style="ip">Musamu wu Mubwe wa Luuka li mu huwese tangu a Yisu. Uto ti libuuku li Biluumbi, lo lili mu umweese bandiili a <char style="em">tangu a libundu</char>. Tangu yi bamukristo bali mu uhwada mu ulongese imbangi hya Yisu, wuli Kristo. Bo bali mu uta ibila huli baatu ba mandaha moosi na ba manzambi moosi, huli bangebe, tso huli bakuutu; huli bisina, we huli biyaha.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1" />
  <para style="s1">Kotili a muhanda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1" />Ngeele Tehofile, mu libuuku la me latsomi, me atsonihi moosi ma Yisu habandihi uvanga na ulongese, <verse eid="ACT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2" />natee mu ilumbu hi nde havati hu yulu. Tswamina Yisu mu uvata hu yulu, nde asooli biluumbi na aviidi byo tumili mu matwala ma Livupu la Ngidi.<verse eid="ACT 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3" />Humbisa umono pasi yi lipfu, Yisu ayamonehele huli baatu mo baana, na umweese bo mu biliimbu bi bilahi, ti mbuli nde moonyi ali. Nde ayamonehele huli bo, mu maku mana ma bilumbu. Mu taangu mo yiina, nde ayabisi bo mambu ma Ipfumu hya Nzambi.<verse eid="ACT 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4" />Ilumbu imosi hi Yisu hakadya mu itwadi na biluumbi, nde aviidi bo tumili mo yiniiyi: «A lipala mu Yeruselemi ve, ka keelaani nde wuuna wu Taata hasiidi nzuhisini. Ni nde wuuna wu me anzabisi benu. <verse eid="ACT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5" />Yowani atondihi baatu mu mamba, ka mu bilumbu hole, Nzambi utondehe benu mu Livupu la Ngidi.»<verse eid="ACT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu avati hu yulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6" />Ba baakuukimi ŋa pedu a Yisu, baafuuli nde: «Pfumu, ni mu taangu mo yiniiyi we ufutala ipfumu hya Isereli?» <verse eid="ACT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7" />Yisu afutili bo: «A huli dyaambu la benu mu uyaba, ki matangu na matsuhu ma Taata hakese mu lituma la nde mwakulu ve. <verse eid="ACT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8" />Ka benu lu uyaka matwala, bu Livupu la Ngidi lukulamana ŋa yulu a benu. Benu lu uba bambangi ba me mu Yeruselemi, mu itaanzi hya Yuda hyoosi na hya Samariya, natee hu hwasuka toto.»<verse eid="ACT 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9" />Bu hamani uleele mambu mo maana, Yisu avati hu yulu. Bu biluumbi byosi byakatala nde, yidu laabiti nde. <verse eid="ACT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10" />Bu bo baakatala hu yulu hu Yisu hakayene, baatu boole ba baaba baalwata bikutu bi bifuka, baayamonehele ŋa busu bwa bo. <verse eid="ACT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11" />Baatu mo baana baaleeli bo: «Benu bisu Ngalili, hima benu lamiiteleme ŋa, mu ubaatala hu yulu? Yisu mo wunuuwu, wu Nzambi amiimasa ŋa hati la benu mu ubita hu yulu, uyafutaha we bu benu limoni nde mu uyene.»<verse eid="ACT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Matyasi miikisana Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12" />Biluumbi byafutihi hu Yeruselemi mu umata hu isyelo hya Olive. Isyelo mo hiina hyaba bebele na musyenge a Yeruselemi, mu itsudu hya ngunga mosi mu dwe la miilu. <verse eid="ACT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13" />Bu bo baatoodi hu musyenge a Yeruselemi, bo baavati hu itini hi ibaanga hya yulu hu bo baaba na ipfu hi upfutana. Ŋa hati la bo aba Peetelo na Yowani, Yaki na Andele, Filipo na Tomaasi, Batolomayi na Mataayi, Yaki mwaana a Alafe, Simoni wu aba mu kabu li «bazeloti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">bazeloti </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aba kabu la baatu ba baakalwanisa bisu Looma mu usaha bunyanga bwa Isereli.</char></note>» na Yuda mwaana Yaki. <verse eid="ACT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14" />Boosi mu matsimi mamosi, baakapfutana taangu yoosi mu usambila Nzambi. Itwadi na bakaasu bakima, Mariya ngu a Yisu, na baana ba ngu a Yisu.<verse eid="ACT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15" />Mu bilumbu mo biina, banga hiitu baapfutini. Bo aba bebele a kama na maku moole (120). Peetelo atelimi ŋa hati la bo, na aleeli: <verse eid="ACT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16" />«Baana baa ngu a me, hwafwana ti mambu ma Livupu la Ngidi laayabisa mu bisono mu munywa a Davidi, matswiha, mu tooni a Yuda wu alahi nzila huli ba baayakaanga Yisu. <verse eid="ACT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17" />Yuda aba mumosi ŋa hati la bisu a benu, na nde akasala itwadi na bisu. <verse eid="ACT 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18" />Mu mbongo yi baaviidi mu pfuta lisumu la Yuda, baasumbili nde ngundu. Ni hutso a ngundu mo yiina, nde habwidi mutswe mu toto, moonyi a nde atubihi na bihati bya nde byosi byasudimi. <verse eid="ACT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19" />Bisu Yeruselemi boosi baayuhi musamu mowuna. Ni mu buuna, ngundu mo yiina baaviidi yo nduhi mu ndaha a bo: “Akelidama”, mbindulili ti: “ngundu makila”. <verse eid="ACT 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20" />Buuna baasonehe mu Mikuunga mya Davidi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">“Nyaha nzo a nde babungasana yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">na tso muutu mumosi a hatsahala mu yo ve!”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 1:20">Na baabwesonehe:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">“Muutu mukima akiisana ŋa isalu hya nde<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:26">Mkg 69.26</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 109:8">109.8</ref></char></note>.”<verse eid="ACT 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21" />Laafwana mu usoolo muutu mumosi ŋa hati la ba baakayavehese bisu a benu, mu taangu yoosi yi Pfumu Yisu hakadyenge na bisu a benu. <verse eid="ACT 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:22" />Muutu mowuna abeedi ŋana, umata taangu yi Yowani hakatondehe, natee bu Yisu havati hu yulu. Hwafwana ti mumosi ŋa hati la baatu mo baana, aba mbangi a bisu mu tsuuhili a Yisu mu babaakwa.»<verse eid="ACT 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23" />Baatelimisi baatu boole. Muutu watsomi Yosefi, wu bubaateele Barasabasi. Kuumbu a nde kima Yusetuusi. Muutu waboole, wu bubaateele Matyasi. <verse eid="ACT 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24" />Baasambili bunuubu: «Pfumu, we ni wu yabi mitima mya boosi. Mweese bisu, na we sooli ŋa hati la baboole baniiba, <verse eid="ACT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25" />mana nde asala isalu hi buluumbi ŋa ikiisa hya Yuda. Nde wuuna wu atimbi isalu hya nde, mu uyene hu mbuha yi yafwana na nde.» <verse eid="ACT 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26" />Bo baatidi ngodo, na baasooli muutu waboole Matyasi, wu baabwesi ŋa hati la kuumi na iluumbi imosi.<verse eid="ACT 1:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2" />
  <para style="s1">Nziili a Livupu la Ngidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1" />Bu ilumbu hya Pantekote hyatoodi, bo boosi baaba baapfutana mbuha mosi. <verse eid="ACT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2" />Mawasa-mawasa, kele mosi yamati hu yulu we ifula hi mifudi. Buuna, kele mo yaluusi nzo yi bo baaba baatsahala. <verse eid="ACT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3" />Mu taangu mo yiina, bo baamoni malimi we maludi ma mbaahu. Mo maakakabuha na uyanama limosi-limosi ŋa yulu a pasi muutu mu bo. <verse eid="ACT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4" />Bo boosi baaluuli mu Livupu la Ngidi. Titswene baakatoyo mandaha makima, we bu Livupu laakatuma bo mu uyambila. <verse eid="ACT 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5" />Hu musyenge a Yeruselemi, hwaba na Bayudaayo ba baakakiinza Nzambi, ba baamati mu matsi moosi. <verse eid="ACT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6" />Bu bo baayuhi puunga mo yiina, mawasa-mawasa baatu mo baana baakuukimi mbuha mosi. Na bo baakimuhi hu unzuhisini, bu pasi muutu mu bo hakayuha bo mu uyambila mu ndaha a bula bwa nde. <verse eid="ACT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7" />Bo aba baaluula mu boomo, na baakasingasala na uleele: «Baatu mo babali mu utoyo baniiba, boosi bali bisu Ngalili! <verse eid="ACT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8" />Buni muutu-muutu mu bisu a benu, ali mu uyuha bo mu uyambila ndaha a bula bwa nde? <verse eid="ACT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9" />Ŋa hati la bisu a benu, huli na bisu tsi a Palatesi, ya Mediya na ya Elami. Huli kaka na bisu Mezopotamiya, hu tsi a Yuda na hu Kapadosi, hu Pooti na baa itaanzi hya Asiya. <verse eid="ACT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10" />Bakima bisu Filizi na Papfiliya, bisu Ngipiti na bisu Silene mu tsi a Libya. Huli kaka na bisu Looma, <verse eid="ACT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11" />na bisu iliiŋa hya Kerete, hu itaanzi hya Arabiya. Bamosi mu bisu bali Bayudaayo mu ubuta, na bakima mu bisu baasiingi usambila Nzambi Bayudaayo. Ka bisu a benu muutu-muutu li mu uyuha bo, mu utoyo mu mandaha ma mala ma bisu, mambu mamanene ma kimuhili a mavaanga ma Nzambi.»<verse eid="ACT 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12" />Bo boosi baakimuhi hu unzuhisini, na matsimi maasuki bo. Bo baakafulasana: «Dyambu mo linili lo buni?» <verse eid="ACT 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13" />Ka baatu bakima baanyanzi na baakaleele: «Bo hutso a laangi li malamu bali.»<verse eid="ACT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Peetelo miilongese konge a baatu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14" />Buuna Peetelo atelimi na biluumbi kuumi na imosi. Mu ndaha yi mifudi nde ayabisi huli konge a baatu: «Benu Bayudaayo, na benu bisu Yeruselemi, tehaani matswi mu ma me ndi mu undeele benu, na yaabaani ma mali mu uvyoho. <verse eid="ACT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15" />Baatu mobaniba a baakolo malamu we bu benu lili mu utsima ve. Mu tooni ati, yiniiyi kini ngunga yi ipfwa ya ŋa ngwali. <verse eid="ACT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16" />Ka bunuubu, mambu ma mumbihuli Yoweli haleeli mamiivangama:<verse eid="ACT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17" />“Nzambi aleeli: mu bilumbu bya tsyelele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">me unzitala Livupu la me ŋa yulu a pasi muutu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">Baana baa benu ba bakaasu na ba babahala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">bu ubihula mu nduhi a me,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">pfudu-mbahala a benu bu umono bimono-miisu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">na binunu bya benu bi ulooto mandoosi.<verse eid="ACT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18" />Eye, huli basalili ba me ba bakaasu na ba babahala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">mu bilumbu mo biina, me unzitala Livupu la me,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:18">na bo bu ubihula mu nduhi a me.<verse eid="ACT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19" />Me upanga bimangu hu yulu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:19">na biliimbu bya kimuhili ŋa toto.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:19">Sa huba na makila, mbaahu, na mayidu ma mwiki.<verse eid="ACT 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20" />Nyangu ukituha piipidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">na tsungi ubeenge we makila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">tswamina ilumbu hya Pfumu mu uto.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">Ilumbu mo hiina hyuba hiinene na hi muyusu.<verse eid="ACT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21" />Buuna, pasi muutu wu usambila Pfumu, uyoboho<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 3:1-5">Yoe 3.1-5</ref></char></note>.”<verse eid="ACT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22" />Benu bisu Isereli, yuhaani ma me undeele benu, mu tooni a Yisu musi Nazareti. Ni bahala li Nzambi hasilasa ŋa busu bwa benu, mu bipadi na biliimbu bi Nzambi hasa mu nde ŋa hati la benu. Benu mwakulu liyabi ma nde havangi. <verse eid="ACT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23" />Muutu mo wunuuwu baayehuli benu nde, we bu hwaba kesili a Nzambi, nde wu aba ateehele moosi uyaba. Ni benu laadubi nde. Benu baa laayehuli nde huli ba baaveleyaba Nzambi, mana bakomene nde ŋa kuruwa. <verse eid="ACT 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24" />Ka Nzambi asuuli nde mu babaakwa, na ayobili nde mu mapasi ma lipfu. Mu tooni ati, lipfu a laabahi matwala ma ukaanga nde ve. <verse eid="ACT 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25" />Davidi aleeli mu tooni a nde:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:25">“Me akamono Pfumu taangu yoosi ŋa busu bwa me,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:25">nde li ŋa mbahala a me, mana me peletsula likamba.<verse eid="ACT 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26" />Ni mu buuna, mutima a me ali mu isusi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:26">na mambu ma me moosi kaka, mali mu kinya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:26">Napa linyutu la me lili mu uvuma mu hiitu.<verse eid="ACT 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27" />Mu tooni ati, we Nzambi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:27">we a unyahula me mu tsi a babaakwa ve.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:27">We a usiingasa kaka ve ti me, musalili a we wa ngidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:27">nyutu a me yibolo hutso a ngila.<verse eid="ACT 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28" />We amweesi me manzila ma mu baabita hu moonyi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:28">We uluusa me mu kinya, bu we uba ŋa muvanga a me<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 16:8-11">Mkg 16.8-11</ref></char></note>.”<verse eid="ACT 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29" />Baana baa ngu a me, me utwala uleele benu paayalala, mambu ma matali kaaha a bisu a benu Davidi. Nde akwidi, na baadihi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.29 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">baadihi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bakuutu ba Bayudaayo ba baayabaana. </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 2:10">1Pf 2.10</ref></char>.</note>. Ngila a nde yikini huli bisu, te loloyi. <verse eid="ACT 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30" />Ka nde aba mumbihuli, na nde akayaba ti Nzambi asiidi nde nzuhisini mu mulabu. Lahi mo ti, mumosi ŋa hati li bikiisa bya nde, ukiisana nde ŋa kiti-ipfumu hya nde. <verse eid="ACT 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31" />Davidi atswamini uyaba mambu ma tsuuhili a Masiya mu babaakwa, bu nde hakaleele ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:31">“Nzambi a hatalila nde mu tsi a babaakwa siha ve,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:31">na linyutu la nde a laabolo hutso a ngila ve.”<verse eid="ACT 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32" />Nzambi asuuli nde ŋa hati la babaakwa. Yisu mo wu me ndi mu unzambila mu nde wunuwu. Bisu boosi lili bambangi. <verse eid="ACT 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33" />Baasyenuli nde, mu uba ŋa mbahala a Nzambi. Na nde miiyaka Livupu la Ngidi huli Taata, we bu Nzambi hasiidi nzuhisini. Nde amiiyitala lo ŋa yulu a bisu, we bu benu lili mu umono na uyuha bunuubu. <verse eid="ACT 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34" />Mu tooni ati Davidi a hakuma hu mayulu ve, ka nde mwakulu aleeli:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:34">“Pfumu aleeli huli Pfumu a me:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:34">Tsahala ŋa mbahala a me,<verse eid="ACT 2:34" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35" />natee bu me ukitusa baboho ba we,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:35">isuusili hya miilu mya we<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Mkg 110.1</ref></char></note>.”<verse eid="ACT 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36" />Ni mu buuna, baatu boosi ba Isereli baafwana uyaba mu mbuli yoosi ti: Yisu wu benu laakomini ŋa kuruwa, Nzambi amiibyalisa nde Pfumu na Kristo.»<verse eid="ACT 2:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37" />Baatu babaayuhi mambu mo maana baakimuhi hu unzuhisini. Bo baafuuli Peetelo na biluumbi bina: «Baana baa ngu, bisu hima lafwana usa?» <verse eid="ACT 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38" />Peetelo akaali bo: «Sobwaani mbiili, na pasi muutu mu benu batondehe mu nduhi a Yisu Kristo. Saani buuna, mana Nzambi amasa masumu ma benu. Ni huuna benu lu uyaka bungodu bu Livupu la Ngidi. <verse eid="ACT 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39" />Mu tooni ati, nzuhisini la Nzambi baasiidi mu benu, mu baana ba benu. Lahi la Nzambi baasiidi mu boosi ba bali hu matsi ma lala, na mu pasi muutu wu Pfumu Nzambi a bisu hu uteele.»<verse eid="ACT 2:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40" />Peetelo abweleele bo mambu ma malahi makima, mana bo bayuhala nde, na nde akayibusa bo na ubaaleele bo: «Siingaani liyobolo, mana benu aliyaka tsyembili a baatu mobaniba ba banyambana.» <verse eid="ACT 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41" />Kabu li lilahi laasiingi mambu ma Peetelo hakaleele. Baatondihi bo mu nyahulili a masumu. Mu ilumbu mo hiina, we biveeve bitatu (3 000) bya baatu baabiisili kabu la banga hiitu.<verse eid="ACT 2:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Libundu latsomi hu Yeruselemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42" />Bo baakahwada mu ubaayuha taangu yoosi ndongisili biluumbi, mu ubaatsahala mu itwadi na bana, mu ubaadya na ubaasambila mu itwadi. <verse eid="ACT 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43" />Baatu boosi baaba na tsisu a Nzambi, bu bayihi baakasa bipadi bi bilahi na bimbangi bya kimuhili. <verse eid="ACT 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44" />Boosi ba baasiidi hiitu baaba itwadi, na baakapfuuta mbuha mosi byosi bi bo baaba na byo. <verse eid="ACT 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45" />Bo baakasumbasa busina bwa bo na bi bo baaba na byo. Bo baakakabasana mbongo, we bu hwaba nzala a muutu-muutu. <verse eid="ACT 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46" />Pasi ilumbu, mu mutima mumosi, bo baakaba ŋa litandala la nzo a Nzambi. Bo baakakabasana byudya bya bo, mu itwadi mu manzo ma bo, na baakadya na kinya, mutima wu ayaluha. <verse eid="ACT 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47" />Bo baakayusa Nzambi, na baatu boosi baaba na hyese hya bo. Na pasi ilumbu Pfumu akabwese hu kabu la banga hiitu, ba nde hakayobolo.<verse eid="ACT 2:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3" />
  <para style="s1">Nga ipiha wu abeeluhi hu nzo a Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1" />Peetelo na Yowani baakumi hu nzo a Nzambi mu lisambulu mu ngunga yi matatu ya humbisa a mwangulu. <verse eid="ACT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2" />Ŋa muvanga a ikotili hya mumbu a nzo a Nzambi, hi baakateele «ikotili hi ibwe», hwaba na muutu nga ipiha hi imbutala-ngu. Pasi ilumbu, baakabehe na baakatsahisa nde ŋana. Bo baakasa buuna, mana nde abaavondo bungodu huli ba baakakoto mu litandala la nzo a Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3" />Nde amono Peetelo na Yowani ba baakakoto mu nzo a Nzambi, nde avondi bo mbongo. <verse eid="ACT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4" />Peetelo na Yowani baasungimini nde, na Peetelo aleeli nde: «Tala bisu!» <verse eid="ACT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5" />Nde atali bo na hiitu hyoosi, mu tooni ati, nde akakeele uyaka isiha huli bo. <verse eid="ACT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6" />Buuna Peetelo aleeli nde: «Me a handi na mbongo, tso wolo ve. Ka bi me ndi na byo, me miipa we byo, mu nduhi a Yisu Kristo musi Nazareti: teleme na yene!» <verse eid="ACT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7" />Titswene, Peetelo akaangi nde mu hoho hwa mbahala, atelimisi nde. Masulubete, miilu mya nde na makede byahwadi. <verse eid="ACT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8" />Mu dambuha limosi, nde atelimi na ayeni. Nde akoti na biluumbi mu litandala la nzo a Nzambi mu uyene, mu udambuha, na mu ubaayusa Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9" />Baatu boosi baamoni nde, mu uyene na mu uyusa Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10" />Baatu baadihuli ti wunuwu ni nde wu akabaavondo bungodu matsahala, ŋa ikotili hya mumbu a nzo a Nzambi. Bo boosi baakimuhi na baamoni tsisu mu ma maabwili muutu mo wunuwu.<verse eid="ACT 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Peetelo li mu ulongese mu litandala la nzo a Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11" />Bu muutu mo wunuuwu hakaveletahuha na Peetelo buna Yowani, boosi hutso a kimuhili, baahidumini huli bo hu mbongi yi baakateele «mbongi a Soolomo». <verse eid="ACT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12" />Bu Peetelo hamoni buuna, nde ayabisi huli bo: «Bisu Isereli, mu hima benu likimuhi mu ipadi mo hinihi? Benu litsimi ti, ni mu matwala ma bisu, buuve mu ukangama hwa bisu mu Nzambi, bisu limiitelemese muutu mo wunuuwu. Naana a buuna ve! <verse eid="ACT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13" />Nzambi a Abrahami, wa Isaki na wa Yakobi, Nzambi bakaaha ba bisu, miimweese muyusu a musalili a nde Yisu. Benu mwakulu laayehuli nde huli bakuutu, na utuna nde ŋa busu bwa Pilaato. Humbisa utsikaha mambu, Pilaato abeedi na tsimi yi unyahula nde. <verse eid="ACT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14" />Benu laanyanzi wu abeedi wa ngidi na wu akuha, na benu laatondi ti banyahula benu mudubi a baatu. <verse eid="ACT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15" />Buuna, benu laatumi uduba Pfumu a moonyi. Ka Nzambi asuuli nde mu babaakwa, na bisu lili bambangi baa mambu mo maana. <verse eid="ACT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16" />Mu tooni imiinu hi lili na hyo mu nduhi a Yisu, matwala ma nduhi a nde maabweva mifudi huli muutu mo wu benu limiimono, na wu benu liyabi. Ni imiinu hi nde ali na hyo mu Yisu, himiibeloso nde nzyeni ŋa busu bwa benu. <verse eid="ACT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17" />Bunuubu, baana ba ngu, me nzaabi bubwe ti benu na bakuutu ba benu, laavaangi buuna hutso budimbu. <verse eid="ACT 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18" />Ka Nzambi hakuhasa buuna, ma nde haba hamiiteehele uyabisa mu minywa mi mimbihuli myosi. Nde aleeli ti Kristo a nde afwana umono munyongi. <verse eid="ACT 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19" />Sobwaani mbiili, na yafutahani huli Nzambi, mana nde atsindula masumu ma benu. <verse eid="ACT 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20" />Buuna Pfumu Nzambi uva benu matangu ma pumili. Nde utsindaha benu Yisu, ni Kristo wu nde hasooli mu tooni a benu. <verse eid="ACT 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21" />Mu taangu mo yiniiyi, hwafwana ti nde aba hu yulu. Nde utsahala na Nzambi natee taangu yi Nzambi hu ukitusa byosi bunyatihi, we bu nde hayabisi umata tsikulu, mu minywa mi mimbihuli mya nde. <verse eid="ACT 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22" />Ka Moose aleeli: “Pfumu Nzambi a benu utsindaha mumosi ŋa hati la baana ba ngu a benu, mumbihuli we me. Benu laafwana uyuha moosi ma nde huleele benu. <verse eid="ACT 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23" />Ka pasi muutu wu uveleyuhala mumbihuli mo wunuuwu, bu udimbasa nde ŋa hati la buli la Nzambi na uduba nde<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:15">Pfu 18.15</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 18:18">18</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 18:19">19</ref></char></note>.” <verse eid="ACT 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24" />Umata taangu a mumbihuli Samweli, mimbihuli myosi myatoyi ilandi-ilandi, na myayabisi mambu ma mu uya mu bilumbu mo biniibi. <verse eid="ACT 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25" />Benu lili baana ba mimbihuli, na baa nzuhisini li Nzambi hakuti na bakaaha ba benu, ŋa nde haleeli huli Abrahami ti: “Mu bikiisa bya we<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:18">Mba 22.18</ref></char></note>, me utsyeme bibandu byosi bya ŋa toto.” <verse eid="ACT 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26" />Ni mu tooni a benu, Nzambi hatswamisi utelemese musalili a nde. Nde atsindihi nde mu usyeme benu na mu usa ti muutu-muutu mu benu, atahuha na mavaanga ma nde ma mabi.»<verse eid="ACT 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4" />
  <para style="s1">Peetelo na Yowani ŋa busu bwa pfuundu banzonzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1" />Bu Peetelo na Yowani baaba kini mu uyambila na baatu, bangaanga ba Nzambi, na mukuutu bakeedi baa nzo a Nzambi, na Basaduki baayidi. <verse eid="ACT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2" />Bo baaluuli mu kesi yindahi mu umono biluumbi bi byole mu ubaalongese baatu. Byo byakayabisa ti mu Yisu, babaakwa utwala usuuha mu lipfu. <verse eid="ACT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3" />Ni mu buuna, bu busi bwaba bwakalala, baakangi na baabwahi byo mu kondaayi te ŋa ngwali. <verse eid="ACT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4" />Ka, ŋa hati la ba baayuhi mambu ma Nzambi, ba banzuhisini baasiidi hiitu mu Yisu. Buuna, litangu la baatu latoodi bebele a biveeve bitaanu (5 000).<verse eid="ACT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5" />Mu ilumbu hi hyaduukili, bapfumu ba Bayudaayo, itwadi na bakuutu ba bo, na milongisi mi Mikele, baakuukimi hu musyenge a Yeruselemi. <verse eid="ACT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6" />Hwaba huuna: Ane mukuutu bangaanga ba Nzambi, Kayife, Yowani, Alezande, na baatu boosi ba ibaandu hya nde. <verse eid="ACT 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7" />Bo baabiti biluumbi ŋa busu bwa bo, na bafuuli byo: «Mu ki matwala, buuve mu nduhi a na benu limiibeloso muutu mo wunuuwu?» <verse eid="ACT 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8" />Buuna Peetelo, bu haluuli mu Livupu la Ngidi aleeli bo: «Bapfumu na bakuutu ba Bayudaayo, yuhaani! <verse eid="ACT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9" />Loloyi bali mu uva bisu byuhu, mu tooni libwe li bisu limiisa huli muutu wu beedi na miilu mi myavolo. Benu lili mu usaha utsikaha buni nde habeluhi. <verse eid="ACT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10" />Bisu litondi ti benu litsikaha dyaambu mo linili bubwe, benu boosi, napa baatu ba Isereli boosi. Tso bahala mo linili, lili polo ŋa busu bwa benu, ni mu tooni a nduhi a Yisu Kristo, musi Nazareti. Yisu wu benu laakomini ŋa muti, na wu Nzambi hasuuli ŋa hati la babaakwa. <verse eid="ACT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11" />Yisu ni:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:11">“Manya li benu batungi laanyanzi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:11">na li laakituhi manya la ngu ŋa itungu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Mkg 118.22</ref></char></note>.”<verse eid="ACT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12" />Liyobolo ndulu mu nde lili. Mu tsi yoosi, Nzambi a hava muutu mukima ve ŋa hati la baatu, wu ufuuhasa bisu a benu.»<verse eid="ACT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13" />Baatu ba pfuundu bakuutu baakimuhi hu unzuhisini, mu umono tsiki a Peetelo na Yowani. Bo baamoni ti bo baatu ba baakulamana, na ba baavele a nzaabili. Bo baayabi ti, bo baaba itwadi na Yisu. <verse eid="ACT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14" />Ka bu bo baakamono muutu wu abeluhi ateleme ŋa pedu a bo, bo a baabahi dyaambu li ukaala ve. <verse eid="ACT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15" />Buuna, bo baatumi bo mu upala mu nzo, na baasaali mu ukese musamu ŋa hati la bo. <verse eid="ACT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16" />Bo baakalelesene: «Ipadi mo hya mbuli, bisu a benu hima lu usaani mu baatu mobaniba? Mu tooni ati, baatu boosi ba Yeruselemi, baayabi bubwe ti ipadi mo hinihi mbuli bo baasiidi hyo, na bisu a benu utwala utuna hyo ve. <verse eid="ACT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17" />A huli bubwe ve ti dyaambu mo linili lisinzatsamuha ŋa hati la baatu. Lilihaani bo na bukanyi bwosi, bo mu ubweveletoyo mu nduhi a Yisu huli pasi muutu.»<verse eid="ACT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18" />Bo baabweteele Peetelo na Yowani, na baakali bo mu mifudi mu utangula na mu ulongese baatu nduhi a Yisu. <verse eid="ACT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19" />Ka Peetelo na Yowani baakaali bo: «Monwaani benu mwakulu, tso hwafwana ŋa busu bwa Nzambi mu usiingala benu na uvelesiingala Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20" />Ka bisu, bisu utwala ubisa mu uyambila mu mambu ma bisu laamono na laayuha ve.» <verse eid="ACT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21" />Baatu ba pfuundu banzonzi baakanini bo, titswene baanyahuli bo. Bo a baabahi tooni yi usyembe Peetelo na Yowani ve, mu tooni ati, baatu boosi baakayusa Nzambi mu mambu ma maavangimi. <verse eid="ACT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22" />Bahala mo li laabeeluhi mu ipadi, aba amiivyoso maku mana ma bilima.<verse eid="ACT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lisambulu la banga hiitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23" />Bu baanyahuli bo, Peetelo na Yowani baayeni huli bambaahi ba bo. Baayabisi bo ma bakuutu ba bangaanga ba Nzambi na bakuutu ba bibandu baaleeli bo. <verse eid="ACT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24" />Bu bo baamani uyuha bo, bo boosi baabaandihi usambila Nzambi na uleele: «Pfumu, we ni wu avangi mayulu, toto, mubu na byosi bibili muuna<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:11">Pal 20.11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 146:6">Mkg 146.6</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25" />We ni wu aleele mu Livupu la Ngidi li laatoyi mu munywa a kaaha a bisu Davidi, musalili a we ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:25">“Mu hima mabuli ma matsi ma bumwenyi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:25">maaminyangumana?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:25">Na matsi maamikuta mapfuundu ma mupu!<verse eid="ACT 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26" />Batumi baa toto baamivangama</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">mu mudingu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:26">na bakuutu baamipfutana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">mu ulwanisa Pfumu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">na Masiya wu nde hasoolo.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.25-26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:1-2">Mkg 2.1-2</ref></char></note>”<verse eid="ACT 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27" />Ni mbuli: Eloode na Ponse Pilaato baamipfutana mutso musyenge mo wunuuwu. Bo baamipfutana itwadi na baatu ba matsi ma bumwenyi, na bisu Isereli, mu ubelele musalili a we wa ngidi, Yisu. Nde wuuna wu we asoolo Masiya. <verse eid="ACT 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28" />Bo baavangi maana moosi, we bu we atondi na akeesi mo mu hati a tsomi, mu matwala ma we. <verse eid="ACT 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29" />Pfumu, mu taangu yiniiyi, mono bu bo bali mu umweese bisu pasi, na va basalili ba we mifudi mi uyalongese mambu ma we na hiitu hyoosi. <verse eid="ACT 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30" />Mweese matwala ma we, mana babeedu babeeloho. Nyaha biliimbu na bimangu bivangama mu nduhi a Yisu, musalili a we wa ngidi.» <verse eid="ACT 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31" />Bu bo baakasambila, mbuha yi bo baaba baakuukama yanyingimi. Bo boosi baaluuli mu Livupu la Ngidi, na bo baakayabisa mambu ma Nzambi na hiitu hyoosi.<verse eid="ACT 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Banga hiitu baakakabasana busina bwa bo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32" />Konge a banga hiitu, yaba na matsimi mamosi, na mutima mumosi. A hwaba na muutu wu akaleele ti busina bwa nde, bwa nde siha ve. Ka byosi bi bo baaba na byo, aba bi itwadi. <verse eid="ACT 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33" />Na mifudi mi milahi, biluumbi byakata imbangi mu tooni a tsuuhili a Pfumu Yisu. Nzambi akava bo boosi hyese hi hilahi. <verse eid="ACT 4:33" /><verse number="34-35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34-35" />A hwaba na mumosi wu akakiima isiha ve. Mu tooni ati, ba baaba na mangundu buuve manzo, baakasumbasa na baakava mbongo a fwanda huli biluumbi. Titswene biluumbi byakakaba mbongo huli muutu-muutu we bu hwaba manzala ma nde. <verse eid="ACT 4:34-35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36" />Hwaba na muutu mumosi nduhi Yosefi, wu baabuti hu iliiŋa hya Kipere, wu ibaandu hya Levi. Biluumbi byakateele nde Baranabasi, mbindulili a nduhi ti: «wu ubaabombesele». <verse eid="ACT 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37" />Nde asumbisi tsyehe yi nde haba na yo, abehi mbongo, na aviidi yo huli biluumbi.<verse eid="ACT 4:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5" />
  <para style="s1">Mapfuta ma Ananya na Safila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1" />Ka hwaba na muutu mumosi, nduhi a nde Ananya. Nde ayuhisini na mukadi a nde Safila, mu usumbasa toto a bo. <verse eid="ACT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2" />Nde aswehi kabu la mbongo lina humbisa uyuhasana na mukadi a nde, na nde ayava ibadi hina huli biluumbi. <verse eid="ACT 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3" />Peetelo aleeli nde: «Ananya, mu hima Saatana hamiituma we mu uvanga buuna? We miipfuta Livupu la Ngidi na uswehe ibadi hya mbongo a toto. <verse eid="ACT 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4" />Tswamina we sumbasa toto a we, we aba uswehe yo mu we mwakulu. Napa humbisa usumbasa yo, we aba bunyanga mu usalila mbongo mo yiina mu lituma la we. Buni we bahi tsimi a pila yiniiyi mu mutima a we? We a pfuti baatu ve, ka Nzambi we pfuti.» <verse eid="ACT 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5" />Bu Ananya hayuhi mambu mo maana, nde abwidi na akwidi. Na boosi babaayuhi musamu mo wunuuwu, baamoni boomo bu bwafulala. <verse eid="ACT 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6" />Mu taangu mo yiina, pfudu-mbahala yaayidi, yaapoti mvumbi a nde lileeso, na yaayadiiha yo.<verse eid="ACT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7" />Humbisa mangunga we matatu, mukadi a Ananya ayakoto, hwavele uyaba ma maavyohi. <verse eid="ACT 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8" />Peetelo afuuli nde: «Leele me, mu mbuli ni mu lifunu mo linili benu lisumbisi toto?» Nde afutili: «Eye, ni mu lifunu mo liina.» <verse eid="ACT 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9" />Buuna Peetelo aleeli nde: «Buni benu liyuhisini mu uyehele Livupu la Pfumu? Tala! Ba bamiiyadiiha mulumi a we ŋa munywa a nzo baaka, na bo bu ubita we kaka.» <verse eid="ACT 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10" />Mawasa-mawasa, Safila abwidi ŋa miilu mya Peetelo na akwidi. Pfudu mbahala yaakoti, yaabiisi nde wu akwa. Yo yaabiti nde kaka hu uyadiiha ŋa pedu mulumi a nde. <verse eid="ACT 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11" />Libundu loosi na boosi ba baayuhi musamu mo wunuuwu, baamoni boomo bu bwafulala.<verse eid="ACT 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Biluumbi byakasa bimangu bi bilahi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12" />Biluumbi byakasa biliimbu na bimangu bi bilahi bya kimuhili, ŋa hati la baatu. Basambili boosi mu itwadi, baakatsonzomo ŋa mbongi yi baakateele «Mapombo ma Soolomo». <verse eid="ACT 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13" />Muutu wu avele a hiitu tso mumosi, a hakayehele ukoto mu konge a bo ve. Tso bu baatu boosi baakayusa bo. <verse eid="ACT 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14" />Babahala na bakaasu ba banzuhisini baakasa hiitu mu Pfumu. Baatu mo baana baapfunisi litangu la banga hiitu. <verse eid="ACT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15" />Baatu baakabehe babeedu mu manzila na baakalasa bo ŋa yulu mataangi na bipooyi. Mana bu Peetelo huvyoho, inzinza hya nde ifuha tso mumosi mu bo. <verse eid="ACT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16" />Makonge ma baatu baakamata ka hu misyenge mya bebele na Yeruselemi. Bo baakabehe babeedu, na baatu ba mavupu ma mabi maakakwamisa, na boosi baakabeloho.<verse eid="ACT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baamiikwamisa biluumbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17" />Ni mu buuna, mukuutu bangaanga ba Nzambi, na boosi ba baaba na nde, kabu loosi li Basaduki, laluuli mu nyengi biluumbi. <verse eid="ACT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18" />Bo baatumi mu ukaanga biluumbi na baabwahi bo mu kondaayi yinene. <verse eid="ACT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19" />Ka ŋa butsuhu, pofi a Pfumu adibuli bidibuhu bya kondaayi, nde apalisi biluumbi. Na nde aleeli bo: <verse eid="ACT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20" />«Yenaani hu nzo a Nzambi. Ni huuna benu lu uyabisa baatu, mambu moosi ma maatala moonyi wu munyatihi.» <verse eid="ACT 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21" />Biluumbi byasiingi, byo byayeni hu nzo a Nzambi tsumba a ngwali, na byabandihi ulongese baatu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:21">Mukuutu bangaanga ba Nzambi, na boosi ba baakasala na nde, baateeli bakuutu ba Isereli mu utsonzomo mu pfuundu yinene. Na baatumisi masadaadu, mu uyavolo biluumbi hu nzo a kondaayi. <verse eid="ACT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22" />Mu taangu yi masadaadu mayato hu nzo a kondaayi, mo a maabiisi biluumbi ve. Masadaadu maafutihi hu pfuundu, maayava ikuumbu mo hinihi: <verse eid="ACT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23" />«Bisu liyabiisa nzo a kondaayi baadibuha bubwe, na bakeedi baa yo, mu mambuha ma bo ŋa busu bu minywanzo. Ka bu bisu lidibuli bidibuhu, bisu a limoni muutu hu hati ve.» <verse eid="ACT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24" />Mu uyuha ikuumbu mo hinihi, mutumi masadaadu wa nzo a Nzambi na bakuutu ba bangaanga ba Nzambi, matsimi maasuki. Na baakafulasana ti: «Dyambu mo linili, buni livyohi?» <verse eid="ACT 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25" />Titswene muutu mumosi ayayabisa bo: «Yuhaani! Baatu ba benu laabwaha mu kondaayi, babanaa mu litandala la nzo a Nzambi mu ulongese baatu.» <verse eid="ACT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26" />Buuna mutumi masadaadu ayeni na bakeedi ba nde, mu usaha ubwebehe biluumbi. Ka bo a baayeni na lwanisa ve, mu tooni ati bo baaba na boomo ti baatu balanga bo mamanya.<verse eid="ACT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27" />Bu bo baabehi biluumbi, mu utsundasa byo ŋa busu bwa pfuundu, mukuutu bangaanga ba Nzambi akava byo byuhu. <verse eid="ACT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28" />Nde aleeli bo: «Bisu laasa benu mukele mu mifudi mu ubwevelelongese mu nduhi a muutu mo wuuna. Ka benu ki lo livaangi? Benu limiitsala ndongisili a benu mu musyenge a Yeruselemi woosi, na benu litondi ususa pfuta lipfu la nde ŋa yulu a bisu!»<verse eid="ACT 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29" />Buuna Peetelo na biluumbi bikima baafutili bo: «Hwafwana mu usiingala Nzambi, ka a baatu ve. <verse eid="ACT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30" />Nzambi bakaaha ba bisu amiisuula Yisu mo wunuuwu, wu benu laadubi mu ukomene ŋa muti a kuruwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31" />Nzambi asyenuli nde mu matwala ma nde, abyalisi nde we Pfumu na Muyobili. Nzambi hasiidi buuna, mana bisu Isereli basobo mbiili a bo, na bayaka nyahulili masumu ma bo. <verse eid="ACT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32" />Bisu lili bambangi baa misamu mo miina, bisu na Livupu la Ngidi, li Nzambi havidi ba bali mu usiingala nde.» <verse eid="ACT 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33" />Baatu ba pfuundu banzonzi badasuhi mu mifudi, bu bo baayuhi mambu mo maana, na bo baakatondo uduba biluumbi.<verse eid="ACT 5:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34" />Ka hwaba ŋa hati la bo, mufarisi mumosi nduhi a nde Ngamalyeli. Nde aba mulongisi mikele, wu baatu boosi baakakiinza. Nde atelimi ŋa hati la pfuundu banzonzi, na atumi mu upalisa biluumbi mu mwaana taangu. <verse eid="ACT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35" />Titswene nde aleeli huli boosi: «Kebaani! Benu bisu Isereli, mu ma benu luvangila baatu mobaniba. <verse eid="ACT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36" />Hwavyohi mwaana a taangu yindahi, muutu mumosi nduhi Tedaasi, akamonehele ti nde muutu wu munene. Baatu bebele na makama mana (400), baakaduukala nde. Ka bu baadubi nde, baatu boosi ba baakasa hiitu mu nde, baatsamuhi na buli la nde laanyambini. <verse eid="ACT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37" />Ŋa mbisa a nde, mu taangu yi usonehe litangu la baatu ba mutsi, hwabwepala Yuda musi Ngalili. Nde kaka abwetelemese baatu ba banzuhisini, mu uduukala nde. Nde kaka baadubi, na boosi ba baakasa hiitu mu nde, baatsali bo. <verse eid="ACT 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38" />Bunuubu, me ndeele benu: Nyahaani utsundana mu baatu mobaniba, nyahulaani bo bayene. Ka umono ti, matsimi ma bo na mavaanga ma bo mali ma imuutu, mo mu udimbala mu nzila. <verse eid="ACT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39" />Ka tso mbuli mo mamati huli Nzambi, benu a lutwala utsala mo ve. A liyehele ulwanisa Nzambi ve!»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:39">Baatu ba pfuundu banzonzi, baasilisi matsimi ma Ngamalyeli. <verse eid="ACT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40" />Bo baateeli biluumbi, baatumi masadaadu mu utete biluumbi bikooti, na baaviidi byo mukele mu ubweveletoyo mu nduhi a Yisu. Titswene, bo baanyahuli byo. <verse eid="ACT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41" />Biluumbi byapali mu nzo a pfuundu banzonzi na kinya yoosi, mu umono ti bo baakwasi iteesi hi ubiingala munyongi mu nduhi a Yisu.<verse eid="ACT 5:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42" />Na pasi ilumbu, mu nzo a Nzambi na mu manzo ma bo, bo baakahwada mu ubaalongese na ubaayabisa Musamu wu Mubwe ti Yisu ni Masiya.<verse eid="ACT 5:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6" />
  <para style="s1">Baasooli baatu tsambu mu ukumbasa biluumbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1" />Mu bilumbu mo biina, litangu li bayihi laakapfuna, Bayudaayo ba baakayambila ndaha a Bangeleke, baakaŋono. Bo baakaŋono mu tooni ati, pasi ilumbu, mu taangu a kabili a byudya, Bayudaayo ba baakayambila Ibeleho, baakafumbasa bakwili ba bo ba bakaasu. <verse eid="ACT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2" />Ni mu buuna, kuumi biluumbi byole byakungi konge yoosi yi bayihi, na baaleeli: «A hwafwana huli bisu mu unyaha ulongese mambu ma Nzambi mu tooni a isalu hya kabili a byudya ve. <verse eid="ACT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3" />Ni mu buuna, baana ba ngu, soolowaani ŋa hati la benu, babahala tsambu baa buutiila imbangi hi ibwe, ba baaluula mu Livupu la Ngidi na mu tsiki. Na bisu a benu livaani bo isalu mo hiniihi. <verse eid="ACT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4" />Buuna bisu lu ukaahwada taangu yoosi, mu lisambulu na mu isalu hi ulongese mambu ma Nzambi.»<verse eid="ACT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5" />Baatu boosi baasiingi mambu ma bo baayabisi. Ni mu buuna, bo baasooli Etyene bahala li laaluula mu hiitu na mu Livupu la Ngidi, Filipo, Pokole, Nikanoli, Timoni, Palamenasi na Nikolasi musi Antyokya, wu asiingi usalila Nzambi Bayudaayo. <verse eid="ACT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6" />Na baamweesi bo huli biluumbi, bi byasambili mu bo na byasuusili bo myoho. <verse eid="ACT 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7" />Mambu ma Nzambi maakatsamuha, litangu li bayihi laakakula bunzuhisini hu Yeruselemi. Na litangu lilinene li bangaanga ba Nzambi, baakasa hiitu mu Yisu.<verse eid="ACT 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kangili a Etyene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8" />Etyene wu aba aluula mu matwala na mu hyese akavaanga bipadi na bimangu bibinene ŋa hati la baatu. <verse eid="ACT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9" />Mwa litangu la baatu layakaakana na nde. Baatu mo baana aba baa kabu la baatu ba nzo lisambulu yi Bayudaayo, li bakateele kabu li «baviha na ba baaba bunyanga». Kabu mo aba na Bayudaayo ba misyenge mya Kilene na baa mya Alekizandi. Itwadi na bakima baa hu itaanzi hya Silisiya, na baa tsi ya Asiya, bo boosi baakakini na Etyene. <verse eid="ACT 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10" />Ka bo a baatwali ubiingala nde ve, mu tooni ati nde akayambila mu tsiki yi Livupu laakava nde. <verse eid="ACT 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11" />Ni mu buuna, bo baayuhisini na baatu, na uva bo mbongo, mana baatu mo baana baleele: «Bisu layuha nde mu utuha Moose na Nzambi!» <verse eid="ACT 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12" />Bo baatelimisi baatu boosi ŋa yulu a nde, bakuutu ba mabuli, na milongisi mi Mikele. Titswene bo baakangi nde mu mifudi na baabiti nde hu pfuundu banzonzi baa Bayudaayo. <verse eid="ACT 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13" />Bo baabiti ka bambangi baa mapfuta mu uyakese nde. Bo baaleeli: «Bahala mo linili lili mu ukwilala mu ubaayambila bubi, mu tooni a nzo a Nzambi a bisu ya ngidi na mu mikele mya Moose! <verse eid="ACT 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14" />Bisu laayuha nde mu uleele ti Yisu, musi Nazareti, utsala nzo a Nzambi na usanza bipfu bi Moose hasiisili bisu.» <verse eid="ACT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15" />Boosi ba baaba baatsahala hutso a nzo a pfuundu banzonzi baa Bayudaayo, baasungimini Etyene, na baamoni hiinzi hya nde hyakituhi we hya pofi.<verse eid="ACT 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7" />
  <para style="s1">Etyene aviidi ikuumbu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1" />Mukuutu bangaanga ba Nzambi ni ufuula Etyene: «Mambu ma bali mu uleele mu we, mali ma mbuli?» <verse eid="ACT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2" />Etyene afutili: «Bataata na baana ba ngu ba me, yuhaani! Nzambi yi muyusu ayamonehele huli kaaha a bisu a benu Abrahami, ŋa nde haba hu itaanzi hya Mezopotami. Nde ayamonehele na nde, tswamina nde mu uyatsahala hu musyenge a Harani. <verse eid="ACT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3" />Na Nzambi aleeli nde: “Mata mu tsi a we na buli la we, na yene hu tsi yi me umweese we<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:1">Mba 12.1</ref></char></note>.” <verse eid="ACT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4" />Abrahami amati mu tsi a bisu Kaledeya na ayatsahala hu musyenge a Harani. Na, humbisa lipfu la taata a nde, Nzambi atsindihi nde mu tsi yi benu lili mu yo loloyi. <verse eid="ACT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5" />Huuna, Nzambi a havidi nde iloho tso imosi ve, tso ibuha hi ususa hulu ve. Mu taangu mo yiina, Abrahami a haba na mwaana ve. Ka Nzambi ti asiidi nde nzuhisini li uva nde tsi. Nde asiidi nde ka nzuhisini ti, bikiisa bya nde sa bibaha yo.<verse eid="ACT 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6" />Nzambi aleeli Abrahami bunuubu: “Bikiisa bya we byutsahala mu tsi bumwenyi, hu bu ukitusa bo baviha. Huuna bu unyongese bo mu makama mana (400) ma bilima. <verse eid="ACT 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7" />Ka me utsundasa tsi yi yuukitusa bo baviha. Hu mbisa, bo buupala mu tsi bumwenyi na buusalila me mu tsi mo yiniiyi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:13-14">Mba 15.13-14</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 3:12">Pal 3.12</ref></char></note>.” <verse eid="ACT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8" />Titswene Nzambi akuti nzuhisini na Abrahami mu iliimbu hya ketili. Ni mu buuna, Abrahami haketi Isaki wu nde habuti, mu ilumbu hya poombo hi hyaduuki mbutili a nde. Isaki kaka pila mosi aketi Yakobi, na Yakobi kaka aketi bakaaha ba bibandu kuumi na byole bi Isereli.<verse eid="ACT 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9" />Bakaaha baa bibandu baaba na nyengi a Yosefi, baasumbisi nde mu ukitusa nde muviha na baabiti nde hu tsi a Ngipiti. Ka Nzambi akumbisi nde. <verse eid="ACT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10" />Nzambi apalisi nde hutso munyongi. Nde aviidi Yosefi hyese mu ubaha buyedi ŋa busu bwa Falahoni, pfumu a Ngipiti. Falahoni asilisi Yosefi, na abyalisi nde mutumi a tsi a Ngipiti yoosi na ŋa yulu nzo a pfumu yoosi.<verse eid="ACT 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11" />Na limbunga laayabwa mu tsi a Ngipiti yoosi na mu tsi a Kanana. Lo laabehi munyongi wu afulala iteesi, na bakaaha ba bisu a baakabwebaha byudya ve. <verse eid="ACT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12" />Bu Yakobi hayuhi ti hu Ngipiti hwaba na byudya, nde atsindihi bakaaha ba bisu huuna tsindaha latsomi, mu uyasumba byudya. <verse eid="ACT 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13" />Mu tsindaha la mole, Yosefi ayayabaana huli bakulu ba nde. Buuna Falahoni abwani bakulu baa Yosefi, na ayabi huni nde hamati. <verse eid="ACT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14" />Titswene Yosefi atsindihi baatu mu uyavolo taata a nde Yakobi, na ibaandu hya nde hyoosi. Bo aba litangu maku tsambu baatu bataanu (75). <verse eid="ACT 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15" />Yakobi ayeni hu tsi a Ngipiti, te bu nde hakwidi, napa bakaaha ba bisu. <verse eid="ACT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16" />Baabiti bamvumbi ba bo hu bula bwa Siseme, na baadiihi bo mu ngila yi Abrahami hasumbi mu mbongo huli baana ba Hamoli, hu bula bwa Siseme.<verse eid="ACT 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17" />Bu taangu yi ukuhasa nzuhisini li Nzambi hasiidi huli Abrahami yaba bebele, baatu ba bisu baakabutasana na baapfuni hu unzuhisini hu tsi a Ngipiti. <verse eid="ACT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18" />Ilumbu imosi, baatsahisi pfumu wu munyatihi wu atumi tsi a Ngipiti. Nde a hatsikihi Yosefi ve. <verse eid="ACT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19" />Pfumu mo wuuna apfuti ibaandu hya bisu, na unyongese bakaaha ba bisu. Nde atumisi bo mu utimba bikenyi bya bo mana byo bikwa.<verse eid="ACT 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20" />Ni mu taangu mo yiina, baabuti mwaana mumosi nduhi Moose. Nde aba mwaana wu mubwe ŋa busu bwa Nzambi. Baabungili nde mu batsungi batatu mu nzo a taata a nde. <verse eid="ACT 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21" />Mu taangu yi baatimbi nde hu mbadi, mukaasu mumosi, mwaana a Falahoni atoli nde, na abungili nde we mwaana a nde mwakulu. <verse eid="ACT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22" />Ni huuna, Moose hayihi nzaabili yoosi ya bisu Ngipiti. Nde abahi matwala ma manene mu bitoyili na mu mavaanga ma nde. <verse eid="ACT 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23" />Bu Moose hatoosi maku mana (40) ma bilima, nde atsimi uyamono baana ba ngu a nde baa ibaandu, bisu Isereli. <verse eid="ACT 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24" />Nde amoni musi Ngipiti mumosi, mu ubeete musi Isereli. Moose avolili nde mileembe. Na mu ufutala pindu, Moose adubi musi Ngipiti mo wuuna. <verse eid="ACT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25" />Moose atsimi ti baana bangu a nde bisu Isereli, bu utsikaha ti Nzambi tondi usalila nde mu uyobolo bo. Ka bo a baakatsikaha tso hole ve. <verse eid="ACT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26" />Ŋa ngwali, Moose amono bisu Isereli boole mu ulwana, nde atondi ufutala hyenze ŋa hati la bo. Nde aleeli bo: “Benu ti baana ba ngu lili. Ka mu hima lili mu ulwana benu mo na benu mo?” <verse eid="ACT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27" />Ka muutu wu akwamisi wuna, atsindihili Moose na uleele nde: “Na asoolo we mu uba mukuutu na nzonzi ŋa hati la bisu? <verse eid="ACT 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28" />We kaka me tondi uduba, we bu we aduba musi Ngipiti matsiha?” <verse eid="ACT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29" />Moose ayuha buuna, nde abati na ayatsahala hu tsi a Madyani. Huuna, nde abuti baana boole ba babahala<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:3-10">Pal 2.3-10</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 2:11-15">11-15</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 2:21-22">21-22</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 18:3-4">18.3-4</ref></char></note>.<verse eid="ACT 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30" />Bilima maku mana (40) bivyoho, pofi mumosi ayamonehele na Moose hutso a kumu a nzala, bebele na isyelo hya Sinayi. Pofi ayamonehele mu ludi la mbaahu, li laakalulaha mu muti nga matsyende. <verse eid="ACT 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31" />Moose akimuhi bu nde hamoni imono-miisu mo hina. Ka bu nde hakayasusaha mu utsikaha ŋa bebele, nde ayuhi ndaha a Pfumu yaleeli: <verse eid="ACT 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32" />“Me ni Nzambi bakaaha ba we, Nzambi ya Abrahami, ya Isaki na ya Yakobi!” Bu hakatsula likamba mu boomo, Moose a habweyehele utala ve.<verse eid="ACT 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33" />Pfumu aleeli nde: “Kuula bikoodi bya we mu miilu, mu tooni ati, mbuha yi we ateleme, yili mbuha ya ngidi. <verse eid="ACT 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34" />Me amono buni bali mu unyongese baatu ba me hu tsi a Ngipiti. Me anzuha mibima mya bo na me anza mu uyobolo bo. Bunuubu yene! Me tondi utsindaha we hu tsi a Ngipiti<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:1-10">Pal 3.1-10</ref></char></note>.” <verse eid="ACT 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35" />Moose mo wunuuwu, wu bisu Isereli banyanzi na uleele: “Na asoolo we mu uba mutumi na nzonzi?” Nzambi atsindaha nde mu uba mukuutu na muyobili, mu likumbasa la pofi wu ayamonehele na nde mu mbaahu mu muti nga matsyende<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:14">Pal 2.14</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36" />Ni Moose apalisi bisu Isereli hu Ngipiti, na ubaavanga bimangu na biliimbu mu tsi mo yiina. Nde asiidi buuna kaka, hu Mubu wu abenge na hu kumu a nzala, mu maku mana (40) ma bilima<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 7:3">Pal 7.3</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 14:21">14.21</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 14:33">Mat 14.33</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37" />Ni Moose mo wunuuwu kaka, abweleele huli bisu Isereli ti: “Nzambi upalisa ŋa hati la benu mumbihuli we me, wu uba inama hya buli la benu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:15">Pfu 18.15</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 18:18">18</ref> </char></note>.” <verse eid="ACT 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38" />Ŋa yulu a ŋana, bu buli la baatu ba Isereli laba laakuukama hu kumu a nzala, nde ni wu akateleme na bakaaha ba bisu. Nde aba kaka na pofi wu akatoyo na nde ŋa yulu isyelo hya Sinayi. Nde ayaki mambu ma moonyi ma Nzambi, mu utoosele bisu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:1-20:17">Pal 19.1–20.17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:1-33">Pfu 5.1-33</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39" />Ka bakaaha ba bisu baabisi usiingala nde. Bo baanyasuli nde hutso mutima, bo baafutihi hu Ngipiti<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:3">Mat 14.3</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40" />Bo baayaleele Aroni: “Vangila bisu binza-nzambi bi byukaabita bisu. Mu tooni ati, bisu a liyabi ki dyaambu laamiibwila Moose wu apalisa bisu mu Ngipiti ve<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:1">Pal 32.1</ref></char></note>.” <verse eid="ACT 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41" />Bo baavangi ifwita hya mwaana a ngombe, na bo baaviidi bungodu huli ifwita mo hiina. Bo baasangili mavaanga ma myoho mya bo<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:2-6">Pal 32.2-6</ref></char></note>mu kinya. <verse eid="ACT 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42" />Ka Nzambi atehili bo mbisa, na anyahi bo bayusa bamvwelele baa hu yulu, we bu baasonehe mu muhanda mimbihuli:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">“Buli li Isereli, mu mbuli, ni huli me</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">benu laayeholo banyama na bungodu bukima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">mu maku mana (40) ma bilima hutso a kumu a nzala?<verse eid="ACT 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43" />Naana, benu laabiti binza-nzambi bya benu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">nzo a ngooto ya Molooke,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">benu laabiti ifwaani hya mvwelele a benu Refani.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">Ni bifwita bya benu bi laavaangi mu myoho mya benu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">mu ukongemene na usalila byo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">Ni mu buuna, me utsindaha benu lala mu buviha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">na tsi a Babylooni<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 5:25-27">Amo 5.25-27</ref></char></note>.”<verse eid="ACT 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44" />Hutso a kumu, bakaaha ba bisu, baaba na nzo a ngooto, huuna hwaba na kasu a ngidi ya nzuhisini la Nzambi. Baatungi yo we bu Nzambi havidi tumili huli Moose, mu uduukala ifwaani hi nde hamoni. <verse eid="ACT 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45" />Humbisa, baaviidi nzo mo a ngooto, huli tungi li laakaduuka bakaaha ba bisu. Bo baabiti yo, ŋa bo baaba hutso lituma la Yosuwa. Bo baabiti yo mu tsi yi bo baapatuli huli baatu bakima, baa Nzambi habingi ŋa busu bwa bo. Yo yakwilili huuna natee mu taangu a pfumu Davidi. <verse eid="ACT 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46" />Davidi abahi hyese hya Nzambi, na avondi nde muswa mu utunga mbuha yi bikiisa bya Yakobi byukasambila Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47" />Ka monwaani, ni mwaana a nde Soolomo atungili nde yo. <verse eid="ACT 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48" />Ka Nzambi a Pungu, a hubaatsahala mu manzo ma baatu baatunga mu myoho mya bo ve. We bu baasonehe mu libuuku la mumbihuli:<verse eid="ACT 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49" />“Pfumu aleeli: ‘Yulu ni kiti-ipfumu hya me,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">na toto ni isuusili hya me hya miilu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">Ki pila a nzo litondi utungala me?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">Ŋa ki mbuha me utwala upuma?<verse eid="ACT 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50" />Me ni wu avanga bi byosi mu myoho mya me<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.50 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:1-2">Esa 66.1-2</ref></char></note>!’”<verse eid="ACT 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51" />Benu baatu ba lili na mitswe ngolo. Mitima mya benu mili ngototo, na matswi ma benu maakinda mu mambila ma Nzambi. Benu libaabisa usiingala taangu yoosi Livupu la Ngidi! Benu lili we bakaaha ba benu! <verse eid="ACT 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52" />Ki mumbihuli bakaaha ba benu baavelitsuta? Bo baadubi boosi ba baayayabisa nziili a wuuna wu asungama. Na bunuubu, nde ni wu benu laayehuli na laadubi. <verse eid="ACT 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53" />Benu laayaki mikele mya Nzambi mu likumbasa li bapofi, na benu a laakeeli myo ve.»<verse eid="ACT 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baadubi Etyene mu mamanya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54" />Baatu ba pfuundu banzonzi baadasuhi hu unzuhisini, bu baayuhi mambu mo maana. Mu tooni a mambu ma Etyene, bo baakakwete miinyu ma bo na kesi yoosi. <verse eid="ACT 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55" />Ka nde, bu haba wu aluula mu Livupu la Ngidi, atali hu yulu. Nde amoni muyusu a Nzambi, na Yisu ateleme ŋa mbahala a Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56" />Nde aleeli: «Yuhaani, me ndi mu umono mayulu bwasi, na Mwana a Muutu ateleme ŋa mbahala a Nzambi!» <verse eid="ACT 7:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57" />Bo baafulihi mu mifudi, na bo baadibuhi matswi ma bo. Bo boosi mu itwadi baayitumini ŋa yulu a nde. <verse eid="ACT 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58" />Bo baapalisi nde hu mbadi musyenge, na baalangi nde mamanya mu tooni uduba nde. Bambangi baasiisi bikutu bya bo ŋa miilu mi mufudu mbahala mumosi nduhi Sahuli, mu ukeelese byo. <verse eid="ACT 7:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59" />Bu baakalanga nde mamanya, Etyene akasambila bunuubu: «Pfumu Yisu, yaka iluunzi hya me!» <verse eid="ACT 7:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60" />Titswene nde atsokimi na afulihi mu mifudi: «Pfumu, sa bo kolo-kolo mu lisumu mo linili!» Bu nde hamani uleele buuna, nde amani muvumu.<verse eid="ACT 7:60" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1" />Na Sahuli asilisi lipfu la Etyene.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="ACT 8:1">Sahuli miikwamisa libundu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:1">Ilumbu mo ni hiina, hwabaandihi mbingisili yinene mu Libundu la Yeruselemi. Banga hiitu boosi, vengo biluumbi, baatsamuhi mu bitaanzi bya Yuda na Samariya. <verse eid="ACT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2" />Baatu ba baakiinza Nzambi, baayadiiha mvumbi a Etyene na baalili hu unzuhisini mu tooni lipfu la nde. <verse eid="ACT 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3" />Sahuli, akahwada mu utsala Libundu. Nde akakoto mu pasi nzo, akakaanga banga hiitu, babahala na bakaasu, na ubaabwaha bo mu kondaayi.<verse eid="ACT 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Filipo miiyalongese mambu ma Nzambi hu itaanzi hya Samariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4" />Banga hiitu ba baatsamuhi baakataangila tsi, na ubaayabisa Tsangu yi Mbwe. <verse eid="ACT 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5" />Filipo ayeni hu musyenge a Samariya, na akayabisa Kristo huli baatu. <verse eid="ACT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6" />Bu makonge maakayuha nde, na ubaamono bipadi bya kimuhili bi nde hakasa, baatu boosi baasiidi hiitu mu mambu ma Filipo hakaleele. <verse eid="ACT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7" />Mu mbuli, mavupu ma mabi maakapala mu baatu ba banzuhisini, na maakafulaha mu mifudi. Bikata na banga matsode ba banzuhisini baabeluhi. <verse eid="ACT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8" />Buuna, baatu ba musyenge woosi baaba mu kinya yindahi. <verse eid="ACT 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9" />Bahala limosi nduhi Simoni, wu aba amiiteehele hu musyenge mo wuuna, akasa mavingu, akakimusa bisu Samariya na nde akamonehele ti nde muutu wa tsongo. <verse eid="ACT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10" />Baatu boosi, umata bangebe natee bakuutu, baakakangama na nde, na ubaaleele: «Muutu mo wunuuwu, ni litwala la Nzambi li bubaateele ti “Litwala li Linene”.» <verse eid="ACT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11" />Bo baakakangama na nde mu tooni ati, nde aba amiidinga na ubaakimusa bo mu mavaanga ma nde ma mavingu. <verse eid="ACT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12" />Ka bu makonge ma baatu maasiidi hiitu mu Tsaangu Yimbwe yi Filipo hakayabisa bo mu Ipfumu hya Nzambi na mu Yisu Kristo, babahala na bakaasu boosi baayaki tondihili. <verse eid="ACT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13" />Simoni nde mwakulu asiidi hiitu, na ayaki tondihili, nde a habwetahuha na Filipo ve. Na nde akakimuha mu bimangu na bipadi bibinene bi byakavangama.<verse eid="ACT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14" />Bu biluumbi bi byaba hu Yeruselemi byayuhi ti bisu Samariya baasiingi mambu ma Nzambi, bo baatsindihi Peetelo na Yowani. <verse eid="ACT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15" />Bu biluumbi bi byole byatoodi hu Samariya, baasambili mu banga hiitu mana bo bayaka Livupu la Ngidi. <verse eid="ACT 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16" />Mu tooni ati, Livupu la Ngidi aba kini a laabwa ŋa yulu a pasi muutu mu bo ve. Bo baayaki tondihili ndulu ya mu nduhi a Pfumu Yisu. <verse eid="ACT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17" />Buuna, Peetelo na Yowani baasuusili bo myoho, na bo baayaki Livupu la Ngidi.<verse eid="ACT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Peetelo miipamina Filipo nga mavingu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18" />Bu Simoni hamoni ti banga hiitu baayaki Livupu la Ngidi humbisa a hu biluumbi byasuusili bo myoho, nde abehili bo mbongo na aleeli: <verse eid="ACT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19" />«Vaani me kaka matwala mo maana, mana pasi nde wu me utsuusala myoho, ayaka Livupu la Ngidi.» <verse eid="ACT 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20" />Ka Peetelo afutili huli nde: «Nyaha mbongo a we yinyambaana na we mwakulu! We tsimi ti, bungodu bwa Nzambi utwala usumba bwo mu mbongo? <verse eid="ACT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21" />We a hali na kabu tso muswa mutso musamu mo wunuuwu ve. Mu tooni ati, mutima a we a hali wu asungama ŋa miisu ma Nzambi ve. <verse eid="ACT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22" />Ni mu buuna, maasa tsimi a we yimbi mu mutima a we. Vondo huli Pfumu asa we kolo-kolo, tso nde tondi, bu we bahi tsimi mo yiina. <verse eid="ACT 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23" />Mu mbuli, me ndi mu umono ti we aluula mu nyengi, na we li muviha a masumu.» <verse eid="ACT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24" />Simoni ni uleele huli Peetelo na Yowani: «Sambilaani Pfumu benu mwakulu mu tooni a me, mana pasi dyaambu livelebwila me mu moosi ma benu lileeli me.» <verse eid="ACT 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25" />Bu baamani uta imbangi mu Yisu Kristo, mu ubaayabisa mambu ma Pfumu, biluumbi bi byole byafutihi hu Yeruselemi. Mu nzila, bo baakayabisa Tsaangu Yimbwe mu mala ma malahi ma Samariya.<verse eid="ACT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Filipo atondihi mutumi mumosi a Etyopi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26" />Pofi a Pfumu mumosi aleeli huli Filipo: «Yene hu tsyelo a Sude, mu nzila yi yibaakulamana umata hu musyenge a Yeruselemi natee hu musyenge a Ngaza, yibaavyohele mu kumu a nzala.» <verse eid="ACT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27" />Mu mawasa Filipo atelimi na ayeni. Nde abiisili muutu wu baaba baavangula, musi tsi a Etyopi mumosi, mukuutu wu munene mu Etyopi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.27 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mukuutu wu munene mu Etyopi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mu tsi a Etyopi, babahala ba baakasala huli Kandaase baaba baavangula.</char></note>. Nde akakeelese busina bwa Kandaase, pfumu wu mukaasu hu Etyopi. Nde wuuna wu ayidi hu Yeruselemi mu uyasambila Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28" />Na nde akafutaha hu tsi a nde. Nde aba atsahala ŋa yulu likuumbi li babuuru baakaduta. Akabaatanga itini hi muhanda wu mumbihuli Esaya. <verse eid="ACT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29" />Livupu la Ngidi laaleeli huli Filipo: «Yene bebele na likuumbi mo liina.» <figure style="fig" alt="Musi tsi a Etyopi" file="CN01932B.TIF" size="span" loc="8.26" copy="David C. Cook New Testament Illustrations" ref="8.28">Musi tsi a Etyopi</figure> <verse eid="ACT 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30" />Filipo ayeni tiinu, na nde ayuhi musi Etyopi mu utanga mambu ma mu muhanda wu mumbihuli Esaya. Buuna Filipo afuuli nde: «We li mu utsikaha ma we li mu utaanga?» <verse eid="ACT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31" />Bahala ni ufutala nde ti: «Buni me utwala utsikaha mo, tso muutu a habinduli me mo ve?» Na nde avondi Filipo mu uvata na mu utsahala ŋa pedu a nde. <verse eid="ACT 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32" />Mambu ma nde hakataanga maakaleele bunuubu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">«Nde aba we limeme li bali mu ubita hu idubili.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">Nde aba we mwaana limeme wu avele na ndaha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">ŋa busu bwa muutu wu uli mu upfuha lo myoso.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">Nde a hadibuli munywa ve.<verse eid="ACT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33" />Baamweesi nde tsonyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">na baatsundisi nde hwavele butsiitsa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:33">Na uva tsangu bikiisa bya nde?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:33">Ka baakesi idiingu hya nde ŋa toto<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:7-8">Esa 53.7-8</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="ACT 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34" />Musi Etyopi afuuli Filipo: «Kolo-kolo a we, leele me, mu tooni a na mumbihuli ali mu uyambila bunuubu? Mu nde mwakulu, vo mu muutu mukima?» <verse eid="ACT 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35" />Na Filipo abaandihi ubindula nde mambu mo maana, na ayabisi nde Tsaangu Yimbwe ya Yisu. <verse eid="ACT 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36" />Bu baaba mu nzila, bo baayato ŋa mbuha mosi yi yaba na mamba. Buuna musi Etyopi aleeli: «Mono mamba, hima hyukondosono me mu uyaka tondihili a me?» [<verse eid="ACT 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:37" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Itsudu mohi hyo ve mu mabuuku makima: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Filipo aleeli: «Tso we siidi hiitu mu mutima a we woosi, we utwala uyaka tondihili a we.» Nde afutili: «Me ndi na hiitu ti Yisu Kristo li Mwana a Nzambi.»</char></note>] <verse eid="ACT 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38" />Nde atsikimisi likuumbi. Filipo akulimini na nde hutso a mamba, na atondihi nde. <verse eid="ACT 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39" />Bu bo baapali hutso a mamba, mawasa-mawasa, Livupu la Pfumu laamasi Filipo ŋa mbuha mo yiina. Mutumi a habwemono nde ve. Ka nde akaduukala nzila a nde na kinya yoosi. <verse eid="ACT 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40" />Filipo amonihili hu musyenge a Azoti, titswene nde akayene mu misyenge myosi mu ubaayayabisa baatu ba huuna Tsaangu Yimbwe, natee bu nde hatoodi hu musyenge a Sezare.<verse eid="ACT 8:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9" />
  <para style="s1">Sahuli miikingula buyedi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="ACT 22:6-16">22.6-16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:9-20">26.9-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1" />Mu taangu mo yiina, Sahuli a hakoli ukanina na usaha nzila yi uduba bayihi ba Pfumu ve. Nde ayamono mukuutu bangaanga ba Nzambi, <verse eid="ACT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2" />avondi nde mihanda mi uva nde muswa a kotili mu manzo ma masambulu ma Bayudaayo ma hu musyenge a Damaseko. Nde hasiidi buuna, mana bu nde hu ubiisa baatu, babahala tso bakaasu, ba baakaduukala nzila a Pfumu, nde akaanga bo na ubita bo hu musyenge a Yeruselemi. <verse eid="ACT 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3" />Sahuli akayene hu Damaseko, nde aba bebele na musyenge mowuna. Mu mawasa, liyalala laamati hu yulu na laayadiinga nde. <verse eid="ACT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4" />Nde abwidi ŋa toto na ayuhi ndaha mosi yakaleele nde: «Sahuli, Sahuli, mu hima we li mu ukwamisa me?» <verse eid="ACT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5" />Sahuli afuuli: «We ni na Pfumu?» Na ndaha yayahuli: «Me ni Yisu, wu we li mu ukwamisa. <verse eid="ACT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6" />Ka teleme, koto mutso musyenge mowuna, na huuna sa baleele we ma we afwana uvanga.» <verse eid="ACT 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7" />Bambaahi baa mudyenge baa Sahuli baatsikimi, hwavele a ndaha mu tsisu. Bo baakayuha ndaha, ka bo a baakamono muutu ve. <verse eid="ACT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8" />Buuna Sahuli atelimi, ka nde adibula miisu, a hakabwemono ve. Baakangi nde mu hoho na baayeni na nde hu musyenge a Damaseko. <verse eid="ACT 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9" />Mu bilumbu bitatu, nde aba inzimana, hwavele udya na unywa.<verse eid="ACT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10" />Kaahu hu musyenge a Damaseko, hwaba na muyihi mumosi nduhi a nde Ananya. Pfumu ayamonehele na nde mu imono-miisu na aleeli nde: «Ananya!» Nde ayahuli: «Me ndyowu, Pfumu.» <verse eid="ACT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11" />Pfumu aleeli nde: «Yene masulubete mu nzila yi bali mu uteele “nzila yi yasungama”, mu nzo a Yuda. We fuula muutu wu bubaateele Sahuli, musi Tarese. Nde mu usambila ali mu taangu yi. <verse eid="ACT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12" />Mu imono-miisu, nde ni umono bahala limosi nduhi a nde Ananya, mu ukoto mu nzo a nde na mu usuusala nde myoho, mana miisu ma nde madibuma.»<verse eid="ACT 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13" />Ananya afutili: «Pfumu, baatu ba balahi baabehele me tsangu a muutu mo wunuuwu na uyabisa ma mabi ma nde ali mu uvangila ba we bangidi babali hu musyenge a Yeruselemi. <verse eid="ACT 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14" />Na nde miiya huni na lituma li bakuutu ba bangaanga ba Nzambi baaviidi nde, mu ukaanga boosi ba bubaasambila we.» <verse eid="ACT 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15" />Ka Pfumu afutili huli Ananya: «Yene, ka me miitsoolo nde mana me tsalila nde. Ni nde uyayabisa nduhi a me huli boosi ba baavele Bayudaayo na bapfumu ba bo, napa huli bisu Isereli. <verse eid="ACT 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16" />Me tsa mweese nde me mwakulu, mapasi moosi ma nde humono mu nduhi a me.»<verse eid="ACT 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17" />Humbisa, Ananya ayeni, na akoti mu nzo. Nde asuusili Sahuli myoho, na aleeli nde: «Sahuli, mwaana a ngu a me, Pfumu Yisu wu ayamonehele na we mu nzila yi we akayiila mu yo, miitsindaha me huli we. We sa bwemono na we sa luula mu Livupu la Ngidi.» <verse eid="ACT 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18" />Mu mawasa, mu miisu ma Sahuli, bisiha bi byafwanina na mahahala byabwidi, na miisu ma nde maadibumi. Buuna nde atelimi, na ayaki tondihili. <verse eid="ACT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19" />Titswene nde adidi na abahi mifudi.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="ACT 9:19">Sahuli alongisi Tsaangu Yimbwe hu musyenge a Damaseko</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:19">Sahuli avyosi mwa bilumbu na bayihi ba baaba hu Damaseko. <verse eid="ACT 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20" />Ni mu taangu mo yiina, Sahuli habaandihi ulongese Tsaangu Yimbwe mu manzo ma masambulu ma Bayudaayo. Na nde akayabisa ti Yisu ni Mwana a Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21" />Boosi ba baakayuha nde baakimuhi na baakafulasana: «Be wunuuwu, a ni muutu wu akakwamisa mu mifudi baatu ba baakayusa Nzambi mu nduhi a Yisu hu musyenge a Yeruselemi ve? Na nde a hayidi huni mu usa ukana, mu uyakaanga bo na ubita bo huli bakuutu ba bangaanga ba Nzambi ve?» <verse eid="ACT 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22" />Ka matwala ma Sahuli makavyohelele mifudi mu bilongisili bya nde, ti Yisu ni Masiya. Ni mu buuna, Bayudaayo ba hu Damaseko a baabweba na dyaambu li uleele ve.<verse eid="ACT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23" />Bilumbu bi bilahi bivyoho, Bayudaayo baakuti pfuundu mu uduba Sahuli. <verse eid="ACT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24" />Ka baatu baayibusi Sahuli mu pfuundu Bayudaayo yi baakakutala nde. Butsuhu na nyangu, bo baakakeelese bikotili bya mumbu wu akadinga musyenge, mu uduba nde. <verse eid="ACT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25" />Ka ŋa butsuhu, bayihi ba Sahuli baabiti nde mana bavyoso nde hu yulu a mumbu a musyenge. Bo baasutisi nde mutso a poonzi.<verse eid="ACT 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baranabasi miimweese Sahuli huli biluumbi, hu Yeruselemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26" />Bu nde hayato hu musyenge a Yeruselemi, Sahuli ayehili upfuutana na bayihi. Ka boosi baaba na boomo bwa nde, mu tooni a bu baaveli na hiitu ti mbuli nde kaka muyihi a Yisu. <verse eid="ACT 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27" />Baranabasi avoli nde, abiti nde huli biluumbi. Nde ayabisi bo buni Sahuli hamoni Pfumu mu nzila, na buni Pfumu hatoyi na nde. Nde abweyabisa bo ka buni Sahuli halongisi mu nduhi a Yisu na hiitu hyoosi hu musyenge a Damaseko. <verse eid="ACT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28" />Umata taangu mo yiina, Sahuli aba itwadi na biluumbi. Nde akayene na uya mutso musyenge a Yeruselemi na ubaayambila na hiitu hyoosi mu nduhi a Pfumu. <verse eid="ACT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29" />Nde akabaamoho ka na Bayudaayo ba baakayambila ndaha yi Bangeleke, na usanzasana matsimi na bo. Ka bo baniiba, baakasaha uduba nde. <verse eid="ACT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30" />Ŋa banga hiitu baayabi dyaambu mo lina, bo baabiti Sahuli hu musyenge a Sezare. Umata huuna, bo baatsindihi nde hu musyenge a Tarese.<verse eid="ACT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31" />Libundu laaba mu hyenze mu bitaanzi byosi bya Yuda, bya Ngalili, na bya Samariya. Livupu la Ngidi laakakulasa libundu mu hiitu, na mu likiinzu la Pfumu. Litangu la banga hiitu laabwefulala bunzuhisini mu likumbasa li Livupu la Ngidi.<verse eid="ACT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Peetelo miibeeloso Ene wu ararama mikangi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32" />Peetelo wu akataangila tsi yoosi, ayeni ilumbu imosi huli banga hiitu, ba baakatsahala hu musyenge a Lida. <verse eid="ACT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33" />Huuna, nde amoni bahala limosi, nga nduhi a Ene, wu aba ararama mikangi. Nde aba baalaasa ŋa taangi umata bilima poombo. <verse eid="ACT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34" />Peetelo ni uleele nde: «Ene, Yisu Kristo miibeeloso we! Teleme na vanga taangi a we, we mwakulu.» Mu mawasa, Ene atelimi. <verse eid="ACT 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35" />Bisu Lida boosi na baatu ba hu kumu a Saroni, bu baamoni nde, baasobi mbiili na baasiidi hiitu hya bo mu Pfumu.<verse eid="ACT 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hu musyenge a Yafa, Peetelo asuuli Dolokasi mu lipfu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36" />Hwaba hu musyenge a Yafa, mukaasu nga hiitu mu Yisu, nga nduhi a Tabita, mbindulili a yo mu ndaha yi Bangeleke «Dolokasi» buuve «tsyesi». Nde aba taangu yoosi ubaavanga ma mabwe na ubaava likumbasa huli biyaha. <verse eid="ACT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37" />Mu taangu mo yiina, nde akoto mu mbeelili, nde ni ukwa. Bu baamani uswaha mvumbi a nde, baasuusi yo mu itini hya nzo hya hu yulu. <verse eid="ACT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38" />Bayihi ba hu musyenge a Yafa baayaabi ti Peetelo aba hu musyenge a Lida. Musyenge mowuna aba bebele na Yafa. Bo baatsindihi nde babahala boole mu uyayabisa nde ti: «Kolo-kolo a we, a hadiinga mu uya huli bisu». <verse eid="ACT 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39" />Peetelo atelimi, ayeni na bo. Bu nde hayato, baabiti nde hu itini hya nzo hya hu yulu. Bakwili boosi baayasusaha bebele na nde mu ulila. Bo baamweesi nde bikutu na biyunga bi Tabita hatungi ŋa nde haba kini moonyi. <verse eid="ACT 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40" />Peetelo atumi upalisa baatu boosi hu mbadi. Titswene nde atsokimi na asambili Nzambi. Nde akinguhi hu tsyelo a mvumbi, na aleeli: «Tabita, teleme!» Tabita adibuli miisu, na bu hamoni Peetelo, nde atsahili. <verse eid="ACT 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41" />Peetelo akaangi hoho hwa nde na atelimisi nde. Nde ateeli banga hiitu na bakwili, na nde amweesi bo Tabita wu aba moonyi. <verse eid="ACT 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42" />Tsangu yatsaamuhi mu musyenge woosi wa Yafa, na ba banzuhisini baasobi mbiili a bo na baasiidi hiitu mu Pfumu. <verse eid="ACT 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43" />Peetelo atsahili matangu ma malahi hu musyenge a Yafa, huli mutsonzihi a bibaanda bi banyama, nga nduhi a Simoni.<verse eid="ACT 9:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10" />
  <para style="s1">Korineye miimono imono-miisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1" />Hu musyenge a Sezare, hwaba na muutu mumosi nduhi Korineye. Nde aba mukuutu a buli la kama (100) li balwani baa musyenge a Looma, wu bubaateele ti «konge ya Itali». <verse eid="ACT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2" />Nde na ikuta hya nde hyoosi, baakakiinza Nzambi, mu mifudi mya nde myosi. Akabaakwila lingebe na ubaakumbasa biyaha bi Bayudaayo. Nde akasambila Nzambi taangu yoosi. <verse eid="ACT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3" />Ilumbu imosi, bebele na ngunga yi matatu ya humbisa a mwangulu, nde asi imono-miisu. Nde amoni paayalala pofi a Nzambi mu ukoto mu nzo a nde. Pofi ateeli nde: «Korineye!» <verse eid="ACT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4" />Korineye atali pofi, na likamba loosi, na aleeli nde: «Ki dyaambu Pfumu?» Pofi afutili nde: «Masambulu ma we na kwili a we lingebe mu biyaha, bi miikumasa huli Nzambi. Na Nzambi miiyuha masambulu ma we na uyaka mo we bungodu. Nde miiyibwala we moonyi. <verse eid="ACT 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5" />Bunuubu, tsindaha baatu hu musyenge a Yafa, bo bayavolo muutu mumosi wu bubaateele Simoni, nga kuumbu Peetelo. <verse eid="ACT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6" />Nde li mu utsahala huli muutu mukima nga nduhi a Simoni, wu uli mutaandi bibaanda bi banyama. Nzo a nde yili ŋa muvanga mubu.» <verse eid="ACT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7" />Bu pofi wu akatoyo na nde hayeni, Korineye ateeli basalili ba nde boole na lisadaadu limosi, muutu wu asungama. Nde li ŋa hati la ba baabaambana na nde. <verse eid="ACT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8" />Humbisa ayabisi bo moosi ma nde hamoni, Korineye atsindihi bo hu Yafa.<verse eid="ACT 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Peetelo miimono imono-miisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9" />Mu ilumbu hya ndaanda, bu baatu ba Korineye hatsindihi baaba mu nzila bebele na Yafa, Peetelo avati hu yulu lipombo li ibaanga mu usambila Nzambi. Hwaba aka ngunga ya bebele na mwangulu. <verse eid="ACT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10" />Nzala yafwengi nde na asahi udya. Bu baakavangimasa nde byudya, nde ayenduhi mu Livupu na asi imono-miisu. <verse eid="ACT 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11" />Nde amoni yulu laadibuma, na isiha imosi hyakakulamana mu ifwaani hya tsanda yi baakaanga mu matsoso ma mana. Isiha mo hina, hyakasutaha ŋa toto. <verse eid="ACT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12" />Hutso a tsanda mo yiina, hwaba na bibulu bya pila mu pila. Bibulu bya miilu mina byosi, na bibulu bya toto bi bibaayene mu bali, na banyunyi baa hu yulu.<figure style="fig" alt="Peetelo miimono imono-miisu" file="cn01945B.tif" size="col" loc="10.12" copy="David C. Cook New Testament Illustrations" ref="10.12">Peetelo miimono imono-miisu</figure> <verse eid="ACT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13" />Ndaha mosi yaleeli nde: «Teleme, Peetelo, duba na dya!» <verse eid="ACT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14" />Ka Peetelo afutili: «Oo! Naana Pfumu! Me kini a handiidi ibaabi ve buuve hi hyavele hya ngidi.» <verse eid="ACT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15" />Mu leele la moole, nde abweyuha ndaha: «Hina hi Nzambi haleele hya ngidi, a hamono hyo hi hyasumaha ve.» <verse eid="ACT 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16" />Nde ayuhi ndaha mo yiina nzuha tatu. Titswene mu mawasa, tsanda mo yiina yakumisi hu yulu.<verse eid="ACT 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17" />Peetelo akasaha mbindulili a imono-miisu hi nde hamoni. Mu taangu mo yiina, baatu ba Korineye hatsindihi, baasahi nzo a Simoni, na bo baayateleme ŋa munywa a nzo a nde. <verse eid="ACT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18" />Bo baateeli na baafuuli tso ni ŋaniiŋa Simoni wu bubaateele Peetelo ubaatsahala? <verse eid="ACT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19" />Buuna, bu Peetelo haba mu utsima mu imono-miisu, Livupu laaleeli nde: «Yuha Peetelo, mono baatu batatu bali mu usaha we. <verse eid="ACT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20" />Kulamana, na yene na bo hwavele matsika, mu tooni ati ni me miitsindaha bo.» <verse eid="ACT 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21" />Peetelo asutihi na aleeli huli baatu mo baana: «Me ni wu benu lili mu usaha. Ki tooni yi ibehi benu ŋaniiŋa?» <verse eid="ACT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22" />Bo baafutili: «Mukuutu balwani Korineye, miitsindaha bisu huli we. Nde li muutu wu asungama na wu ubaakiinza Nzambi. Ni nde wuna, wu Bayudaayo boosi bubaasilasa mbiili. Pofi a Nzambi ayamonehele na nde, na uleele nde atsiha we hu nzo a nde. Muutu mowuna na nzala uyuha mambu ma we uyabisa nde.» <verse eid="ACT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23" />Buuna Peetelo ayaki bo, na alaasi bo mu nzo a nde.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 10:23">Peetelo miiyabwana Korineye hu nzo a nde</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:23">Ŋa ngwali, nde atelimi na ayeni na bo. Banga hiitu bamosi, bisu Yafa, baayeni na nde. <verse eid="ACT 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24" />Ilumbu hya ndaanda, Peetelo atoodi hu musyenge a Sezare. Huuna, Korineye akakeele bo, na nde atsihi ikuta hya nde napa bambaahi ba nde baa mutima. <verse eid="ACT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25" />Bu Peetelo ali mu ukoto mu nzo, Korineye wu ayabwana nde, abwidi ŋa miilu mya nde na akongimini. <verse eid="ACT 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26" />Ka Peetelo atelimisi nde na aleeli: «Teleme, me kaka muutu ndi we we.»<verse eid="ACT 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27" />Bu nde hakamoho na Korineye, nde akoti mu nzo, na abiisi baatu ba banzuhisini baakuukama. <verse eid="ACT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28" />Nde aleeli bo: «Benu liyaabi ti mikele mya bisu myasa itombi huli Muyudaayo mu ubaambana na mwenyi, buuve mu ukoto mu nzo a nde. Ka Nzambi amweese me ti, me a hapfwana umono muutu tso mumosi ti nde ibaabi ali ve, buuve wu avele wa ngidi. <verse eid="ACT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29" />Ni mu buuna, ŋa benu laatsindaha baatu mu uyavolo me, me atsinga uya hwavele matsika. Bunuubu, me tondi uyaaba tooni yi benu laatsiha me.» <verse eid="ACT 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30" />Korineye afutili: «Loloyi huka bilumbu bitatu. Mu ngunga yi matatu ya humbisa a mwangulu, me katsambilanga Nzambi mu nzo a me. Masulubete, muutu mumosi wu alwata bikutu bi bibaamwedeme, ayateleme ŋa busu bwa me. <verse eid="ACT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31" />Nde aleeli: “Korineye, Nzambi miiyuhala lisambulu la we, na miiyibwala moonyi mu likumbasa li we ubaava huli biyaha. <verse eid="ACT 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32" />Tsindaha baatu hu Yafa, bayatsiha muutu mumosi Simoni, nga kuumbu Peetelo. Nde ubaatsahala huli Simoni mukima, wu ubaataanda bibaanda bi banyama. Nzo a nde ŋa muvanga mubu yili.” <verse eid="ACT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33" />Ni mu buuna, me atsindaha baatu mu mawasa huli we, na we vaangi bubwe bu we siingi uya. Bunuubu, bisu boosi baba ŋa busu bwa Nzambi, mu uyuha moosi ma Pfumu hatuma we mu uyabisa bisu.»<verse eid="ACT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Peetelo miiyabisa Musamu wu Mubwe hu nzo a Korineye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34" />Peetelo abaandihi utoyo na aleeli: «Mu mbuli, me miitsikaha ti Nzambi a hali na buraandu ve. <verse eid="ACT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35" />Ka mu pasi tsi, Nzambi ubaayaka pasi nde wu ubaakiinza nde, na wu ubaavanga ma maasungama. <verse eid="ACT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36" />Nde atsindihi biluumbi bya nde huli bisu Isereli, mana bayayabisa bo Musamu wu Mubwe wa hyenze mu Yisu Kristo. Ni nde wu uli Pfumu a baatu boosi. <verse eid="ACT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37" />Monwaani, mambu mo maana moosi maabandihi mu taangu yi Yowani hayabisi ti: “Yakaani tondihili!” Benu liyabi mambu ma maavangimi hu tsi a Ngalili, natee hu itaanzi hya Yuda hyoosi. <verse eid="ACT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38" />Benu liyabi buni Nzambi hasooli Yisu musi Nazareti, na nde aluusi nde mu Livupu la Ngidi na mu matwala ma nde. Benu liyabi ka buni Yisu hakataangila, mu uvanga ma mabwe na ubeloso boosi ba baaba baakangama hu tsina matwala ma mukuyi. Nde hasiidi buuna, bu Nzambi habeedi itwadi na nde. <verse eid="ACT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39" />Bisu lili bambangi baa moosi ma nde hasiidi mu tsi Bayudaayo, na hu Yeruselemi. Nde wuna wu baadubi na wu baakomini ŋa kuruwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40" />Ka Nzambi asuuli nde mu babaakwa mu ilumbu hi bitatu. Na Nzambi aviidi Yisu matwala ma ubwemonehele wa moonyi. <verse eid="ACT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41" />Yisu a hamonihili huli baatu boosi ve, ka ndulu huli bisu, bisu baa lili bambangi baa Nzambi hateehili usoolo. Bisu baa ladiidi na lanywidi na nde, humbisa a tsuuhili a nde ŋa hati la babaakwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42" />Yisu atumi bisu mu ulongese Musamu wu Mubwe huli baatu. Nde atumi bisu mu usilasa ti, nde ni wu Nzambi hatsahisi mu uba nzonzi a babali moonyi na babaakwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43" />Mimbihuli myosi myatiili nde imbangi. Mono imbangi mo: pasi muutu wu usa hiitu mu nde, yaki linyahula li masumu mu matwala ma nduhi a nde.»<verse eid="ACT 10:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Byenyi byayaki Livupu la Ngidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44" />Bu Peetelo haba kini mu utoyo, Livupu la Ngidi laayabwa ŋa yulu a boosi ba baakayuha ibila hya nde. <verse eid="ACT 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45" />Banga a hiitu, babali Bayudaayo ba baayidi na Peetelo, baakimuhi bo boosi. Bo baakimuhi, mu umono ti bungodu bu Livupu la Ngidi, bwakapuhama kaka natee huli ba bavele Bayudaayo. <verse eid="ACT 10:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46" />Mu mbuli, banga hiitu mo baakayuha bo mu uyambila mandaha makima na uyusa bunene bwa Nzambi. Ka Peetelo afuuli bo: <verse eid="ACT 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47" />«Utwala uliha baatu mo baniba, ba baamiiyaka Livupu la Ngidi we bisu, mu utondehe bo mu mamba ve.» <verse eid="ACT 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48" />Buuna Peetelo atumisi ti bo bayaka tondihili mu nduhi a Yisu Kristo. Ba baayaki tondihili, baalembisini Peetelo mu umaakwilala na bo mu mwa matsuhu.<verse eid="ACT 10:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11" />
  <para style="s1">Peetelo aviidi ikuumbu huli libundu la Yeruselemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1" />Biluumbi na baana ba ngu babaaba hu musyenge a Yuda, baayuhi ti baatu ba baavele Bayudaayo kaka, ba baasiingi mambu ma Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2" />Mu taangu yi Peetelo hafutihi hu musyenge a Yeruselemi, Bayudaayo ba baasiingi Yisu, baasyembi nde bu: <verse eid="ACT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3" />«We miikoto huli ba baavelekete, na we miidya na bo!»<verse eid="ACT 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4" />Buuna, Peetelo abinduli bo mu tsiki moosi ma maavyohi. Nde aleeli bunuubu: <verse eid="ACT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5" />«Me ambeedi hu musyenge a Yafa, na me akatsambila. Me amoni mu imono-miisu, isiha imosi hyakakulamana mu ifwaani hya tsanda yi baakaanga mu matsoso ma mana. Isiha mo hina, hyakasutaha ŋa toto natee huli me. <verse eid="ACT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6" />Me akakengese bubwe-bubwe, na me amoni banyama baa miilu mina, bibulu bya bwadi, bibulu bi bibaayene mu bali na banyunyi baa hu yulu. <verse eid="ACT 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7" />Me anzuhi ndaha mosi yakaleele me: “Teleme Peetelo! Duba na dya.” <verse eid="ACT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8" />Ka me apfutili: “Naana! Pfumu, ka me kini a handiidi ibaabi ve, buuve hi hyasumaha.” <verse eid="ACT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9" />Ndaha yabweyuhana hu yulu: “Hina hi Nzambi haleele hya ngidi, a hamono hyo ibaabi tso hyasumaha ve.” <verse eid="ACT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10" />Imono-miisu mo hina hyamonihili monehele tatu, titswene byosi byakambuhi hu yulu.»<verse eid="ACT 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11" />«Ka masulubete, babahala batatu ba baamati hu musyenge a Sezare, baayidi hu nzo yi bisu laaba. <verse eid="ACT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12" />Livupu la Ngidi laaleeli me mu uyene na bo hwavele utsika. Baana baa ngu mu Kristo basamunu ba me anzidi na bo, baayavehese me hu Sezare. Na bisu boosi laakoti mu nzo a mukuutu Korineye. <verse eid="ACT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13" />Korineye ayabisi bisu buni nde hamoni pofi wu akateleme mu nzo a nde na wu akaleele nde ti: “Tsindaha muutu hu musyenge a Yafa mu uyavolo Simoni, nga kuumbu Peetelo. <verse eid="ACT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14" />Nde sa aleele we mambu ma mu ubehele we liyobolo. Liyobolo huli we, natee huli ikuta hya we hyoosi.”»<verse eid="ACT 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15" />«Ŋa me ambaandihi utoyo, Livupu la Ngidi laabwidi ŋa yulu a bo, we bu lo laabwidi ŋa yulu a bisu ŋa mbandu. <verse eid="ACT 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16" />Me anzibwili moonyi mu ma Pfumu haleeli: “Yowani atondihi baatu mu mamba, ka benu, sa batondehe benu mu Livupu la Ngidi.” <verse eid="ACT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17" />Nzambi aviidi bo kabu li bungodu li laafwana. Ni we kabu li nde havidi bisu mu taangu yi bisu laasiidi hiitu mu Pfumu Yisu Kristo. Buuna, na me ambeedi mu ubisala Nzambi?» <verse eid="ACT 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18" />Humbisa uyuha mambu mo maana, bo baavudimini, baayusi Nzambi. Bo baaleeli: «Kaahu mbuli, Nzambi amiiva nzila yi usobo mbiili na yi uyaka moonyi a mbuli, huli ba bavele Bayudaayo.»<verse eid="ACT 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Libundu li musyenge a Antyokya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19" />Mbingisili yi yabwidi mu taangu yi baadubi Etyene, yaatumisi banga hiitu mu utsamuha. Bamosi ŋa hati la bo baayeni natee hu itaanzi hya Fenesiya, hu iliiŋa hya Kipere na hu musyenge a Antyokya. Ka bo baakalongese mambu ma Nzambi ndulu huli Bayudaayo. <verse eid="ACT 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20" />Buuna bakima ŋa hati la bo, ba baaba baa ibiingi hya Kipere na bisu Kilene, bo ka baayeni hu musyenge a Antyokya. Ka bo baakayabisa ka Bangeleke na ulongese bo musamu wu mubwe wa Pfumu Yisu. <verse eid="ACT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21" />Matwala ma Pfumu maabeedi na bo. Ni mu buuna, baatu ba banzuhisini baasiidi hiitu mu Pfumu na baaduukili nde.<verse eid="ACT 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baranabasi ahwadisi libundu la Antyokya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22" />Libundu la Yeruselemi laayuhi tsangu a kinguli buyedi ya baatu mo baana. Lo laatsindihi Baranabasi hu musyenge a Antyokya. <verse eid="ACT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23" />Bu nde hayato huuna, nde amoni buni Nzambi hasyemi ba baasili nde hiitu. Nde amoni kinya na ahwadisi bo boosi mu ukangama na hiitu hyoosi mu Pfumu. <verse eid="ACT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24" />Baranabasi abeedi muutu wu mubwe, wu aluula mu Livupu la Ngidi na mu imiinu mu Nzambi. Baatu ba banzuhisini baabiisili Pfumu. <verse eid="ACT 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25" />Titswene, Baranabasi ayeni hu musyenge a Tarese mu uyasaha Sahuli. <verse eid="ACT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26" />Bu nde hasooli Sahuli, nde abiti nde hu Antyokya. Bo baboole baavyosi ilima hi itindala itwadi mu libundu mo liina. Bo baakalongese mabuli mamanene ma baatu. Hu Antyokya, ni huuna baateeli bayihi ba Yisu hati a tsomi, ti bo «Bakristo».<verse eid="ACT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27" />Mu taangu mo yiina, hwabeedi na mimbihuli mi myamati hu Yeruselemi mu uyene hu Antyokya. <verse eid="ACT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28" />Mumosi mu bo nduhi a nde Angabusi, ayabisi mu matwala ma Livupu la Ngidi ti husaali hole, limbunga lilinene sa liba mu toto yoosi. Limbunga mo liina, laavangimi mu taangu yi pfumu a Looma haba nduhi Koloode. <verse eid="ACT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29" />Bayihi baavoli kesili ti muutu-muutu mu bo, atsindaha likumbasa huli baana ba ngu ba baakatsahala hu itaanzi hya Yuda. <verse eid="ACT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30" />Bo baavangi buuna. Na baatsindihi bungodu mo buuna ŋa myoho mya Baranabasi na Sahuli, huli bakuutu ba libundu baa hu Yuda.<verse eid="ACT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12" />
  <para style="s1">Ndubili a Yaaki, kotili a Peetelo mu kondaayi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1" />Mu taangu mo yiina, pfumu Eloode akaangi baana ba libundu bakima mu unyongese bo. <verse eid="ACT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2" />Nde atumi masadaadu ma nde mu uduba Yaki mwaana a ngu a Yowani mu sabila. <verse eid="ACT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3" />Bu hamoni ti mavaanga mo maana mali mu umweese bakuutu ba Bayudaayo kinya, nde abwetuma ukaanga ka Peetelo. Baakangi nde mu taangu mukungi mapa ma maaveledaana. <verse eid="ACT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4" />Humbisa ukaanga Peetelo na ubwaha nde mu kondaayi, Eloode asuusi mabuli mana ma masadaadu mana-mana mu ukeelese nde. Nde atsimi utsundasa Peetelo ŋa kuungi la baatu, humbisa mukungi a Paake. <verse eid="ACT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5" />Bu baakakeelese Peetelo mu kondaayi, libundu laakasambila Nzambi mu nde taangu yoosi na ibahala.<verse eid="ACT 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pofi miiyobolo Peetelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6" />Mu butsuhu bu bwatehili ilumbu hi Eloode hakiitsundasa Peetelo ŋa kuungi la baatu, Peetelo aba abwamina ŋa hati li masadaadu moole. Baakuti nde mu mapanga moole. Bakeedi bakima baakakeelese ŋa busu bu munywa a nzo a kondaayi. <verse eid="ACT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7" />Masulubete, pofi a Pfumu ayamonehele, na ŋa Peetelo haba, hwaluuli mu liyalala. Pofi anyingisi nde, asuuli nde na aleeli: «Teleme mu mawasa!» Buuna, mapanga ma maaba mu myoho mya nde maabwidi. <verse eid="ACT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8" />Pofi aleeli: «Hada mudi a we a luungu, na kuta bikoodi bya we!» Peetelo asiidi buuna na pofi abwesi: «Lwata iyunga hya we, na duukala me.» <verse eid="ACT 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9" />Peetelo aduukili pofi, na apali mu kondaayi. Ka nde akatsima ti hyo aba imono-miisu. Nde a hakatsikaha moosi ma pofi hakavaanga ve, tso maaba ma mbuli. <verse eid="ACT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10" />Bo baavyohi mbuha bakeedi yatsomi, titswene ya moole, buuna bo baayato ŋa busu bu munywa a nzo bitali, wu akatalisa hu musyenge. Munywa a nzo adibumi mu nde mwakulu. Bu bo baapali na baayasusaha hu tsoso a nzila, mu mawasa, pofi asisi Peetelo.<verse eid="ACT 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11" />Buuna Peetelo apadumini na atsimi: «Bunuubu me miimono bubwe ti mu mbuli, Pfumu miitsindaha pofi a nde. Nde miiyobolo me ŋa myoho mya Eloode. Nde miiyobolo me, mu moosi ma buli li Bayudaayo bakiivangila me.» <verse eid="ACT 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12" />Bu nde hatsikihi buuna, nde ayeni hu nzo a Mariya, ngu a Yowani nga kuumbu Malako. Baatu ba banzuhisini baakuukimi huuna mu usambila Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13" />Peetelo adoodi munywa a nzo. Musalili mumosi wu mukaasu wu bubaateele Roode, ayasusaha mu udibula na ufuula; na doodi. <verse eid="ACT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14" />Nde adihuli ndaha a Peetelo wu ayahuli, na aluuli mu kinya. Teehele nde adibula, nde abingilili uyayabisa ti Peetelo hu mbadi ali ŋa busu bu munywa a nzo. <verse eid="ACT 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15" />Buuna bo baaleeli nde ti: «We ladi li na lo!» Ka nde akwilili mu ubaaleele ti Peetelo hu mbadi ali. Bo baaleeli ti: «Nde ŋana ka Pofi a nde!» <verse eid="ACT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16" />Ka Peetelo akwilili mu udoodo munywa a nzo. Bu bo baadibuli munywa a nzo na baamoni Peetelo, bo baakimuhi boosi bu baamoni nde. <verse eid="ACT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17" />Mu hoho hwa nde, Peetelo avondi bo mu ubaa «swii». Na nde ayabisi bo buni Pfumu hapalisi nde mutso a kondaayi. Nde abwebwese: «Yayabisaani mambu mo maniima huli Yaki na huli baana ba ngu bakima.» Titswene, nde apali na ayeni tsyelo kima. <verse eid="ACT 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18" />Bu busi bwakiidi, muyungisi wu munene aba ŋa hati li masadaadu. Bo baakatsundana: «Ki dyaambu libwili Peetelo!» <verse eid="ACT 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19" />Eloode atumisi baatu mu uyasaha Peetelo, ka bo abaamoni nde ve. Buuna, Eloode atsundisi ba baakakeelese Peetelo. Bu baavelifutala nde mvutu, nde atsindihi baatu mu uduba bo. Humbisa, Eloode asiisi itaanzi hya Yuda, mu uyavyoso taangu hole hu musyenge a Sezare.<verse eid="ACT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lipfu la pfumu Eloode</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20" />Mu taangu mo yiina, Eloode aba na kesi a bisu Tiilo na bisu Sidoni. Ni mu buuna, baatu ba bitaanzi mo biina baayuhisini mu uyamono Eloode. Humbisa baafuti mbongo huli Balasitusi, mukeelisi itini hya nzo a pfumu. Bo baavangi buuna, mana Balasitusi ayalembesene Eloode mu uyuhasana na bo. Mu tooni ati, byudya bya Tiilo na Sidoni ubaamata hu tsi a pfumu Eloode. <verse eid="ACT 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21" />Mu ilumbu hi bo baasooli, Eloode alwati ikutu hya nde hi mifwende, atsahili ŋa kiti a nde yi ipfumu, asiidi ileedi ŋa litandala. <verse eid="ACT 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22" />Baatu baakafulaha: «Wunuuwu, woosi we Nzambi li mu utoyo, ka a muutu ve!» <verse eid="ACT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23" />Mu taangu mo yiina, pofi a Pfumu ateti Eloode, mu tooni ati nde ayaki muyusu wu bubaava huli Nzambi. Mu usyembe nde, misobi myakaatuhi nde mu moonyi, na nde akwidi. <verse eid="ACT 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24" />Ka mambu ma Nzambi maakafulala utsamuha, na baatu ba banzuhisini baakasiinga mo. <verse eid="ACT 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25" />Bu Baranabasi na Sahuli baamani ukuhasa isalu hu Yeruselemi, bo baasiisi Yeruselemi na baabiti Yowani<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.25 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">bo baasiisi Yeruselemi na baabiti Yowani </char><char style="ft" closed="false">hu musyenge a Antyokya. </char></note> wu baakateele ka Malako.<verse eid="ACT 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13" />
  <para style="s1">Livupu la Ngidi limiisoolo Baranabasi na Sahuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1" />Mu tso libundu la Antyokya, hwaba na mimbihuli na milongisi: Baranabasi, Simehoni wu baakateele «Mupindi», Lukiyusi musi Kilene, Manaheni mbaahi a Eloode wu bukenyi, wu akatuma itaanzi hya Ngalili<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Eloode </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Eloode Antipa <char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 3:1">Luk 3.1</ref></char>. </char></note>, na Sahuli. <verse eid="ACT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2" />Ilumbu imosi, bu bo baakasambila Pfumu na bu bo baakadya ikaandi, Livupu la Ngidi laayabisi bo: «Vengolwani Baranabasi na Sahuli, mu tooni isalu hi me ateele bo mu hyo.» <verse eid="ACT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3" />Ni mu buuna, bu baamani udya ikaandi na usambila Nzambi, bo baasuusili bo myoho na baanyahi bo bayene.<verse eid="ACT 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baranabasi na Sahuli hu Kipere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4" />Livupu la Ngidi laatsindihi Baranabasi na Sahuli. Bo baakulimini hu ngulu yi makuumbi ma nzali mu baatsikama, hu bo baanami mu likuumbi la nzali mu uyene hu iliiŋa hya Kipere. <verse eid="ACT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5" />Bu bo baatoodi hu musyenge a Salamineya, bo balongisi mambu ma Nzambi mu manzo ma lisambulu ma Bayudaayo. Yowani nga kuumbu Malako aba itwadi na bo na akabaakumbasa bo. <verse eid="ACT 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6" />Bo baataangili iliiŋa hyoosi natee hu musyenge a Pafosi. Huuna bo baabwani ngaanga mumosi, nduhi a nde Bare-Yisu. Ngaanga mo wuuna aba Muyudaayo, wu akabinuha ti nde mumbihuli a Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7" />Nde aba abaambana na Seregiyusi nga kuumbu Pahulusi, pfumu a iliiŋa mo hina, wu aba muutu nga buyedi. Nde atsihi Baranabasi na Sahuli, bu haba na peyu yi uyuha mambu ma Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8" />Ka ngaanga mowuna, nga nduhi a «Elimasi» mu ndaha Bangeleke, abisi ma bo na akasaha ti pfumu a hasoolo nzila a Kristo. <verse eid="ACT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9" />Buuna Sahuli wu baakateele ka Pahuli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sahuli aba nduhi Bayudaayo yi iluumbi na </char><char style="fq">Pahuli </char> nduhi a nde yi Balooma <char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 22:27-29">22.27-29</ref></char>. </note>, aba wu aluula mu Livupu la Ngidi. Nde asungimini ngaanga. <verse eid="ACT 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10" />Nde aleeli: «We aluula mu mapfuta na bukanyi, mwaana Mukuyi, muboho a byosi bibibwe! Tsikaha utengehe mavaanga ma Pfumu ma maasungama. <verse eid="ACT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11" />Bunuubu yuha bubwe! Hoho hwa Pfumu sa hubwa ŋa yulu a we, we sa baa inzimana, na we a ubwemono liyalala li litadi ve, umata mwaana a taangu.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:11">Masulubete, miisu ma Elimasi maadimi na nde akoti mu butsuhu. Nde akapeebete tsyelo na tsyelo mu usaha muutu wu ukaanga nde mu hoho na ubita nde. <verse eid="ACT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12" />Bu pfumu hamoni ma maavyohi, nde asooli nzila a Kristo. Ndongisili yi baasili nde mu tooni a Pfumu, yakotilili nde mu mutima.<verse eid="ACT 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pahuli na Baranabasi balongisi bisu Antyokya ya Pisidiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13" />Umata hu Pafosi, Pahuli na bakaanga ba nde baakoti likuumbi la nzali na baasabuhi natee hu musyenge a Perege hu tsi a Papfiliya. Yowani nga kuumbu Malako<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Perege: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">musyenge a simu la hu baanda ya itaanzi hya Asiya yi ikeehe. </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yowani nga kuumbu Malako: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">utala </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 2:12">2.12</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 2:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:5">13.5</ref></char>.</note> akabuhi na bo, na afutihi hwa nde hu Yeruselemi. <verse eid="ACT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14" />Bo bamata hu Perege, bo baaduukili nzila a bo na baayato hu musyenge a Antyokya ya Pisidiya. Mu ilumbu hya saba, bo baakoti mu nzo lisambulu yi Bayudaayo na baatsahili. <verse eid="ACT 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15" />Bakuutu ba nzo lisambulu yi Bayudaayo baataangi mambu ma ilumbu mu mikele mya Moose, na mu mabuuku ma mimbihuli. Titswene, baatsindihi muutu mu uleele bo: «Baana baa ngu a me, tso benu na mambu ma uyabisa huli libundu mu uhwadisa lo, leelaani.»<verse eid="ACT 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16" />Pahuli atelimi, asyenuli hoho hwa nde mu uliha kele, na aleeli: «Bisu Isereli na benu baa libaakiinza Nzambi, yuhaani me! <verse eid="ACT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17" />Nzambi a bisu Isereli amiisoolo bakaaha ba bisu. Nde akulisi buli la bisu bu lo laaba mu bumwenyi hu tsi a Ngipiti. Titswene nde apalisi lo mu tsi mo yiina mu matwala ma nde. <verse eid="ACT 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18" />Nde akundi mbiili a lo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">akundi mbiili a lo: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">buuve Nzambi abungili lo <char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 1:7">Pal 1.7</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 12:51">12.51</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 14:34">Mat 14.34</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 1:31">Pfu 1.31</ref></char>. </char></note> mu bilima bebele maku mana mu kumu a nzala. <verse eid="ACT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19" />Humbisa, nde abungisini mabuli tsambu hu tsi a Kanana<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 7:1">Pfu 7.1</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 14:1">Yos 14.1</ref></char></note>. Na nde aviidi itaanzi we mukobe huli buli la nde. <verse eid="ACT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20" />Maana moosi maasiidi bilima bebele maakama mana maku mataanu.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:20">«Ŋa yulu a ŋana, nde aviidi banzonzi huli baakaaha ba bisu natee mu taangu mumbihuli Samweli<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 3:20">1Sa 3.20</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 2:16">Bnz 2.16</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21" />Titswene bo baavondi pfumu mumosi, na Nzambi aviidi bo Sahuli, mwaana a Kiise, wu ibaandu hya Benyamini. Nde atumi mu bilima maku mana. <verse eid="ACT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22" />Nzambi anyasuli Sahuli na atelimisi bo Davidi we pfumu. Nzambi atiili nde imbangi mohi: “Me miimono ti Davidi, mwaana a Yese, nde li muutu wu ubaakuhasa matsimi ma mutima a me, nde sa akuhasa moosi ma litondo la me<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 8:5">1Sa 8.5</ref>,<ref loc="1SA 8:19">19</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 10:21">10.21</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 13:14">13.14</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 16:12">16.12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 89:21">Mkg 89.21</ref></char></note>.” <verse eid="ACT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23" />Mumosi ŋa hati li imbisa hya Davidi aba Yisu, wu Nzambi hasooli mu uba Muyobili a Isereli we bu nde hasiidi nzuhisini. <verse eid="ACT 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24" />Tswamina nziili a Yisu, Yowani alongisi musamu wu mubwe huli buli li Isereli loosi, mu usobo mbiili na uyaka tondihili<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.24 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">usobo mbiili na uyaka tondihili </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mbindulili kima, usobo bipfu buuve ukiingula buyedi </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PRO 1:4">Mak 1.4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:3">Luk 3.3</ref></char>.</note>. <verse eid="ACT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25" />Tangu yi Yowani hasukisi isalu hya nde, nde akaleele: “Benu ubaatsima ti me na ndi? Me a ndi wuna wu benu libaakeele ve. Ka yuhaani: muutu li mu uya humbisa a me, na me a handi tso wu akuha mu uba muviha, mu unyangula midi mi bikoodi bya miilu mya nde ve<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.25 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">unyangula midi mi bikoodi bya miilu mya nde ve </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 1:20">Yow 1.20</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 3:11">Mat 3.11</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 1:7">Mak 1.7</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:16">Luk 3.16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:27">Yow 1.27</ref></char>. </char></note>.”»<verse eid="ACT 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26" />«Baana baa ngu a me, benu baa imbisa hya Abrahami, na baa bubaakiinza Nzambi. Ni huli bisu a benu boosi, Nzambi hatsindaha musamu liyobolo wunuwu. <verse eid="ACT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27" />Ka bisu Yeruselemi na baatumi ba bo a baatsikihi Yisu na ali ve. Ŋa batsundisi nde, bo baakuhisi mambu ma mimbihuli ma bubaataanga pasi ilumbu hya Saba. <verse eid="ACT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28" />Tso bu bo baavelimono tooni mu utsundasa nde mu lipfu, ka bo baavondi huli mutumi Pilaato, mu utuma uduba nde. <verse eid="ACT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29" />Humbisa ukuhasa moosi ma bisono bya Ngidi byayabisi mu tooni a nde, baasutisi nde ŋa kuruwa na baasuusi nde mutso a ngila<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.29 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ngila </char><char style="ft" closed="false">utala </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 27:22-23">Mty 27.22-23</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:13-14">Mlk 15.13-14</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:21-23">Luk 23.21-23</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:15">Yow 19.15</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 19:38">38</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 19:42">42</ref></char>.</note>. <verse eid="ACT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30" />Ka Nzambi asuuli nde mu babaakwa. <verse eid="ACT 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31" />Mu bilumbu bi bilahi, Yisu amonihili huli ba baakadyenge na nde. Ni baatu ba baakayene na nde umata hu itaanzi hya Ngalili natee hu Yeruselemi. Na bunuubu, bo bali bambangi ba nde, ŋa busu bwa bisu Isereli. <verse eid="ACT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32" />Bisu mwakulu lili mu ubehele benu musamu wu mubwe wu Nzambi hasiidi nzuhisini huli bakaaha ba bisu. <verse eid="ACT 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:33" />Bunuubu, Nzambi miikuhasa lo we bu hwafwana huli bisu bikiisa bya bo. Mu usa buuna, Nzambi miisuula Yisu mu babaakwa we bu baasonehe mu Mukuunga wa myole:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:33">“We ni wuli mwaana a me,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:33">loloyi, me mimbuta we<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 2:7">Mik 2.7</ref></char></note>.”<verse eid="ACT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34" />Nzambi ayabisi ti nde sa asuula Yisu ŋa hati la babaakwa mana nyutu a nde a yibolo. Nzambi aleeli bunuubu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:34">“Me tsa pa benu lisyeme la ngidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:34">li me atsiidi nzuhisini la simi-simi huli Davidi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 55:3">Esa 55.3</ref></char></note>.”<verse eid="ACT 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35" />Ni mu buuna, nde ali mu ubwesiitasa mu Mukuunga mukima:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:35">“We a hutuma ti me, musalili a we wa ngidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:35">nyutu a me yibolo mutso a ngila ve<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 16:10">Mkg 16.10</ref></char></note>.”<verse eid="ACT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36" />Mu taangu a nde, Davidi akuhisi litondo la Nzambi, na nde akwidi. Baadiihi nde ŋa muvanga bakaaha ba nde na nyutu a nde yaboli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 2:10">1Pf 2.10</ref></char>.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37" />Ka Yisu wu Nzambi hasuuli mu babaakwa, a haboli ve. <verse eid="ACT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38" />Baana baa ngu a me, benu lafwana uyaba lo ti: ni mu tooni a Yisu, Nzambi haminyahula masumu ma benu. Ka Mikele mya Moose a myatwali unyahula masumu ma benu ve. <verse eid="ACT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:39" />Ni mu nde pasi muutu wu ubaasa hiitu mu Yisu, amiiyaka nyahulili masumu ma nde. <verse eid="ACT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40" />Buuna kebaani, mana ma mimbihuli myasonehe a mayiila benu:<verse eid="ACT 13:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41" />“Talaani, benu baa libaabaaya Nzambi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">kimuhani na dimbalaani.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">Ka me ukuhasa vanga limosi, mu taangu a benu yi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">Vanga liina li benu lu uvelesa hiitu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">tso muutu mukima yabisi benu lo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="HAB 1:5">Hab 1.5</ref></char>. </char></note>!”»<verse eid="ACT 13:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42" />Pahuli na Baranabasi baapali mu nzo lisambulu yi Bayudaayo. Baavondi bo mu ubweyafutaha mu ilumbu hya saba hi hyakaduukala, mu ubwetoyo mu musamu mowuna. <verse eid="ACT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43" />Bu imoho hyafwidi, Bayudaayo ba banzuhisini na baatu bakima ba baasiingi uyusa Nzambi, baaduukili Pahuli na Baranabasi. Bo baakahwadisa bo mu ukangama mu Nzambi, wu ubanyahula masumu ma baatu.<verse eid="ACT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pahuli na Baranabasi baaka mu ulongese ba bavele Bayudaayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44" />Mu ilumbu hya saba hi hyaduuki, bisu musyenge a Antyokya ba banzuhisini, baayakuukama mu uyuha mambu ma Pfumu Yisu. <verse eid="ACT 13:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45" />Bu Bayudaayo baamoni konge a baatu mo yiina, bo baaluuli mu nyengi. Na baakatuna ndongisili a Pahuli ti yi upfuta, na baakatuha nde. <verse eid="ACT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46" />Buuna, Pahuli na Baranabasi baayabisi bo na hiitu hyoosi ti: «Beedi hwafwana ti benu liba baatsomi mu uyuha mambu ma Nzambi. Ka bu benu lili mu unyasula mo, na umono ti benu a laakuha mu uyaka moonyi wu bilima na bilima ve, bunuubu, bisu sa liyene huli ba bavele Bayudaayo. <verse eid="ACT 13:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47" />Buuna monwaani ma Pfumu hatuma bisu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">“Me atsooli we mana we baa liyalala huli ba baaveleyaba me,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">mana we bita liyobolo, natee hu tsukusu a tsi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.47 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 49:6">Esa 49.6</ref></char>.</char></note>.”»<verse eid="ACT 13:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48" />Bu ba bavele Bayudaayo baayuhi mambu mo maana, bo baaluuli mu kinya na baayusi mambu ma Pfumu. Boosi ba Nzambi hasooli mu ubaha moonyi wu bilima na bilima, baasiidi hiitu mu Pfumu. <verse eid="ACT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49" />Maambu ma Pfumu maasinzitsaamuha mu itaanzi mo hina hyoosi. <verse eid="ACT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50" />Ka Bayudaayo baasimbilili bakaasu ba biita lilinene, ba baakayusa Nzambi, napa bangeele baa musyenge. Bo baatsumbili kwamisili ya Pahuli na Baranabasi, na baabingi bo mu itaanzi hya bo. <verse eid="ACT 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51" />Pahuli na Baranabasi baakubili bo mufundu a miilu mya bo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.51 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PRO 6:11">Mak 6.11</ref></char>.</char></note> mu uyibusa bo, na baayeni hu Ikoniwumi. <verse eid="ACT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52" />Ka bayihi ba Pfumu hu Antyokya, baaluuli mu kinya na mu Livupu la Ngidi.<verse eid="ACT 13:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14" />
  <para style="s1">Pahuli na Baranabasi hu Ikoniwumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1" />Bu Pahuli na Baranabasi baatoodi hu musyenge a Ikoniwumi, bo baakoti mu nzo lisambulu yi Bayudaayo. Huuna, ndongisili a bo yasiidi ti Bayudaayo na ba bavele Bayudaayo, baasiidi hiitu mu Pfumu. <verse eid="ACT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2" />Ka Bayudaayo bakima ba baavelisa hiitu mu Pfumu, baatumbisi ba bavele Bayudaayo mana bayalwanisa baana ba bangu ba bo ba baasiidi hiitu. <verse eid="ACT 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3" />Ka Pahuli na Baranabasi baadiingi hu Ikoniwumi. Bo baakalongese mambu ma Pfumu na hiitu hyoosi, mu tooni a Pfumu. Ni Pfumu akamweese imbuli hya ndongisili a bo. Na nde akava bo matwala ma uvanga bipadi bya kimuhili, mu umweese imbuli hya ma bo baakalongese mu Pfumu. <verse eid="ACT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4" />Buli li musyenge laakabuhi. Bamosi baakakalila Bayudaayo, bana baakakalila biluumbi bya Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5" />Bisu musyenge na Bayudaayo napa bakuutu baba baavele Bayudaayo, baakavangama mu ukwamisa biluumbi na uduba bo mu mamanya. <verse eid="ACT 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6" />Ka bu bo baayabi lo, bo baabati hu tsyelo a Lisitele na Derebe, misyenge mya itaanzi hya Likawoni, na mala ma bibiingi bya mo bina. <verse eid="ACT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7" />Huuna ka, bo baatsaamuni Tsangu yi Mbwe.<verse eid="ACT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pahuli na Baranabasi hu Lisitele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8" />Hu musyenge a Lisitele, hwaba na bahala limosi li miilu myaba myavolo. Nde aba imbolo hi imbutala-ngu, wu akaveletwala dwe. <verse eid="ACT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9" />Bahala mo akayuha ma Pahuli hakaleele. Bu Pahuli hasungimini nde, Pahuli amoni ti hiitu hya nde mu Nzambi, ubeeloso nde. <verse eid="ACT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10" />Pahuli atumi nde mu mifudi: «Teleme! Na sungama mu miilu mya we!» Bahala mo linili laadambuhi na laatakuli. <verse eid="ACT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11" />Bu konge yamoni ma Pahuli havangi, bo baafulihi mu ndaha a bo bisu Likayoni: «Banzambi bamiivolo ifwaani hya baatu, na bamiisutaha ŋa hati la bisu.» <verse eid="ACT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12" />Bo baaviidi bo makuumbu ma banzambi ba bo. Baakateele Baranabasi «Zusi», na Pahuli «Emesi», mu tooni ati Pahuli aba mutoosili. <verse eid="ACT 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13" />Nzo a nzambi a Zusi yaba ŋa kotili musyenge. Ngaanga a nzambi mo yiina, abehi bangombe ba baalwatisa bifulu bi baatunga natee ŋa kotili musyenge. Nde akasaha uva bungodu, mu itwadi na konge, huli Pahuli na Baranabasi. <verse eid="ACT 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14" />Bu biluumbi bya byole byayuhi lo, baakasuli bikutu bya bo mu umweese lingebe ŋa busu bwa Nzambi. Na baabingilili ukoto hutso a konge a baatu, na ubaafulaha mu mifudi: <verse eid="ACT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15" />«Oh! Bambaahi, hima lili mu usa buuna? Bisu ka baatu lili we benu. Bisu Musamu wu Mubwe lili mu ubehele benu, na uvondo benu mu utimba banzambi babavele na tsoongo. Buuna benu likinguha huli Nzambi a moonyi, wu avanga yulu, toto, mubu, na byosi bi bili muuna. <verse eid="ACT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16" />Mu tsikulu, Nzambi anyahi baatu ba matsi moosi, baduukala manzila ma bo mwakulu baatondo. <verse eid="ACT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17" />Nde amweese ti nde moonyi ali mu ma mabwe moosi ma nde ubaasa mu boosi. Mu tooni ati, nde Nzambi wu ubaanohese mvula, na uva mbutu yindahi mu taangu yi yafwana. Nde ubaava benu byudya mana aluusa mitima mya benu mu kinya.» <verse eid="ACT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18" />Tso bu bo baakaleele buuna, bo baamoni pasi mu ukala konge a baatu mu uva bo bungodu. <verse eid="ACT 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19" />Bayudaayo ba baamati hu misyenge mya Antyokya na Ikoniwumi baayatumbasa konge. Baateti Pahuli mamanya mu uduba nde, na baadutihi nde hu mbadi musyenge, bu baatsimi ti nde miikwa. <verse eid="ACT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20" />Ka bu bayihi baadiingi nde, Pahuli atelimi na afutihi hutso musyenge. Ilumbu hi hyaduuki, Pahuli na Baranabasi baayeni hu musyenge a Derebe.<verse eid="ACT 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pahuli na Baranabasi baafutihi hu Antyokya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21" />Pahuli na Baranabasi baamani ulongese Musamu wu Mubwe hutso musyenge a Derebe. Huuna, baatu ba banzuhisini baakinguli buyedi mu usa hiitu mu Yisu. Buuna bo baafutihi hu misyenge mya Lisitele, Ikoniwumi na hu Antyokya. <verse eid="ACT 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22" />Bo baakahwadisa mitima mi bayihi, na baakatuma bo mu uteleme mu imiinu mu Nzambi. Bo baakaleele: «Bisu laafwana ubwana na mapasi ma malahi, tswamina mu ukoto mu Ipfumu hya Nzambi.» <verse eid="ACT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23" />Mu pasi libundu, Pahuli na Baranabasi baakatsahisa bakuutu mu isalu hya Nzambi. Bo baakadya ikaandi na usambila mu bo. Na bo baakayeholo bakuutu mo baana ŋa myoho mya Pfumu Yisu, wu bo baakasa hiitu mu nde.<verse eid="ACT 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24" />Titswene Pahuli na Baranabasi baavyohi mu mukesu itaanzi hya Pisidiya natee bu baatoodi hu Papfiliya. <verse eid="ACT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25" />Bo balongisi mambu ma Nzambi hu musyenge a Perege, na bo baakulimini natee ŋa ngulu yi makuumbi ma nzali mabaatsikama, hu Ataliya. <verse eid="ACT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26" />Bu Pahuli na Baranabasi baapali hu Ataliya, bo baakoti likuumbi la nzali mu uyene hu Antyokya musyenge a tsi a Syriya. Umata taangu mo yiina, hu Antyokya, ni huuna baasuusi bo ŋa myoho mya Nzambi, mu tooni isalu hi bo baamani usa. <verse eid="ACT 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27" />Bu bo baatoodi hu musyenge a Antyokya, baakuukihi libundu. Baayabisi bo mambu ma Nzambi havangi mu mambuha moosi ma bo baaba. Na buni Nzambi hadibuli huli ba bavele Bayudaayo, nzila yi usa hiitu mu Pfumu. <verse eid="ACT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28" />Pahuli na Baranabasi baavyosi bilumbu bi bilahi itwadi na bayihi mo baana.<verse eid="ACT 14:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1" />Mwa litangu la baatu ba baamati hu tsi a Yuda, baayato hu musyenge a Antyokya. Bo balongisi baana ba ngu ndongisili moyi: «Bavelekete benu we bu huli tumili mikele mya Moose, benu utwala uyoboho ve.» <verse eid="ACT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2" />Pahuli na Baranabasi a baasingisili bo ve. Titswene, paha na kele yi mifudi byabwidi ŋa hati la baatu mo baana mu dyaambu mo liina. Libundu laavoli kesili ti Pahuli, Baranabasi na baana ba ngu bakima, bisu Antyokya, baafwana uyene hu Yeruselemi. Ni huuna bo buyatsikaha musamu mowuna huli biluumbi, na huli bakuutu ba libundu.<verse eid="ACT 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Likutuunu la hu Yeruselemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3" />Libundu laaviidi bo likumbasa li lafwana mu uvangimasa mudyenge mowuna. Bo baavyohi mu mukesu bitaanzi bya Fenesiya na Samariya. Bo baakayabisa buni ba bavele Bayudaayo baasobi mbiili mu usa hiitu mu Nzambi. Ikuumbu mo hinihi hyakamweese kinya yinene huli baana ba ngu boosi. <verse eid="ACT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4" />Bu bo baatoodi hu Yeruselemi, libundu li Bakristo loosi, biluumbi na bakuutu ba libundu, baayaki bo. Pahuli na Baranabasi baayabisi bo moosi ma Nzambi havangi mu nzila na bo. <verse eid="ACT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5" />Bu bo baakava ikuumbu, hwaba na mwaana a kabu mu libundu mo liina, ba baaba Bafarisi. Bo baatelimi, na baaleeli bu: «Bafwana ukete ba bavele Bayudaayo, na utuma bo mu ukiinza mikele mya Moose.»<verse eid="ACT 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Biluumbi byapfuutini na bakuutu ba libundu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6" />Biluumbi na bakuutu ba libundu baapfuutini mu utsikaha musamu mowuna. <verse eid="ACT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7" />Humbisa usobosono minywa, Peetelo atelimi na aleeli bo: «Bana baa ngu ba me, benu liyabi umata beleve, ti Nzambi asooli me ŋa hati la benu. Nzambi asooli me, mana me nzanzabisa Musamu wu Mubwe huli ba bavele Bayudaayo, mana bu bo buyuha nde, bo basa hiitu mu Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8" />Nzambi wu yaabi matswehi ma mitima mya baatu, aviidi huli ba bavele Bayudaayo Livupu la Ngidi. Nde haviidi bo Livupu la Ngidi, we bu hasiidi mu bisu, mu umweese ti nde a hatimba bo ve. <verse eid="ACT 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9" />Nde a hasa lisobosono ŋa hati la bo na bisu ve. Bu bo baasiidi hiitu mu Nzambi, nde atsyemisi ka mitima mya bo. <verse eid="ACT 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10" />Bunuubu, mu hima lili mu usongo Nzambi, mu usaha ukwiha bayihi mupfuna, wu tso bakaaha ba bisu, tso bisu mwakulu, laaveletwala ubita? <verse eid="ACT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11" />Ka bisu na hiitu ti ni mu bubwe bwa Pfumu Yisu bisu laamiyoboho, pila mosi we bo, ba bavele Bayudaayo.»<verse eid="ACT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12" />Na baatu boosi baasi swii. Buuna, Pahuli na Baranabasi baakayabisa bo biliimbu bya kimuhili, na bipadi bi bo baasiidi mu matwala ma Nzambi, ŋa hati la ba bavele Bayudaayo. <verse eid="ACT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13" />Bu bo baamani uyambila, Yaki avoli munywa na aleeli: «Baana baa ngu, yuhaani me! <verse eid="ACT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14" />Simoni miibindula benu, buni Nzambi havoli kesili mu usoolo baa bu uba baatu ba nde, ŋa hati la ba bavele Bayudaayo. <verse eid="ACT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15" />Na mambu ma maaleele mimbihuli, mali mu uyelemene na vanga mo linili, mu tooni ati baasonehe mu ma Ngidi:<verse eid="ACT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16" />“Ŋa mbisa a maana, me unzapfutaha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">we bu uleeli Pfumu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">Me umbwetuunga nzo a Davidi yi yabwidi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">Me utsuula bibaha bi byatsamuhi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">me utsuungaha nzo mo.<verse eid="ACT 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17" />Na mabuli moosi, na baatu ba mabuli moosi ba me atsoolo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:17">baatu mo baana bu usaha Pfumu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:17">Mono ma Pfumu amiileele,<verse eid="ACT 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18" />wu ayabisi matsimi ma nde umata beleve<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="AMO 9:11-12">Amo 9.11-12</ref></char>.</char></note>.”»<verse eid="ACT 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19" />Ni mu buuna, Yaki abwebwese bu: «Me tsimi ti, a lisaani bikahu mu ba bavele Bayudaayo ve. Baatu moba, baamiisa hiitu hya bo mu Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20" />Ka lisonehani bo maniima: “A lidya banyama ba baasumaha, ba baayeholo huli bifwita ve. A lidya misunya mi banyama ba baapinya ŋa mivodi, tso unywa makila ma bo ve. A lisa bumbembo ve<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 17:10-16">Lev 17.10-16</ref></char>.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21" />Bo a bafwana uvanga maana ve, mu tooni ati, umata tsikulu, baatu bali mu ulongese mikele mya Moose, mu pasi musyenge. Na ubaataanga nde mu manzo moosi ma lisambulu ma Bayudaayo mu pasi saba.”»<verse eid="ACT 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muhanda huli libundu la Nzambi hu Antyokya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22" />Buuna biluumbi na bakuutu ba libundu, na libundu loosi baavoli kesili yi usoolo mwa bakima ŋa hati la bo. Na utsindaha bo hu Antyokya, nzila mosi na Pahuli na Baranabasi. Bo baasooli Yude nga kuumbu Barasabasi na Silaasi. Bo boole baakuha ŋa hati la bana baa ngu. <verse eid="ACT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23" />Baaviidi bo mu ubita muhanda wu baasonehe bunuubu:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="ACT 15:23">«Bisu biluumbi na bakuutu ba libundu, bambaahi baa benu banga imiinu, limiisuula benu baana ba ngu baa laavele Bayudaayo. Bisu limiisuula benu baa lili hu musyenge a Antyokya, hu bitaanzi bya tsi a Siriya na itaanzi hya Silisiya. <verse eid="ACT 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24" />Bisu laayuha ti baatu ba baamata huli bisu, baayakotese muyungisi na umweese benu boomo mu mambu ma bo. Ka, a bisu laatumasa bo mu dyaambu mo liina ve. <verse eid="ACT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25" />Ni mu buuna, bisu boosi laavolo kesili mu itwadi, mu usoolo baatu na utsindaha benu bo. Bisu lutsindaha bo itwadi na bambaahi ba bisu baa litondo, Baranabasi na Pahuli. <verse eid="ACT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26" />Ni baatu mo baana ba baamiivahula mivumu mya bo. Bo baavangi buuna, mu tooni isalu hya Pfumu a bisu Yisu Kristo. <verse eid="ACT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27" />Bisu limiitsindaha benu Yude na Silaasi, ni bo mwakulu bu uyabisa ma bisu limiisonehe benu mu muhanda mo wunuuwu. <verse eid="ACT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28" />Bunuubu, Livupu la Ngidi na bisu, limiivolo kesili mu ubwevelekwiha benu pasi mupfuna, vengo mangidi mo maniima ma maafulala talu: <verse eid="ACT 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29" />“Uveledya banyama ba baayeholo huli bifwita. Uvelenwya makila, tso udya misunya mi banyama ba babaapinya ŋa mivodi. Uvelesa bumbembo”. Hwafwana bubwe, benu mu ubata miina myosi. Saalaani bubwe.»<verse eid="ACT 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30" />Bo baasiisi baatu ba baasooli mu uyene hu Antyokya. Bu baatoodi huuna, bo baakuukihi libundu loosi na baayakisi bo muhanda. <verse eid="ACT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31" />Baatu baataangi muhanda mowuna, na boosi baamoni kinya mu kwadisili yi yaba muuna. <verse eid="ACT 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32" />Yude na Silaasi, ba baaba mimbihuli bo mwakulu, baatoyi bunzuhisini na baana ba ngu, mu uhwadisa bo na uva bo mifudi mu imiinu. <verse eid="ACT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33" />Bo baavyosi mwa bilumbu huuna, titswene bo baakabuhi mu hyenze na baana ba ngu, mu ufutaha huli ba baatsindihi bo. [ <verse eid="ACT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 15:34" />Ka Silaasi amoni bubwe mu usaala na bo.] <verse eid="ACT 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35" />Buuna, Pahuli na Baranabasi, baasaali hu Antyokya. Itwadi na bakima-bakima, bo baakayihasa na baakalongese mambu ma Pfumu.<verse eid="ACT 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pahuli na Baranabasi baakabi manzila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36" />Mwana taangu hole, Pahuli aleeli huli Baranabasi: «Tswende liyamono baana ba ngu, hu misyenge myosi mi bisu a we laalongese mambu ma Pfumu, mu uyamono mbiili a bo.» <verse eid="ACT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37" />Baranabasi atsimi ti bo bavolo ka Yowani nga kuumbu Malako, mu uyene na bo. <verse eid="ACT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38" />Ka Pahuli a hatondi ti bo babita nde ve, mu tooni ati Yowani akabi manzila na bo hu musyenge a Papfiliya, na nde a habweyakumbasa bo mu isalu hya bo ve. <verse eid="ACT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39" />Buuna, paha yinene yatelimi, na bo baakabuhi. Baranabasi avoli Malako, na bo boole baayeni hu iliiŋa hya Kipere. <verse eid="ACT 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40" />Ka Pahuli asooli Silaasi, na bo ka baayeni, bu baana ba ngu baavondi huli Pfumu mu ukeelese bo, na usyeme bo. <verse eid="ACT 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41" />Pahuli ataangili matsi ma Siriya na Silisiya mu ubaahwadisa mabundu.<verse eid="ACT 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16" />
  <para style="s1">Timoteho miidyenge na Pahuli na Silaasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1" />Pahuli ayeni hu musyenge a Derebe natee hu musyenge a Lisitele. Huuna hwaba na muyihi mumosi, nduhi a nde Timoteho. Ngu a nde aba Muyudaayo wu asiidi hiitu mu Yisu, na taata a nde musi Ngeleke. <verse eid="ACT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2" />Baana baa ngu baa hu Lisitele na Ikoniwumi, baakata imbangi hi ibwe mu Timoteho. <verse eid="ACT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3" />Pahuli atondi udyenge itwadi na nde. Ni mu buuna, Pahuli haketi nde mu uva likiinzu huli Bayudaayo ba ibiingi mo hina. Nde hasiidi buuna, mu tooni ati Bayudaayo mo baana, aba baayaba ti taata a nde Mungeleke ali. <verse eid="ACT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4" />Mu misyenge myosi mi bo baakataangila, bo baakayabisa makesili ma biluumbi na bakuutu ba libundu baa Yeruselemi baavoli. Na baakavondo huli bo, mu ukiinza makesili mo maana. <verse eid="ACT 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5" />Mabundu maakahwada mu hiitu mu Nzambi, na maakakula mu litangu la baatu pasi ilumbu.<verse eid="ACT 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pahuli miimono imono-miisu hi imiitsindaha nde hu itaanzi hya Masedonya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6" />Bu Livupu la Ngidi laalihi bo mu ulongese mambu ma Nzambi hu itaanzi hya Asiya, bo bataangili bitaanzi bya Filizi na Ngalatiya. <verse eid="ACT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7" />Bu bo baayato bebele na itaanzi hya Misiya, bo baabahi tsimi yi uyene hu tsi ya Bitiniya. Ka Livupu la Yisu, a laviidi bo muswa ve. <verse eid="ACT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8" />Buuna bo baataangili Misiya na baakulimini natee ŋa ngulu yi makuumbi ma nzali mabaatsikama ya Tolowasi. <verse eid="ACT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9" />Butsuhu mo buuna, Pahuli amoni imono-miisu. Nde amoni musi Masedonya mumosi, wu aba mu tele. Na muutu mowuna akabondele nde ti: «Vyohele hu itaanzi hya Masedonya, mu ukumbasa bisu!» <verse eid="ACT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10" />Humbisa a imono-miisu mo hina, bisu laatsimi mu mawasa, mu uyene hu Masedonya. Mu tooni ati bisu laaba na tadi ti, Nzambi ni wu ateele bisu mu uyalongese Musamu wu Mubwe hu tsi mo yiina.<verse eid="ACT 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hu musyenge a Filipo, Lydya miisa hiitu mu Pfumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11" />Bisu laakoti mu likuumbi hu musyenge a Tolowasi, na laatsikimi hu iliiŋa hya Samotalasi. Mu ilumbu hi hyadukili, bisu laatoodi hu musyenge a Neyapolisi. <verse eid="ACT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12" />Bu laamati huuna, bisu laayeni hu musyenge a Filipo, musyenge wu munene wu itaanzi hya Masedonya, wu bisu Looma baatungi. Bisu laavyosi mwa bilumbu huuna.<verse eid="ACT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13" />Mu ilumbu hya saba, bisu laapali mu musyenge mu uyene ŋa muvanga a nzali. Huuna, bisu laakatsima ti bisu lu umono mbuha yi lisambulu yi Bayudaayo. Bisu laatsahili, na laalongisi bakaasu ba baaba baakuukama ŋana. <verse eid="ACT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14" />Ŋa hati li bakaasu mo baana, hwaba na mukaasu mumosi nduhi a nde Lydya, wu baabuta hu musyenge a Tyatire. Nde akasumbasa matsaanda mamabenge ma talu, na nde akakiinza Nzambi. Bu nde hakayuha bisu, Pfumu adibuli mutima a nde, mana nde atsikaha ma Pahuli hakaleele. <verse eid="ACT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15" />Bu nde hasiidi hiitu, baatondihi nde, na baatu ba nzo a nde. Humbisa, nde atsihi bisu hu nzo a nde na uleele: «Tso benu limoni ti mbuli me miitsa hiitu mu Pfumu, yaani! Na kwilalaani mu nzo a me.» Buuna nde akwamisi bisu mu usiinga.<verse eid="ACT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pahuli na Silaasi, bamiikotese mu kondaayi yi musyenge a Filipo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16" />Ilumbu imosi, bu bisu laakayene hu mbuha lisambulu, muviha mumosi wa nuumba, ayabwana bisu. Nuumba mo yiina, aba ivungu. Livupu li muhisi li laakakwamisa nde, laakatumasa nde ubihula ma mu uya hu busu. Bapfumu ba nuumba mo yiniiyi, baakatutala mbongo yindahi mu mbihulili a nde. <verse eid="ACT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17" />Nde akaduukala Pahuli na boosi ba baaba na nde. Nde akabaafulaha mu mifudi: «Baatu mobaniba basalili ba Nzambi a hu hati a yulu. Bo bamiiyamweese benu, buni benu lafwana uyoboho.» <verse eid="ACT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18" />Nde akasa buuna, bilumbu bi bilahi. Hu tsyelele, Pahuli afwengi na akinguhi mu uleele huli livupu mo liina: «Mu nduhi a Yisu Kristo, me miituma we mu upala mu nuumba mo yiniiyi!» Masulubete, livupu laapali mu nyutu a nde.<verse eid="ACT 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19" />Bapfumu ba muviha mo wunuuwu, baamoni ti nzila yi bo baakabahila mbongo yimiipfuba. Buuna, bo baakangi Pahuli na Silaasi, na baabiti bo ŋa litandala li mikungi ŋa busu bu bakuutu ba musyenge. <verse eid="ACT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20" />Bo baabiti bo ŋa busu bu banzonzi baa Looma, na baleeli: «Baatu mobaniba, bali mu ubehe muyungisi mu musyenge a bisu. Bo Bayudaayo bali, <verse eid="ACT 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21" />na bali mu ulongese mbiili yi bisu baatu ba Looma laavele na muswa mu usiinga na mu usalila.»<verse eid="ACT 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22" />Konge a baatu ka yadasuhili bo. Banzonzi baatumi umaasa bikutu bya Pahuli na Silaasi, na utuma ufwinza bo bafwafwala. <verse eid="ACT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23" />Humbisa ufwinza bo bafwafwala, baabwahi bo mu kondaayi na utuma keedi mu ubaakeelese bo bubwe. <verse eid="ACT 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24" />Bu keedi habahi muswa mowuna, nde asuusi bo mutso a kondaayi hu itini hya tsoso. Bo mu uvelebata, nde akutilili bo miilu mu bibundu bi miti. <verse eid="ACT 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25" />Hu hahati a busi, Pahuli na Silaasi baakasambila na uyimba mu uyuusa Nzambi. Bikondaayi bikima byakayuha bo. <verse eid="ACT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26" />Masulubete, toto yanyingimi, na yasukili ibeene hya nzo a kondaayi. Bidibuhu byosi byadibumi, na mu mawasa, mapanga ma bikondaayi moosi maanyanguhi. <verse eid="ACT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27" />Keedi a kondaayi asuuhi, ŋa nde hamoni bidibuhu byosi bwasi. Nde aduti sabila mu uduba linyutu la nde, bu hakatsima ti bikondaayi byosi byamiibata. <verse eid="ACT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28" />Ka Pahuli afulihi mu mifudi myosi: «Nyaha uduba linyutu la we! Bisu boosi ni ŋa lili.» <verse eid="ACT 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29" />Buuna keedi avondi mwinda, akoti mawasa mu nzo a kondaayi na likamba mu boomo. Nde ayabwa ŋa miilu mya Pahuli na Silaasi. <verse eid="ACT 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30" />Keedi apalisi bo na aleeli: «Pfumu, hima me apfwana mu usa, mana me kaka nzoboho?» <verse eid="ACT 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31" />Bo baafutili nde: «Sa hiitu mu Pfumu Yisu, na we sa yoboho, we na ikuta hya we hyoosi.» <verse eid="ACT 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32" />Buuna bo baayabisi mambu ma Pfumu huli nde, na huli baatu ba nzo a nde boosi. <verse eid="ACT 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33" />Ni hu hahati a busi, mu taangu mo yiina, keedi abiti Pahuli na Silaasi ŋa mbuha mosi, mu uyaswaha mbuma a bo. Mawasa-mawasa, nde ayaki tondihili, napa ikuta hya nde hyoosi. <verse eid="ACT 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34" />Humbisa, keedi abiti bo hu nzo a nde, na aviidi bo byudya. Nde aluuli mu kinya, mu tooni ati, bo baasiidi hiitu mu Nzambi, itwadi na ikuta hya nde hyoosi.<verse eid="ACT 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pahuli na Silaasi baabahi bunyanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35" />Bu busi bwakiidi, banzonzi ba bisu Looma, baatsindihi masadaadu ma bo mu uyaleele huli keedi a kondaayi: «Nyahula baatu mo baana.» <verse eid="ACT 16:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36" />Keedi a kondaayi ayayabisa lo huli Pahuli na aleeli: «Banzonzi bamiiva me muswa mu unyahula benu. Benu utwala upala, na uyene mu hyenze.» <verse eid="ACT 16:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37" />Ka Pahuli aleeli huli masadaadu ma baatsindihi: «Bo baafwinza bisu bafwafwala ŋa kuungi la baatu hwavele batsundasa bisu, bu bisu lili bisu Looma! Titswene, bo baabwahi bisu mu kondaayi. Bunuubu, bo batondi unyahula bisu mu tswehi? Naana, a buuna ve! Bo mwakulu bayanyahula bisu.» <verse eid="ACT 16:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38" />Masadaadu ma baatsindihi, maayatoosele mambu mo maana huli banzonzi baa Looma. Bu banzonzi baayuhi ti Pahuli na Silaasi baaba bisu Looma, bo baamoni boomo. <verse eid="ACT 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39" />Banzonzi baayalembesene bo mu usa bo kolo-kolo. Na bo baapalisi bo mu kondaayi, na uvondo bo mu upala mu musyenge mowuna. <verse eid="ACT 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40" />Bo bapala mu kondaayi, Pahuli na Silaasi baayeni hu nzo a Lydya. Bu bo baamani umono baana ba ngu na uhwadisa bo, bo baayeni.<verse eid="ACT 16:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17" />
  <para style="s1">Pahuli na Silaasi baayeni hu musyenge a Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1" />Pahuli na Silaasi baavyohili mu misyenge mya Apfipolisi na Apoloniya, na baayato hu musyenge a Tesalonika, hu bo baamoni nzo lisambulu yi Bayudaayo. <verse eid="ACT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2" />We bu huli ipfu hya nde, Pahuli ayeni huuna. Mu basaba batatu ba baalandisini, nde amohi na Bayudaayo mu Mabasonehe ma Ngidi. <verse eid="ACT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3" />Mu mambu ma nde hakabindula bo, nde akamweese, we bu mo mali. Masiya afwana umaamono pasi, na usuuha mu babaakwa. Nde akaleele bo: «Yisu mo wu me ndi mu unzabisa benu wu, nde ni Masiya.» <verse eid="ACT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4" />Mwana a baatu bakima ŋa hati la bo, baasiidi hiitu mu mambu mo maana, na baabambini na Pahuli na Silaasi. Buuna ni bu hwasiidi kabu lilinene la bisu Ngeleke ba baakayusa Nzambi, na bakaasu ba banzuhisini baa likiinzu, baayapfuutana na bo. <verse eid="ACT 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5" />Ka Bayudaayo bakima baamoni nyengi. Bo baakuukihi mwa biyahudi bi byaba mu manzila, na baatumi bo mu usa muyungisi na kele mutso musyenge woosi. Mu mawasa, bo baayapalila muutu mumosi nga nduhi a Yasoni hu nzo a nde, mu usaha Pahuli na Silaasi, mana babita bo ŋa kuungi la baatu. <verse eid="ACT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6" />Ka bu baavelimono bo, bo baakangi Yasoni na bambaahi ba nde bakima baa imiinu. Na baabiti bo ŋa busu bu banzonzi baa musyenge. Bo baakafulaha: «Baatu mobaniba baamiikotese muyungisi mu toto yoosi, ka bunuubu, bo bamiiyato natee huni! <verse eid="ACT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7" />Ka Yasoni ni wu miiyaka bo mu nzo a nde. Baatu mobaniba boosi a bali mu ukiinza mikele mya Pfumu Kayisaali ve. Bo bali mu uleele ti, huli na pfumu mukima nga nduhi Yisu.» <verse eid="ACT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8" />Maambu mo maana maasyelisi konge a baatu mitima, napa banzonzi baa musyenge. <verse eid="ACT 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9" />Ni mu buuna, bakuutu baakaambi bilangi huli Yasoni na bambaahi ba nde, mana banyahula bo.<verse eid="ACT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baayaki Pahuli na Silaasi hu musyenge a Beere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10" />Bu busi bwayili, baana ba ngu baatsindihi Pahuli na Silaasi hu musyenge a Beere. Bu baayato huuna, bo baayakoto hu nzo lisambulu yi Bayudaayo. <verse eid="ACT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11" />Bayudaayo ba hu Beere baaba na matsimi ma mabwe ti, ba bali hu musyenge a Tesalonika, baayaki mambu ma Nzambi mu bunyanga bu mutima. Pasi ilumbu, bo baakataanga Mabasonehe ma Ngidi, mu utsikaha tso ma baakayabisa bo, mali ma mbuli. <verse eid="ACT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12" />Buuna, ba banzuhisini mu bo baasiidi hiitu. Na ŋa hati li Bangeleke, bakaasu ba likiinzu na babahala ba banzuhisini ka, baasiidi hiitu. <verse eid="ACT 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13" />Ka Bayudaayo ba hu Tesalonika, baayuhi ti Pahuli aka mu ubwelongese mambu ma Nzambi hu Beere. Bo baayeni huuna, mu uyatuumbasa na usa kele ŋa hati la konge a baatu. <verse eid="ACT 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14" />Buuna mu mawasa, baana ba ngu baabatisi Pahuli hu tsyelo mubu mu uvolo likuumbi. Ka Silaasi na Timoteho baasaali hu Beere. <verse eid="ACT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15" />Ba baakabita Pahuli, baayeni na nde natee hu musyenge a Atenesi. Titswene, mu tumili a Pahuli, bo baafutihi hu Beere, mana baleele Silaasi na Timoteho bayabiisala nde mu mawasa hu musyenge mowuna.<verse eid="ACT 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pahuli li mu ulongese Musamu wu Mubwe hu Atenesi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16" />Bu Pahuli hakakeele Silaasi na Timoteho hu Atenesi, nde aba na inganganyi mu umono buni bifwita bi bilahi byaba mu musyenge mowuna mu pasi mbuha. <verse eid="ACT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17" />Nde akasobosono matsimi na Bayudaayo mu nzo lisambulu yi Bayudaayo, napa bakima ba baakakiinza Nzambi. Pasi ilumbu, nde akamoho ka itwadi na ba baakaba mu matandala ma mikungi. <verse eid="ACT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18" />Ni huuna, biyedi banga kuumbu Bayepikule na Basotoyise<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Bayepikule na Basotoyise: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">baatu ba baakangama mu makinya ma nyutu, na baatu bakima ba baakangama mu matsimi ma kwamisili a nyutu na ma mukonono.</char></note>, baakayatoyo na nde. Bana baakafuula: «Litodo mo linili hima lili mu uleele hya tsiki?» Baatu bakima ti: «Nde we wu li mulongisi a mambu ma binzanzambi bya byenyi». Bo baafutili buuna, mu tooni ati, bo baakayuha Pahuli mu uyabisa tsangu yimbwe ya Yisu na ya tsuuhili a nde mu babaakwa. <verse eid="ACT 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19" />Buuna, bo baavoli Pahuli na ubita nde hu isyelo hya Ayelopaze hu banzonzi baakapfutana mu pfuundu a bo. Na baafuuli nde: «Bisu utwala uyaba pila a ndongisili yi nyatihi yi we li mu ulongese baatu? <verse eid="ACT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20" />We li mu uyabisa mu matswi ma bisu misamu mi bisu laaveletsikaha, na bisu litondi uyaba mbindulili a myo.» <verse eid="ACT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21" />Bo baavondi mbindulili mo yiina, mu tooni ati, bisu musyenge a Atenesi boosi, na byenyi bi byayidi ŋa hati la bo, baakavyoso taangu a bo yoosi ndulu mu ubaatoyo. Bo baakavyoso taangu a bo mu ubaatsotso na ubaayuha mambu ma manyatihi.<verse eid="ACT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ikuumbu hya Pahuli hu isyelo hya Ayelopaze</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22" />Pahuli atelimi ŋa hati la pfuundu banzonzi na aleeli: «Benu bisu Atenesi, me ndi mu umono mu moosi ti benu laakangama mu inzambi hya benu. <verse eid="ACT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23" />Mu tooni ati, me ataangila musyenge a benu, na me atsikaha bifwita bya benu. Mu hati bifwita mo biina, me atsoolo mwa ibaanga imosi hya ndongisili, hi baasonehe bunuubu: “Huli nzambi wu baaveleyaba.” Wu benu libaakiinza hwavele uyaba, ni nde me miinzanzabisa benu. <verse eid="ACT 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24" />Nzambi a Pungu wu avanga tsi, na byosi bi bili mu yo, nde ni wu li Pfumu a yulu na toto. Na nde a habatsahala mu bibaanga bi baatunga mu myoho mya baatu ve. <verse eid="ACT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25" />Nde a hali na nzala ati basalila nde mu myoho mya baatu ve, we nde wu li na nzala isiha. Mu tooni ati, nde ni wu ubaava moonyi huli boosi, muvumu na bina byosi. <verse eid="ACT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26" />Ndulu mu muutu mumosi, nde avangi mabuli moosi, mana mo matsahala mu toto yoosi. Nde akese huli baatu matangu, na mandilu ma bitaanzi ma bo baafwana ubaatsahala. <verse eid="ACT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27" />Nzambi avangi bo, mana bo basaha nde, na peleve mu upeebete, bo utwala usoolo nde. Mu mbuli, Nzambi a hali lala tso na mumosi mu bisu ve. <verse eid="ACT 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28" />Mu tooni ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 17:28">“Ni mu nde, bisu lili moonyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 17:28">libanyingama na lili baa lili.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 17:28">Maana ni ma basonihi bakima baa benu baaleeli:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 17:28">“Bisu ka lili baa ibaandu hya Nzambi.”<verse eid="ACT 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29" />Ubaamono ti bisu ni baa ibaandu hya Nzambi, bisu utwala uba na tsimi ve, ti Nzambi ifwaani hi ifwita hya wolo. Tso nde ifwaani hi ifwita hi itali hya talu, buuve hi mamanya ma baavanga mu bungeele na matsimi ma bumuutu ve. <verse eid="ACT 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30" />Kaahu Nzambi asiidi kolo-kolo mu maana moosi, bu baatu baakaveleyaba ma baakavaanga. Ka loloyi, nde li mu uyabisa huli boosi, mu mambuha moosi, mu unyongo mu mavaanga ma bo, na usobo mbiili a bo. <verse eid="ACT 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31" />Nzambi amiisoolo ilumbu hi nde hutsundasa baatu boosi mu butsiitsa, mu nzila a muutu wu nde hamiisoolo. Nde amiimweese imbangi huli baatu boosi, ti muutu mowuna na ali, bu hamiisuula nde ŋa hati la babaakwa.»<verse eid="ACT 17:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32" />Bu bo baayuhi ti Pahuli li mu utoyo mu tsuuhili a babaakwa, bana baasyebi nde. Na bakima baaleeli: «Mu dyaambu mo lina, bisu ka ilumbu ikima lu uyuha we.» <verse eid="ACT 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33" />Buuna Pahuli asiisi bo. <verse eid="ACT 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34" />Ka mwaana a kabu limosi la baatu, baayapfuutana na nde, na baasiidi hiitu mu Yisu. Ŋa hati la bo hwaba Denisya, mumosi wa pfuundu banzonzi baa Ayelopaze, na mukaasu mumosi nduhi Damalisya, na bakima-bakima.<verse eid="ACT 17:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18" />
  <para style="s1">Pahuli hu Koliito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1" />Humbisa a maana, Pahuli amati hu Atenesi na ayeni hu Koliito. <verse eid="ACT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2" />Huuna, nde abwani na Muyudaayo mumosi nga nduhi Akilasi. Muyudaayo mo wunuuwu, musi musyenge a Ponte. Mu bilumbu mo biina, nde amati hu tsi a Italiya na mukadi a nde Pilisile. Nde hamati huuna, mu tooni ati Koloode, pfumu a Looma, avoli kesili ti Bayudaayo boosi, baafwana upala mu Looma. Pahuli ayeni huli Akilasi na Pilisile. <verse eid="ACT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3" />Nde hapfuutini na bo, bu bo boosi baaba tsalu mosi. Nde atsahili huli bo, na bo baakasala itwadi. Isalu hya bo aba utuunga hu manzo ma ngooto. <verse eid="ACT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4" />Pasi ilumbu hya saba, mu nzo lisambulu yi Bayudaayo, Pahuli akalongese mu usaha ukiingula matsimi ma Bayudaayo na Bangeleke. <verse eid="ACT 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5" />Ka bu Silaasi na Timoteho baamati hu itaanzi hya Masedonya, Pahuli asinzisalila taangu a nde, mu ubaalongese mambu ma Nzambi. Nde akasilasa huli Bayudaayo, ti Yisu ni Masiya. <verse eid="ACT 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6" />Ka bu Bayudaayo baabisi ma nde, na bu baatuhi nde, Pahuli akubili mufundu bikutu bya nde, na aleeli bo: «Tso benu lidimbili, mbele ya benu mwakulu. Me a ukolo mapfuumba mu maana ve. Ka bunuubu, me tsa nzyene huli ba bavele Bayudaayo.»<verse eid="ACT 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7" />Pahuli amati ŋa mbuha mo yiina, na nde ayeni hu nzo a bahala limosi nga nduhi Titiyusi Yusetuusi. Bahala mo liinili akasambila Nzambi, na nzo a nde aba yabaambana na yi lisambulu yi Bayudaayo. <verse eid="ACT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8" />Buuna Kilisiposi, mutumi a nzo lisambulu yi Bayudaayo, asiidi hiitu mu Pfumu na ikuta hya nde hyoosi. Bisu Koliito ka ba banzuhisini ba baakayuha mambu ma Pahuli, baasiidi hiitu mu Pfumu Yisu, na baayaki tondihili. <verse eid="ACT 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9" />Ilumbu imosi ŋa butsuhu, Pfumu amonihili na Pahuli na aleeli nde: «A haba na boomo, baayambila, a hadibuha munywa. <verse eid="ACT 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10" />Ka me ndi itwadi na we. Muutu utwala ukaanga we, na uvangila we lilibi ve. Mu tooni ati, me ndi na baatu ba banzuhisini mu musyenge mo wunuuwu.» <verse eid="ACT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11" />Na Pahuli akwilili hu Koliito ilima imosi na batsungi basamunu, mu ubaalongese baatu mambu ma Nzambi.<verse eid="ACT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pahuli bali mu utsundasa ŋa busu bwa pfumu a tsi Ngaliyoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12" />Mu taangu yi Ngaliyoni haba mutumi itaanzi hya Akayi, Bayudaayo ba baabelili Pahuli, baayuhisini mu itwadi mu ukaanga nde. Na baabiti nde hu nzo a tsundusu. <verse eid="ACT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13" />Huuna, bo baakesi nde ti: «Muutu mo wunuuwu, li mu ukiingula matsimi ma baatu, mu ukunda Nzambi bu hwasobono na mikele.» <verse eid="ACT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14" />Bu Pahuli hakibaandiha uyambila, Ngaliyoni aleeli huli Bayudaayo: «Benu Bayudaayo! Tso muutu mo wunuuwu avanga lilibi, buuve aduba muutu, kini me kiinzuha benu mu isuusi we bu hwafwana. <verse eid="ACT 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15" />Ka umono ti ndulu mu usobosono hu minywa mu mikuma, mu manduhi, buuve mu tooni mikele mya benu mwakulu, maana matali benu. Me mbisi uba nzonzi a maana.» <verse eid="ACT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16" />Humbisa, nde abingi bo mu nzo a tsundusu. <verse eid="ACT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17" />Buuna, bo boosi baakangi Sositeni, mukuutu a nzo lisambulu yi Bayudaayo. Bo baarambi nde kuba, ŋa busu bwa nzo a tsundusu. Ka Ngaliyoni a hanyongi tso hole ve.<verse eid="ACT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pahuli miifutaha hu musyenge a Antyokya mu tsi a Siriya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18" />Ŋa mbisa a dyaambu mo lina, Pahuli abwevyoso taangu yi yayelemene hu musyenge a Koliito. Nde alanisi baana ba ngu, mana nde ayene hu tsi a Siriya itwadi na Pilisile na Akilasi. Titswene Pahuli atumi ukuula mutswe, mu tooni ati nde asiidi nzuhisini huli Nzambi. Nde akoti likuumbi hu ngulu makuumbi ya Sankeli, mu uyene hu tsi a Siriya. <verse eid="ACT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19" />Bu bo baayato hu musyenge a Efeso, Pahuli asiisi bambaahi ba nde baa mudyenge, Pilisile na Akilasi. Ni huuna, nde hakoti mu nzo lisambulu yi Bayudaayo, mu umoho na Bayudaayo. <verse eid="ACT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20" />Bo baavondi nde mu uvyoso mwa bilumbu na bo. Ka nde abisi. <verse eid="ACT 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21" />Pahuli asiisi bo na aleeli: «Me tsa nzapfutaha huli benu, tso Nzambi tondi.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 18:21">Nde akoti likuumbi la nzali, na asiisi musyenge a Efeso. <verse eid="ACT 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22" />Bu Pahuli hamati hu musyenge a Efeso, nde ayasutaha hu ngulu yi makuumbi mu baatsikama yi musyenge a Sezare. Nde akumisi hu musyenge a Yeruselemi mu uyava libundu suuhi. Titswene nde ayeni hu musyenge a Antyokya. <verse eid="ACT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23" />Mwana a taangu hole, nde asiisi musyenge a Antyokya mu uyene hu bitaanzi bya Ngalatiya na Filizi, mu ubaahwadisa imiinu hi bayihi boosi.<verse eid="ACT 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pahuli ayafutaha hu misyenge mya Efeso na Koliito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24" />Muyudaayo mumosi ayidi hu musyenge a Efeso, nduhi a nde Apoloosi, wu baabuti hu Alekizandi. Nde aba muutu wu ubaatoyo bubwe, na nga buyedi wu akangama mu Mabasonehe ma Ngidi. <verse eid="ACT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25" />Nde aba ayiha misamu mi mya tala nzila a Pfumu. Bu haba ka na lehemene mu livupu, nde akayabisa na akalongese bu hwafwana, Musamu wu Mubwe wu atala Yisu. Ka nde aba ayaba ndulu tondihili yi Yowani hakalongese baatu. <verse eid="ACT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26" />Nde abaandihi utoyo mu tsiki, mu nzo lisambulu yi Bayudaayo. Bu Pilisile na Akilasi baamani uyuha nde, bo baabiti nde hu nzo a bo, na bo baabinduli nde nzila a Nzambi we bu hwafwana. <verse eid="ACT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27" />Bu nde haba na tadi yi uyene hu itaanzi hya Akayi, baana ba ngu baahwadisi nde. Bo baasonihi muhanda huli bayihi ba huuna, mu uyaka nde bubwe. Bu nde hatoodi hu Akayi, nde abeedi na tsoongo mu ba baasiidi hiitu mu bubwe bwa Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28" />Ka mu mifudi myosi, nde akatungalala Bayudaayo ŋa kuungi la baatu boosi, na nde akamweese mu Mabasonehe ma Ngidi, ti Yisu ni Masiya.<verse eid="ACT 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19" />
  <para style="s1">Pahuli li mu ulongese hu musyenge a Efeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1" />Bu Apoloosi haba hu musyenge a Koliito, Pahuli ataatili itaanzi hi bisyelo bya hu Asiya na atoodi hu musyenge a Efeso. Huuna, nde abwani na mwaana a kabu li bayihi. <verse eid="ACT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2" />Nde afuuli bo: «Benu laayaki Livupu la Ngidi ŋa benu laasiidi hiitu mu Nzambi?» Bo baafutili: «Bisu kini a laayuhi batoyi mu Livupu la Ngidi ve.» <verse eid="ACT 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3" />Pahuli afuuli bo: «Ki tondihili benu laayaki?» Bo baafutili: «Bisu laayaki tondihili a Yowani.» <verse eid="ACT 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4" />Pahuli aleeli bo: «Yowani akatondehe ba baakasiinga usobo mbiili. Nde akaleele huli bisu Isereli, mu usa hiitu mu muutu wu uya ŋa mbisa a nde, muutu mowuna ni Yisu.» <verse eid="ACT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5" />Humbisa uyuha mambu mo maana, bo baayaki tondihili mu nduhi a Pfumu Yisu. <verse eid="ACT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6" />Pahuli asuusili bo myoho, na Livupu la Ngidi laakulimini ŋa yulu a bo. Lo laaviidi bo matwala ma utoyo mu mandaha ma baaveleyaba, na ubihula. <verse eid="ACT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7" />Bo baabeedi bebele a kuumi na baatu boole. <verse eid="ACT 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8" />Pahuli akayene taangu yoosi hu nzo lisambulu yi Bayudaayo, na nde akatoyo na imbuli hyoosi. Mu batsungi batatu, nde akayabisa bo misamu mi Ipfumu hya Nzambi. Nde akahwada mu usundasa matsimi ma ba baakayuha nde. <verse eid="ACT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9" />Ka mitima mya ba banzuhisini ŋa hati la bo, myaba miminono. Bo a baakasa hiitu ve, na baakakwede ŋa kuungi la baatu boosi, baana ba baakaduukala nzila a Pfumu. Ka Pahuli atahuhi na bo. Nde abiti bayihi hu nzo a nzihili ya Tiranyusi, na akatoyo na bo pasi ilumbu. <verse eid="ACT 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10" />Pahuli ahwadi mu ulongese mu bilima byole, mana Bayudaayo na Bangeleke boosi, ba baakatsahala hu itaanzi hya Asiya, bayuha mambu ma Pfumu.<verse eid="ACT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baana tsambu baa Seva</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11" />Nzambi akavaanga bipadi bya kimuhili mu myoho mya Pahuli. <verse eid="ACT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12" />Baatu baakasuusala babeedu matsaanda, buuve maleeso ma maakakubaana nyutu a Pahuli. Babeedu baakabeloho mu mabeedu ma bo, na mavupu ma mabi maakapala mu bo.<verse eid="ACT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13" />Bayudaayo bamosi, baakadyengele ibiingi na ibiingi mu ubinga mavupu ma mabi. Baatu mo baana, baayehili usalila nduhi a Pfumu Yisu mu musamu mowuna. Bo baakaleele huli mavupu ma mabi: «Me tumi benu mu upala mu nyutu a muutu mo wunuuwu, mu nduhi a Yisu mo wu Pahuli ubaalongese!» <verse eid="ACT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14" />Buuna ni bu tsambu la baana ba Seva baakavaanga. Seva aba mukuutu bangaanga ba Bayudaayo, wu akasa isalu hya ngaanga a Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15" />Ka ilumbu imosi, livupu lilibi laafutili bo bu: «Me nzaabi Yisu, na me atsikaha Pahuli na ali. Ka benu, benu baana lili?» <verse eid="ACT 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16" />Na muutu nga livupu lilibi ayabwa ŋa yulu a bo, na amweesi ti nde afula bo mifudi. Nde amweesi bo pasi, na boosi baapali mu nzo a nde pene na mbuma. <verse eid="ACT 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17" />Musamu mo wunuuwu ayabiini huli bisu musyenge a Efeso boosi. Bayudaayo na Bangeleke baayabi matwala ma Nzambi, na baabaandihi usinzakiinza nduhi a Pfumu Yisu. <verse eid="ACT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18" />Ba banzuhisini mu ba baasiidi hiitu mu Nzambi, baakayasiinga ma mabi ma bo ŋa kuungi la baatu. <verse eid="ACT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19" />Kabu lilinene la baatu ba baakasalila maviingu, baabehi mabuuku ma baakasalila, na baatsuhi mo ŋa kuungi la baatu boosi. Talu mabuuku mo maana, yatoodi iteesi hi maku mataanu ma biveeve bi makuta ma mbongo (5 0000). <verse eid="ACT 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20" />Ni mu buuna, mu matwala ma Pfumu, mambu ma nde maakatsaamuha na maakafulala ubaha mifudi.<verse eid="ACT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Muyungisi a baatu hu musyenge a Efeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21" />Bu misamu mo miina myavyohi, Pahuli atsimi uyene hu Yeruselemi mu uvyohele mu bitaanzi bya Masedonya na Akayi. Nde akaleele: «Bu me umata huuna, me apfwana uyene ka hu musyenge a Looma.» <verse eid="ACT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22" />Nde atsindihi Timoteho na Erasite, ba baakakumbasa nde mu isalu, hu Masedonya. Ka nde mwakulu amasaala mwaana a taangu hole, hu itaanzi hya Asiya.<verse eid="ACT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23" />Mu taangu mo yiina, muyungisi wu munene abwidi hu musyenge a Efeso, mu tooni a ndongisili yi yatala «Nzila a Pfumu». <verse eid="ACT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24" />Mutsuli bilunga mumosi, nga nduhi Demetiyusi, akatsula bifwaani bi manzo ma nzambi mu mbongo. Bi nde hakatsula, aba bifwaani bya nzo yi baatu baakasambila inzanzambi, hi mukaasu nga kuumbu Aritemisi. Demetiyusi akabutasa kaluha yinene huli nde, na huli ba baakasala na nde. <verse eid="ACT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25" />Ilumbu imosi, nde ateeli basali ba nde boosi, napa bakima ba baakasala isalu mo hina. Nde aleeli bo: «Bambaahi ba me, benu liyaabi ti isalu mo hinihi hibaabutala bisu a benu kaluha yimbwe. <verse eid="ACT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26" />Ka benu lili mu umono, tso uyuha ma mali mu uvyoho mu musyenge a Efeso, natee mu itaanzi hya Asiya hyoosi. Pahuli mo wunuuwu amiikingula matsimi ma makonge ma baatu, ti banzambi baa myoho mya baatu myavaanga, a bali banzambi baa mbuli ve! <verse eid="ACT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27" />Monwaani! Isalu hya bisu a benu hyufwa tsoongo, na muyusu a nzo a nzambi mukaasu Aritemisi, sa afwa. Buuna, inzanzambi mo hinihi, hi baatu bubaayusa mu itaanzi hya Asiya hyoosi, na mu toto yoosi, sa hitsulaana.» <verse eid="ACT 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28" />Bu baatu baayuhi mambu mo maana, bo baaluuli mu kesi, na baakafulaha: «Aritemisi a bisu Efeso wu munene ali!»<verse eid="ACT 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29" />Buuna, bisu musyenge a Efeso boosi, baakoti mu muyungisi. Koonge a baatu yaakaangi bisu Masedonya boole, Ngayusi na Arisitake, batsyengi baa Pahuli baa mudyenge. Boosi mu mutima mumosi, baabingilili udutaha bo ŋa litandala li mikungi. <verse eid="ACT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30" />Pahuli akatondo umonehele mu utoyo ŋa busu bwa baatu boosi, ka bayihi baalihi nde. <verse eid="ACT 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31" />Bamosi ka mu bafoko ba basyenoho baa itaanzi hya Asiya, bambaahi baa Pahuli, baatsindihi nde baatu mana bayalembesene Pahuli mu uveleyene hu litandala li mikungi. <verse eid="ACT 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32" />Mu taangu mo yiina, kuungi la baatu laakoti hutso muyungisi. Baniiba baakafulaha dyaambu limosi, bana baakafulaha likima. Na ba banzuhisini ŋa hati la bo, a baakayaba tso tooni ya kuukimini a bo ve. <verse eid="ACT 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33" />Mwana a kabu la baatu mu konge, baabinduli musamu huli muutu mumosi nga kuumbu Alezande, wu Bayudaayo baakatehese ŋa busu. Alezande asyenuli hoho, mu uyabisa ti nde tondi utoyo. Na nde abinduli ŋa busu bwa konge ti ba bo baakangi, a bali na mbele ve. <verse eid="ACT 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34" />Ka bu baayaabi ti nde Muyudaayo haba, baatu boosi baakafulaha mu itwadi mu mangunga moole: «Aritemisi a bisu Efeso, we li wu munene!»<verse eid="ACT 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Foko mumosi wu musyenge a Efeso, miivumasa konge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35" />Tangu mosi, foko wu lituma li musyenge, avumisi konge na aleeli: «Benu bisu Efeso, boosi bayaabi ti musyenge a Efeso, ni keedi a nzo a nzambi a Aritemisi. Benu liyabi ka ti iliimbu hi inzambi hya nde, hyamati hu yulu we manya, na hyabwidi ŋa toto. <verse eid="ACT 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36" />Muutu utwala utuna love. Ni mu buuna, benu laafwana uba swii na utsima, na uvelebingalala uvanga pasi dyaambu. <verse eid="ACT 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37" />Benu limiibehe baatu mobaniba ŋa. Bo a baayiba bi bili mu manzo ma nzambi ma Aritemisi ve. Pila mosi ka, bo a baatuha nde, tso uleele dyaambu lilibi mu nde ve. <verse eid="ACT 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38" />Tso Demetiyusi na bambaahi ba nde baa isalu batondi ukese muutu, bo baafwana uyene mu manzo ma tsundusu, ŋa busu bu banzonzi. Ni huuna baafwana uyakese bo. <verse eid="ACT 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39" />Na tso benu lili na musamu mukima wu ukese, sa bavanga nde hu likutuunu li laayelemene mu mikele. <verse eid="ACT 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40" />Livelekebani, bisu Looma sa bayakese bisu a benu, ti lili mu utuumbasa konge a baatu mu usa muyungisi. Umono ti ni buuna, bisu a benu a lu ubaha mbiinga mu ubindula ma mamiivyoho loloyi ve.» <verse eid="ACT 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41" />Humbisa uleele buuna, foko mo wunuuwu afutili baatu boosi.<verse eid="ACT 19:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20" />
  <para style="s1">Pahuli miidyenge hu itaanzi hya Masedonya na hu tsi a Ngerese</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1" />Bu muyungisi hafwidi, Pahuli ateeli bayihi ba nde. Nde amana uhwadisa bo, nde alanisi bo na ayeni hu itaanzi hya Masedonya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="1TI 1:3">1Ti 1.3</ref></char>.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2" />Nde akataangila itaanzi mo hina, na akahwadisa banga hiitu. Titswene nde ayeni hu tsi a Ngerese. <verse eid="ACT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3" />Huuna, nde avyosi batsungi batatu. Bu hakiiyene hu tsi a Siriya mu likuumbi la nzali, nde ayuhi pfuundu yi Bayudaayo baaba baamiikutala nde. Na nde amoni bubwe mu ufutahala mu nzila a Masedonya. <verse eid="ACT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4" />Ba baakadyenge na nde ni baniiba: Sopatere, mwaana a Pilusi, musi musyenge a Beere, Arisitake na Sekundusi bisu Tesalonika, Ngayusi musi Derebe, Timoteho, titswene Tisiike na Tolofime bisu itaanzi hya Asiya. <verse eid="ACT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5" />Baniiba ni ba baatswamini mu uyakeele bisu hu musyenge a Tolowasi. <verse eid="ACT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6" />Buuna, humbisa mukungi mapa ma maaveledaana, bisu laakoti likuumbi la nzali ŋa ngulu makuumbi ya hu musyenge a Filipo. Humbisa bilumbu bitaanu, bisu laabiisili ba baatswamini bisu hu musyenge a Tolowasi. Ni huuna, bisu laavyosi bilumbu tsambu.<verse eid="ACT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pahuli miisuula muutu wu akwa hu musyenge a Tolowasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7" />Mu ilumbu hya saba ŋa tsitsaha, bisu laakuukimi mu udya itwadi. Pahuli akalongese libundu la Kristo. Bu nde hakiidyenge mu ilumbu hya ndaanda, Pahuli asusili ndongisili a nde natee hu hahati a busi. <verse eid="ACT 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8" />Mu itini hya nzo hya hu yulu ibaanga hu bisu laaba laakuukama, hwaba na minda mi milahi. <verse eid="ACT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9" />Mupfudu-mbahala mumosi, nga nduhi Etikusi, aba atsahala ŋa nenenge liluta. Bu Pahuli hakasusala ndongisili a nde, mufudu mbahala mo wunuuwu abwamini tolo la kidumana. Hutso a tolo, nde alengumini, na asakuhi umata hu mutaabu mutatu wu ibaanga hya nzo. Bu bo baakiitelemese nde, bo baamoni ti nde aba amiimana muvumu. <verse eid="ACT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10" />Buuna, Pahuli asutihi, abaandimi ŋa yulu a nde, atsyeti nde, na aleeli: «A lidyengese matsimi ve! Nde moonyi ali!» <verse eid="ACT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11" />Bu Pahuli habwekumasa hu ibaanga, nde akabi lipa na adidi. Titswene nde abwelongese bunzuhisini natee tsuumba a ngwali, na ayeni. <verse eid="ACT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12" />Ka mufudu mbahala mo wunuuwu, baafutihi na nde wa moonyi, na boosi baaba mu kinya yindahi.<verse eid="ACT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pahuli miidyenge hu musyenge a Tolowasi natee hu Mile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13" />Ka bisu laateehili, na laakoti likuumbi la nzali li laabiti bisu hu ngulu makuumbi ya Asosi. Huuna, bisu laapfulili Pahuli, mu tooni ati, nde akatsima uyene hu Asosi mu miilu. <verse eid="ACT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14" />Bu nde hayabiisala bisu hu Asosi, nde akoti mu likuumbi na bisu mu uyene hu iliiŋa hya Mitileni. <verse eid="ACT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15" />Limata ŋaana, bisu laasupiini mu mubu mu likuumbi, na laayato ilumbu hya ndaanda, ŋa iliiŋa hya Kiyo. Ŋa ngwali, bisu laayato hu iliiŋa hya Samosi, titswene ilumbu hi hyabweduuka, bisu laayato hu ngulu makuumbi ya Mile. <verse eid="ACT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16" />Kaahu, Pahuli ataasi uveletsikama ŋa musyenge a Efeso, mu uvelevyoso taangu hu itaanzi hya Asiya. Mu tooni ati, nde akabingalala uto hu musyenge a Yeruselemi, mu ilumbu hya Pentekote tso huyelimini.<verse eid="ACT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pahuli miiva mabwehe ma tsyelele huli bakuutu ba musyenge a Efeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17" />Bu laatoodi hu ngulu makuumbi ya Mile, Pahuli atsindihi muutu mu uyatsiha bakuutu ba libundu la Efeso. <verse eid="ACT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18" />Bu bo baayabiisala nde, Pahuli aleeli bo: «Benu liyabi mbiili a me ŋa hati la benu taangu yoosi, umata ilumbu hyatsomi hya nziili a me mu tsi ya Asiya. <verse eid="ACT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19" />Me atsalili Pfumu Yisu hutso a kulimini na matsanga mu miisu. Me atsalili nde hutso mapasi na ketili imiinu mu tooni mapfuundu ma mabi ma Bayudaayo baakakutala me. <verse eid="ACT 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20" />Benu liyabi ti, me a hatswehe benu pasi dyaambu lili kiiba tsoongo mu benu ve. Me anzabisi na ulongese benu moosi ŋa kuungi la baatu, na mutso manzo ma benu. <verse eid="ACT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21" />Me anzabisi huli Bayudaayo na Bangeleke, mu usobo mbiili a bo nzyeni. Me ambwenzabisa bo mu ukinguha huli Nzambi, na usiingama mu Pfumu a bisu Yisu.»<verse eid="ACT 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22" />«Ka bunuubu, mu tumili Livupu la Ngidi, me akadwe hu Yeruselemi, na me a hanzaabi li lu uyila me huuna ve. <verse eid="ACT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23" />Li me nzaabi ni ti, Livupu la Ngidi lili mu uyibusa me: “Mu pasi musyenge, kondaayi na mapasi bili mu ukeele we.” <verse eid="ACT 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24" />Ka mu me, idiingu hya me a hili na tsoongo ve. Hya tsoongo huli me, ni mu ukuhasa ma me ndi mu utsa, na isalu hi Pfumu Yisu hamiiva me. Isalu mo, ni ulongese Musamu wu Mubwe wu litondo la Nzambi.»<verse eid="ACT 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25" />«Bunuubu, me nzaabi bubwe ti, benu boosi ba me andongisi Ipfumu hya Nzambi, tso mumosi a hubwemono me ve. <verse eid="ACT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26" />Ni mu buuna, me ndi mu undeele benu lo na bukuhu bwosi loloyi: tso mumosi mu benu dungi nzila a Nzambi, a matali me ve. <verse eid="ACT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27" />Mu tooni ati, me anzabisi benu litondo la Nzambi loosi, hwavele uswehe pasi dyaambu. <verse eid="ACT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28" />Kebaani, mu tooni a benu mwakulu, na mu biboodi bi Livupu la Ngidi haava benu mu ukeelese. Baani bakeelisi babiboodi bababwe baa libundu li Nzambi hasumbi, mu lipfu la Mwana a nde mwakulu. <verse eid="ACT 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29" />Me nzaabi ti bu me utehe mbisa, baatu babaafwana na miinzi mi bukanyi, sa bakotelele libundu mu umana konge biboodi. <verse eid="ACT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30" />Ŋa hati la benu mwakulu, baatu sa baleele ma upfuta mu udimbasa libundu, mana bayihi bakima mu benu, baduukala bo. <verse eid="ACT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31" />Ni mu buuna, kebaani! Yibwalaani moonyi ti, mu bilima bitatu, butsuhu na nyangu, me a hakolo mu uva mumosi mumosi mu benu mandoongi ve. Mu tooni a benu, me ambeedi na matsanga mu miisu. <verse eid="ACT 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32" />Na bunuubu, me nzyehuli benu ŋa myoho mya Nzambi, na mu lituma li Musamu wu Mubwe wa pfuuhili. Nde na matwala ma uhwadisa benu mu imiinu, na uva benu mukobe wu nde haswehele boosi ba baakangama mu nde. <verse eid="ACT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33" />Me a hanyungala tso mbongo, tso wolo, tso bikutu bya pasi muutu ve. <verse eid="ACT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34" />Benu mwakulu liyabi ti, ni myoho mo miiniimi myasahi byosi bi me, na bambaahi ba me, laaba na byo nzala. <verse eid="ACT 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35" />Me amweese benu ti mu moosi, lafwana ubaasala, mana libaakumbasa biyaha. Yibwalaani moonyi mu ma Pfumu Yisu nde mwakulu haleeli: “Kinya ya wu ubaava, yafulala ya wu ubaayaka.”»<verse eid="ACT 20:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36" />Ŋa yulu a maana, Pahuli atsokimi itwadi na bo, na nde asambili Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37" />Boosi na lingebe, baakalila, baakabumba Pahuli, na usiingama mu likingu la nde na minyongo. <verse eid="ACT 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38" />Bo baaba fula-fula mu lingebe, mu tooni a bu nde haleeli ti bo a bu ubwemono nde ve. Titswene, bo baayavehese nde natee hu likuumbi.<verse eid="ACT 20:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21" />
  <para style="s1">Pahuli miiyene hu musyenge a Yeruselemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1" />Humbisa ukabuha na bo, bisu laakoti mu likuumbi la nzali mu uyene hu tsyelo iliiŋa hya Koose. Ŋa ngwali, bisu laayato hu iliiŋa hya Lodesi. Limata ŋaana, bisu laayeni hu musyenge a Patala. <verse eid="ACT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2" />Huuna, bisu laabiisi likuumbi li laakasabuha hu tsyelo a tsi a Fenesiya. Buuna, bisu laakoti mu lo na laayeni. <verse eid="ACT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3" />Bu laatoodi bebele mu utalila iliiŋa hya Kipere, bisu laakulimini hu baanda iliiŋa mo hina, mu uyene hu tsyelo a tsi a Siriya. Bisu laatsikimi hu simu la kaasu li musyenge a Tiilo, hu baapalisi makatu mu likuumbi. <verse eid="ACT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4" />Huuna, bisu laabiisi banga hiitu, na laatsahili bilumbu tsambu na bo. Hutso a nzaabili Livupu la Ngidi, bo baaleeli huli Pahuli mu uveleyene hu musyenge a Yeruselemi. <verse eid="ACT 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5" />Ka bilumbu tsambu bifwa, bu laabwevolo nzila, bo boosi baayavehese bisu, na bakadi ba bo, na baana ba bo, natee hu mbadi musyenge. Bu laatoodi ŋa simu li mubu, bisu laatsokimi, na laasambili Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6" />Titswene, bu laamani ulanisa bambaahi, bisu laakoti hutso likuumbi la nzali, bo baafutihi mu manzo ma bo. <verse eid="ACT 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7" />Bisu laamani mudyenge a bisu ŋa yulu mubu, umata hu Tiilo natee hu musyenge a Tolemayise. Bisu laaviidi mabwehe huli baana ba ngu baa musyenge mo wunuuwu. Bisu laavyosi ilumbu imosi na bo. <verse eid="ACT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8" />Ilumbu hi hyaduuki, bisu laabwevolo nzila na laayato hu musyenge a Sezare. Huuna, bisu laayakoto mu nzo a Filipo, wu bubaateele «iluumbi hi Musamu wu Mubwe», na bisu laatsahili hubwa nde. Nde aba mumosi mu tsambu li bakeelisi balibundu, ba baasooli hu Yeruselemi. <verse eid="ACT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9" />Nde aba na banuumba ba baaba baavelekwele, ba baakabihula. <verse eid="ACT 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10" />Bisu laaba huuna bilumbu bi bilahi, ŋa mumbihuli mumosi nga nduhi a Angabusi, wu amati hu tsi a Yuda, hayidi. <verse eid="ACT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11" />Nde avoli mudi a luungu wa Pahuli, akuti miilu na myoho mya nde mwakulu, na aleeli: «Yuhaani mamali mu uleele Livupu la Ngidi: “Bahala nga mudi mo wunuuwu, Bayudaayo sa bakuta nde mu ifwaani mohi hu Yeruselemi, na sa bayeholo nde ŋa myoho mya byenyi.”» <verse eid="ACT 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12" />Bu laamani uyuha maana, bisu, na babaaba ŋaana, laayayini Pahuli mu uveleyene hu musyenge a Yeruselemi. <verse eid="ACT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13" />Ka Pahuli akaali: «Mu hima benu lili mu ulila na lili mu umweese me pasi mu mutima? Me ndi wu avangama, me Pahuli, ndulu a mu usa ti bakuta me ve. Ka napa mu ukwa hu musyenge a Yeruselemi, mu tooni muyusu wu afwana mu Pfumu Yisu.» <verse eid="ACT 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14" />Bu bisu laavelitwala usa ti nde asobo tsimi, bisu laanyahi, na bisu boosi laaleeli: «Nyaha litondo la Pfumu Nzambi livangama!»<verse eid="ACT 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15" />Humbisa a mwa bilumbu mo biina, bisu laavangimi na laakumi hu musyenge a Yeruselemi. <verse eid="ACT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16" />Kabu li bayihi ba musyenge a Sezare, laayabiisala bisu. Bo baabiti bisu huli muutu wu avangimi mu uyaka bisu hubwa nde. Nduhi a nde Manasoni, musi iliiŋa hya Kipere, wu aba muyihi umata beleve.<verse eid="ACT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pahuli miiyamono Yaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17" />Bu bisu laayato hu musyenge a Yeruselemi, baana ba ngu baayaki bisu mu kinya. <verse eid="ACT 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18" />Ilumbu hi hyaduuki, Pahuli ayeni na bisu huli Yaki. Bakuutu ba libundu boosi baayatsonzomo ŋaana. <verse eid="ACT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19" />Pahuli ayava bo mabwehe. Humbisa, nde ayabisi bo moosi ma Nzambi havangi ŋa hati la ba bavele Bayudaayo. <verse eid="ACT 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20" />Bu baamani uyuha nde, bo baayusi Nzambi. Titswene bo baaleeli huli Pahuli: «Mwana a ngu, we miimono buni biveeve bi Bayudaayo bamiikoto mu buli la Kristo. Bo boosi aba babaasinzakangama mu mikele mya Moose. <verse eid="ACT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21" />Ka, mono ma baaleele mu we: we li mu ulongese huli Bayudaayo, ba bali mu utsahala ŋa hati li bibandu bikima, mu utimba mikele mya Moose. Baaleele ti, we li mu ulongese bo mu ubwevelekete baana ba bo, na mu ubweveleduukala bukulu bu Bayudaayo. <verse eid="ACT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22" />Buni luusa? Mu tooni ati, bo sa bayuha ti we miya. <verse eid="ACT 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23" />Ni mu buuna, sa ma bisu lu utuma we mu usa. Tala me, bisu lili na babahala bana ŋa hati la bisu, ba bamiisa mulabu mu Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24" />Volo bo. Koto na bo, mu utsyemese manyutu ma bo. Futa mbongo, mana bakuula mitswe mya bo. Na baatu boosi sa bayaaba ti, moosi ma baaleele mu tooni a we, mali ma upfuta. Na ti we ka ubaadyata hutso lituma li mikele mya Moose. <verse eid="ACT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25" />Ka huli ba bavele Bayudaayo, ba baamiisingama mu Kristo, bisu laasonehele bo mu uyabisa makesili ma bisu. Bo a baafwana udya tso banyama ba baadubala bifwita ve, tso banyama ba baapinya ŋa mivodi, tso unywa makila, na bo baafwana usa mifudi mu uvelesa mayamba<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:20">15.20</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="ACT 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26" />Buuna, mu ilumbu hi hyaduuki, Pahuli avoli babahala mo babana, bo babaandihi utsyemese nyutu a bo. Humbisa, nde akoti mu nzo a Nzambi, mu uyayabisa ki taangu bilumbu bya tsyemili a bo byufwa. Na ki taangu muutu-muutu mu bo, hu uva bungodu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:20">1Ko 9.20</ref></char></note> bu bwayelemene huli Nzambi.<verse eid="ACT 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pahuli bamiikaanga mu nzo a Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27" />Bu bilumbu tsambu mo byaba hupedu ufwa, Bayudaayo bakima baa itaanzi hya Asiya, baatalili Pahuli hutso litandala la nzo a Nzambi. Bo baatumbisi konge a baatu yoosi, na baakangi nde. <verse eid="ACT 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28" />Bo baakafulaha: «Bisu Isereli, yakumbasaani bisu! Monwaani muutu mo wunuuwu li mu uva huli boosi, matsyelo moosi, ndongisili yi yavelebaambana na buli la bisu, na mikele mya Moose, na nzo a Nzambi. Ŋaniiŋa, nde miiyakotese te ba bavele Bayudaayo mu litandala la nzo a Nzambi, na usumana mbuha ya ngidi yi!» <verse eid="ACT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29" />Bo baaleeli buuna, mu tooni ati bo baamoni muutu mumosi, nduhi Tolofime musi Efeso, na Pahuli hutso musyenge. Muutu mo wuuna aba musi musyenge a Efeso<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.29 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">musyenge a Efeso: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aba musyenge a itaanzi hya Asiya, musyenge a ba bavele Bayudaayo.</char></note>. Bo baakatsima ti, Pahuli akotisi Tolofime mu litandala la nzo a Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30" />Buuna, kele yabwidi hutso musyenge woosi. Baatu baayidi mawasa-mawasa, mu matsyelo moosi. Bo baakangi Pahuli, na baadutihi nde mu upalisa nde mu litandala la nzo a Nzambi. Humbisa, bo baadibuhi bikotili bya mumbu a nzo a Nzambi.<verse eid="ACT 21:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31" />Baatu mo baakasaha uduba Pahuli. Bo baayayabisa huli mukuutu balwani, baa tsi a Looma baa hu Yeruselemi, ti musyenge woosi aka hutso a hyalasasa. <verse eid="ACT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32" />Mu mawasa, mukuutu balwani akungi masadaadu, na batumi baa mo. Nde ayeni lititinu na bo hu tsyelo yi konge a baatu yaba. Bu bo baamoni mukuutu balwani na masadaadu, bo baanyahi utete Pahuli. <verse eid="ACT 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33" />Buuna, mukuutu balwani ayasusaha hupedu a Pahuli. Nde atumi ukaanga Pahuli, na ukutala nde mapanga moole. Titswene nde afuuli nde, nde na haba, na nde hima hasiidi. <verse eid="ACT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34" />Ka ŋa hati la konge, bamosi baakafulaha dyaambu limosi. Bakima baakafulaha likima. Mu tooni a hyalasasa, mukuutu balwani a hatwali ukaanga tso limosi la tsiki ve. Nde atumi mu ubita Pahuli hutso a mumbu masadaadu. <verse eid="ACT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35" />Bu Pahuli hatoodi ŋa ikaada hya mumbu, masadaadu maatsyeti nde, mu tooni mafufu ma maaba na konge a baatu. <verse eid="ACT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36" />Bu maambu mo maniima maakavyoho, baatu boosi baakaduukala nde na ubaafulaha: «Dubaani nde!»<verse eid="ACT 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37" />Mu taangu yi baakiikotese nde hutso a mumbu, Pahuli aleeli huli mukuutu masadaadu: «Me utwala uleele we dyaambu?» Mukuutu masadaadu afuuli nde: «We yaabi utsuha Ingereke? <verse eid="ACT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38" />We a ni musi Ngipiti wu atumbisi baatu, na wu abiti biveeve bina bi badubi ba baatu hu bwadi ve?» <verse eid="ACT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39" />Pahuli afutili: «Me Muyudaayo ndi, wu baabuta hu musyenge a Talasi hu tsi a Silisiya, musi musyenge wu munene. Kolo-kolo a we, va me muswa mu utoyo huli kuungi la baatu.» <verse eid="ACT 21:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40" />Mukuutu balwani aviidi nde muswa. Pahuli, mu tele ŋa yulu ikaada hya mumbu, avuhi hoho mu uyungasa kele. Na nde atsuhi huli bo mu ndaha Ibeleho.<verse eid="ACT 21:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22" />
  <para style="s1">Ikuumbu hya Pahuli huli bisu Yeruselemi mu ulwanila nyutu a nde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1" />Pahuli aleeli bo: «Baana baa ngu na bataata ba me, bunuubu yuhaani ma me tondi uleele benu, mu tooni ulwanila nyutu a me.» <verse eid="ACT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2" />Bu bo baayuhi ti nde li mu utoyo mu ndaha Ibeleho, bo baasinzisa tsitsii. Na Pahuli aleeli:<verse eid="ACT 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3" />«Me Muyudaayo ndi, wu baabuta hu musyenge a Tarese, mu itaanzi hya Silisiya. Me ni ŋa Yeruselemi ŋa baabuuhasa. Mulongisi Ngamalieli ni wu ayihisi me mu uduukala bubwe-bubwe, mikele mi bakaaha ba bisu. Me ambeedi na lehemene mu Nzambi, we bu benu boosi lili mu usa loloyi. <verse eid="ACT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4" />Me akwamisi natee hu lipfu, boosi ba baakaduukala Nzila a Yisu. Me atumisi ukaanga na ubwaha mu kondaayi, bakaasu na babahala. <verse eid="ACT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5" />Mukuutu bangaanga ba Nzambi na pfuundu bakuutu, utwala uta imbangi mu imbuli hya me. Me anzaki mihanda mya tumili mi baaviidi me, mu utoosele huli baana ba ngu baa musyenge a Damaseko. Me atoodi hu musyenge mowuna, mu uyakaanga buli la Yisu, na ubehe lo hu musyenge a Yeruselemi, mana lo liyaka tsyembili.»<verse eid="ACT 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pahuli ayabisi Bayudaayo buni nde hasiingimi mu Yisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6" />«Bu me amba mu uyene hu musyenge a Damaseko, hupedu a mwangulu, liyalala li mifudi laamati hu yulu na laayadiinga me. <verse eid="ACT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7" />Masulubete, me ambwidi ŋa toto na me anzuhi ndaha mosi yaakaleele me: “Sahuli, Sahuli, mu hima we li mu unyongese me?” <verse eid="ACT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8" />Me akaali: “We na li, Pfumu?” Na nde aleeli me: “Me ni Yisu musi Nazareti wu we li mu unyongese.” <verse eid="ACT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9" />Ba baabeedi ŋaana na me, baamoni liyalala, ka bo a baayuhi ndaha ya wu akatoyo na me ve. <verse eid="ACT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10" />Buuna, me apfuuli nde: “Hima me apfwana usa Pfumu?” Na Pfumu aleeli me: “Teleme, yene hu musyenge a Damaseko, na huuna sa bayabisa we moosi ma we afwana mu usa.” <verse eid="ACT 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11" />Bu liyalala laadimisi me miisu, badiha baakangi me mu hoho, na baabiti me hu musyenge a Damaseko.»<verse eid="ACT 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12" />«Hwaba huuna, na muutu mumosi nduhi Ananya, muutu wu akiinza Nzambi na wu ubaaduukala mikele mya bisu. Nde wuna wu Bayudaayo boosi ba musyenge a Damaseko, bubaatila imbangi hi ibwe. <verse eid="ACT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13" />Nde ayasaha me. Bu hamoni me, ayasusaha huli me na aleeli: “Sahuli, mwaana a ngu a me, nyaha miisu ma we mabwemono!” Masulubete, moniili a me yayafutaha na me amoni Ananya. <verse eid="ACT 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14" />Nde abweleele: “Nzambi bakaaha ba bisu hamiteehele usoolo we, mana we tsikaha litondo la nde. Nde hamiteehele usoolo we, mana we mono Wuna wu Akuha, na uyuha ndaha a nde. <verse eid="ACT 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15" />Ka we uba mbangi a nde ŋa busu bwa baatu boosi, mu tooni uyabisa bo maambu moosi ma we miimono na uyuha. <verse eid="ACT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16" />Bunuubu, mu hima ubwekeele? Teleme, yaka tondihili na sambila Pfumu a we, mana nde atsyemese we mu masumu ma we.”»<verse eid="ACT 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pahuli ayabisi buni Nzambi hatsindihi nde mu matsi makima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17" />«Me anzapfutaha hu Yeruselemi, na bu me amba mu usambila mu nzo a Nzambi, me akoti hutso a moniili yi livupu. <verse eid="ACT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18" />Me amoni Pfumu na nde aleeli me: “Mawasa, kula dwe, pala mu Yeruselemi! Mu tooni ati, tungi la bula mo buuna sa lituna imbangi hya we mu me.” <verse eid="ACT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19" />Me apfutili: “Pfumu, bo bayabi bu hwafwana ti me akanzyene mu pasi nzo lisambulu yi Bayudaayo, mu ubwaha mu kondaayi babali mu usiila we hiitu. <verse eid="ACT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20" />Titswene, ŋa baadubi Etyene, mbangi a we, me kaka ambeedi ŋaana. Me atsilisi babaakaduba nde, ni me mwakulu akwaadi mu ukeelese na bikutu byabo.” <verse eid="ACT 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21" />Pfumu aleeli me: “Yene, na me tsa tsindaha we hu lala, huli ba baavele Bayudaayo.”»<verse eid="ACT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pahuli na mukuutu masadaadu ma Looma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22" />Baatu baayuhi Pahuli natee bu nde hamani uleele mambu ma tsyelele ma. Bo baabwesyenolo mandaha ma bo na ubaafulaha: «Masilaani bisu muutu mo wunuuwu! Nde afwana ukwa! Nde a hafwana uba moonyi ŋa toto moyi ve!» <verse eid="ACT 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23" />Bo baakafulaha na mifudi, baakaduula biyunga bya bo na ubaalanga mufundu hu yulu. <verse eid="ACT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24" />Mukuutu masadaadu aviidi muswa, mu kotese Pahuli hutso a mumbu masadaadu. Batete nde bikooti, mana nde atoyo, na bayaba mu hima Bayudaayo baakayuma nde. <verse eid="ACT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25" />Masadaadu maakakuta nde mikudu, mu utete nde bikooti. Pahuli aleeli huli mukuutu masadaadu wu aba ŋaana: «Benu lili na muswa mu utete musi Looma bikooti, wu baamaaveletsundasa?»<verse eid="ACT 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26" />Bu nde hayuhi buuna, mukuutu masadaadu ayayibusa mukuutu balwani: «We buni usa?» Nde aleeli: «Muutu mo wunuuwu musi Looma ali.» <verse eid="ACT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27" />Mukuutu balwani ayamono Pahuli na aleeli nde: «Leele me, we musi Looma li?» Pahuli afutili: «Eeye.» <verse eid="ACT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28" />Mukuutu balwani abweleele: «Me apfuta mbongo yindahi, mu ubaha biita la musi Looma.» Pahuli aleeli: «Ka me, me musi Looma wu imbutala-ngu.» <verse eid="ACT 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29" />Mu mawasa, ba baakiitete nde mana nde atoyo, baatahuhi na nde. Bu nde hayibwili moonyi ti Pahuli musi Looma, mukuutu balwani abahi boomo, mu tooni ati nde ahadi nde mu mapanga.<verse eid="ACT 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pahuli ŋa busu bwa pfuundu bakuutu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30" />Mukuutu balwani asahi uyaaba mu tsiki, lilibi li nde havanga li Bayudaayo baakese nde. Ni mu buuna, ilumbu hi hyakaduuka, nde anyanguli nde mapanga. Na nde atsihi bakuutu ba bangaanga na pfuundu bakuutu ba Bayudaayo yoosi. Nde abiti Pahuli mana batsundasa nde ŋa busu bwa bo.<verse eid="ACT 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1" />Pahuli asungimini pfuundu Bayudaayo, na aleeli: «Baana baa ngu, me miitsalila Nzambi te ilumbu hya lolo, hwavele munyongo tso hoole.» <verse eid="ACT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2" />Mukuutu bangaanga ba Nzambi Ananya, atumi ba baaba ŋa pedu a Pahuli, mu utete nde mu munywa. <verse eid="ACT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3" />Na Pahuli aleeli: «Nzambi sa asyembe we, we wa vilu-vilu! We li ŋa mu utsundasa me we bu huli mikele. Ka we miituma batete me hwavele uduukala mikele». <verse eid="ACT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4" />Ba baaba ŋa pedu a Pahuli baleeli nde: «We miituha mukuutu bangaanga ba Nzambi!» <verse eid="ACT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5" />Pahuli afutili: «Me a hakanzaba ve, baana ba ngu ti nde mukuutu bangaanga ba Nzambi ali. Mu tooni ati Mabasonehe mali mu ulongese bu: “We lilibi uleele mu mukuutu ibaandu hya we ve<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:27">Pal 22.27</ref></char></note>!”»<verse eid="ACT 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6" />Pahuli aba ayaba ti pfuundu mo yiina aba kabu limosi li Basaduki, na lina li Bafarisi. Ni mu buuna, nde hafulihi ŋa busu bwa bo: «Bana baa ngu, me Mufarisi ndi, na me mwaana Bafarisi. Mu tooni a hiitu hya me mu tsuuhili a babaakwa, bali mu utsundasa me.» <verse eid="ACT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7" />Pahuli amana buuna uleele, kele yabwidi ŋa hati li Bafarisi na Basaduki, na buraandu bwakoti ŋa hati li mukungi. <verse eid="ACT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8" />Kele yabwidi mu tooni ati, bo mwakulu Basaduki, baakaleele ti a yili ve, tso bapofi, tso mavupu. Ka uto ti Bafarisi, bali mu usiila hiitu mu mina myosi. <verse eid="ACT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9" />Baakasinzafulaha. Milongisi mi Mikele, baa mu kabu li Bafarisi baatelimisi paha yinene na uleele: «Bisu a limoni dyaambu tso limosi lilibi mu bahala mo linili ve. Na yaabi? Peleve livupu, tso pofi mumosi yamonehele na nde?»<verse eid="ACT 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10" />Paha yarangili, na mukuutu balwani abati boomo ti baatu mobaniba a bayatsaaka Pahuli. Ni mu buuna, nde hatumi masadaadu mu ukulamana hu tsina hu kuungi laaba, mana bo bamaasa Pahuli ŋa hati la bo, mu uyafutala nde hu bula bu masadaadu. <verse eid="ACT 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11" />Butsuhu bu bwaduukili, Pfumu ayamonehele na Pahuli na aleeli: «Hwada! Mu tooni ati we miitiila me imbangi huni, hu Yeruselemi. Ni buuna, we afwana ka uta me imbangi hu musyenge a Looma.»<verse eid="ACT 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pfuundu Bayudaayo mu uvangila Pahuli bubi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12" />Humbisa hu busi bwakiidi, kabu li Bayudaayo laakuti pfuundu mu uduba Pahuli. Bo baateeli mvwanga mu bo mwakulu mu uveledya na uvelenywa, tso bo a badubi Pahuli ve. <verse eid="ACT 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13" />Ba baakuti pfuundu mo yiina, baaba baa labuha maku mana ma baatu. <verse eid="ACT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14" />Bo baayamono bakuutu ba bangaanga ba Nzambi, na bakuutu ba Bayudaayo, na baayaleele bo: «Bisu limiiteele mvwanga mu bisu mwakulu, mu uveledya na uvelenwya, natee bu lu uduba Pahuli. <verse eid="ACT 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15" />Buuna, benu mu itwadi na pfuundu bakuutu ba Bayudaayo, vondwaani mukuutu balwani abehele benu Pahuli. Salilaani buyedi bu uleele ti, benu litondi utsikaha musamu a nde bubwe-bubwe. Hu tsyelo a bisu, bisu laamiivangama mu uduba nde, tswamina nde mu uyato huni.»<verse eid="ACT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16" />Ka mwaana a kedi a Pahuli mumosi, ayuhi pfuundu mo yiina. Nde ayeni hu bula bu masadaadu, akoti, na ayayelese Pahuli. <verse eid="ACT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17" />Buuna Pahuli ateeli mumosi mu bakuutu ba masadaadu. Nde aleeli nde: «Bita mufudu mbahala mo wunuuwu, huli mukuutu balwani. Mu tooni ati, nde na dyaambu li uyabisa nde.» <verse eid="ACT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18" />Mukuutu masadaadu abiti nde huli mukuutu balwani na aleeli: «Ikondaayi Pahuli miteele me na milembesene me mu ubehele we mufudu mbahala mo wunuuwu. Nde na dyaambu li uyabisa we.»<verse eid="ACT 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19" />Mukuutu balwani avoli mufudu mbahala mu hoho, na ayeni na nde ŋa muvanga. Nde afuuli nde: «Ki dyaambu we li na lo mu uyabisa me?» <verse eid="ACT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20" />Mupfudu-mbahala afutili: «Bakuutu ba Bayudaayo baamiiyuhasana, mu uvondo we mu ubita Pahuli ngwali, ŋa busu bwa pfuundu bakuutu ba bo. Bo bamiiveloho ti, pfuundu yoosi yitondi utsikaha dyaambu la nde bubwe-bubwe. <verse eid="ACT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21" />Ka a hayuha ma bo! Mu tooni ati, litangu li lavyoho maku mana (40) ma baatu ba ŋa hati la bo, baamiiswemenene nde. Bo baamiiteele mvwanga mu bo mwakulu mu uveledya na uvelenywa, tso bo a badubi Pahuli ve. Bo baamiivangama, ka ndulu mvutu a we bali mu ukeele.» <verse eid="ACT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22" />Mukuutu aleeli huli mwaana a kedi a Pahuli, mu uveleyabisa pasi muutu ma nde hayatoosele nde. Titswene, nde aviidi nde muswa mu ufutaha.<verse eid="ACT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pahuli bamiitsindaha hu musyenge a Sezare</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23" />Titswene mukuutu balwani ateeli boole mu bakuutu ba masadaadu. Nde aviidi bo tumili: «Tsonzehaani makama moole (200) ma masadaadu, maku tsambu (70) ma ba baayaba unama babuuru, na makama moole (200) ma banga makongo. Vangamaani mu uyene hu musyenge a Sezare, tsitsaha moyi, mu ngunga yi matatu humbisa a busi uyila. <verse eid="ACT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24" />Vangimasaani ka babuuru mu ubita Pahuli na utoose nde huli Mutumi Felikisi, mbenze ve, muhahusunu ve.»<verse eid="ACT 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25" />Ni mu buuna, mukuutu balwani mo usonehe muhanda mo wunuuwu:<verse eid="ACT 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26" />«Mutumi Felikisi nga mifwende, yaka mabwehe ma mamati huli me Koloode Lisyasi, mukuutu balwani. <verse eid="ACT 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27" />Bayudaayo beedi baakaanga muutu wu me miitsindaha we wunuwu, na ukana uduba nde. Bu me anzuha ti nde musi Looma, mu mawasa, me anzyene na masadaadu ma me, mu uyayobolo nde. <verse eid="ACT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28" />Bu me atsaha uyaba tooni yi Bayudaayo baakese nde, me ambita nde ŋa busu bwa pfuundu bakuutu ba Bayudaayo. <verse eid="ACT 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29" />Me amono ti, bo bali mu ukese nde, mu tooni a mamali mu utala mikele mya bo. Ka a huli na dyaambu lilibi li nde havanga, li lutwala ubita nde mu kondaayi buuve hu lipfu ve. <verse eid="ACT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30" />Bu baayayibusa me, ti Bayudaayo aba baamiikutala nde pfuundu mu uduba nde, mawasa-mawasa, me ataasa mu utsindaha we nde. Na me andeele huli ba bali mu utsuta nde, mu uyakese nde ŋa busu bu lituma la we.»<verse eid="ACT 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31" />Masadaadu makuhisi we bu baatumi mo. Bo baavoli Pahuli na baabiti nde butsuhu-butsuhu, hu musyenge a Antipati. <verse eid="ACT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32" />Ilumbu hi hyakaduuka, masadaadu ma maakayene na nde mu miilu, maafutihi hu bula bwa mo. Na baasiisi babaaba na babuuru, mu uhwada mu mudyenge na Pahuli. <verse eid="ACT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33" />Bu baatoodi hu musyenge a Sezare, bo baaviidi muhanda mo huli mutumi, na baamweesi nde Pahuli. <verse eid="ACT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34" />Mutumi ataanga muhanda mowuna, nde afuuli Pahuli, mu ki itaanzi nde hamata. Bu nde hayaabi ti Pahuli aba musi Silisiya, <verse eid="ACT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35" />nde aleeli nde: «Me tsa pfuula we byuhu ŋa ba baayakese we bu uyato.» Na nde atumi mu ususa nde hutso ibaanga hya Eloode.<verse eid="ACT 23:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24" />
  <para style="s1">Bayudaayo baakesi Pahuli hu lituma la Looma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1" />Bilumbu bitaanu bivyoho, mukuutu bangaanga ba Nzambi Ananya, akulimini hu musyenge a Sezare na mwa litangu li bakuutu, na muvoli mileembe mumosi, nduhi Teletuluusi. Bo baayakese Pahuli ŋa busu bwa Felikisi wu aba mutumi. <verse eid="ACT 24:1" /><verse number="2-3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2-3" />Baateeli Pahuli na Teletuluusi abaandihi ukese nde. Na nde aleeli bu: «Felikisi wu asinzakuha mu uyaka mifwende, mu tooni a we, bisu lili hutso a kinya yi yakuha na mu tooni lituma la we, tsoboono na hyenze bya yakoto mu bubwe bwa tsi a bisu Bayudaayo. Mu moosi ma bisu lili mu uyaka mu taangu yoosi na pasi tsyelo, lifutili we matondo ma malahi. <verse eid="ACT 24:2-3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4" />Ka me atondi uvolo we taangu yindahi ve. Buuna, me pondi huli we mu umweese litondo mu uyuha bisu mu mwaana taangu hole. <verse eid="ACT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5" />Bisu limiimono ti bahala mo linili, lili muutu wu afulala bubi, bu nde ali mukuutu a kabu la Nazareti<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 2:23">Mat 2.23</ref> </char></note>. Nde li mu ukotese hyalasasa ŋa hati li Bayudaayo ba ŋa toto yoosi. <verse eid="ACT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6" />Nde asaha pa usumana bungidi bwa nzo a Nzambi. Mono buni bisu limiiyakaanga nde. [Bisu likiitsundasa nde we bu huli mikele mya bisu. <verse eid="ACT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 24:7" />Ka mukuutu balwani Lisyasi bu ayidi, nde miiyapatula Pahuli ŋa myoho mya bisu, na mifudi myosi. <verse eid="ACT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8" />Mukuutu balwani Lisyasi, atumi ba baakatsundasa nde, mu uya ŋa busu bu lituma la we.] Tso we fuuli nde, we sa mono we mwakulu imbuli hya moosi ma bisu lili mu ukese nde.» <verse eid="ACT 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9" />Bakuutu ba Bayudaayo baasilisi, na baleeli ti ni tsiitsa hwa nde.<verse eid="ACT 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pahuli alwanili nyutu a nde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10" />Mutumi avondi Pahuli mu utoyo. Na Pahuli aleeli: «Me nzaabi ti umata bilima bi bilahi, we li mu usa buzonzi mu tsi mo yiniiyi na bukuhu bwosi. Ni mu buuna, me ukala nyutu a me na hiitu ŋa busu bwa we. <verse eid="ACT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11" />We bu we utwala utsikaha lo we mwakulu, bilumbu kuumi byole a byavyoho ve, li me anzyeni hu Yeruselemi mu ukunda Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12" />Pasi muutu a hamono me hutso a nzo a Nzambi mu usongo, buuve mu utuumbasa baatu ve. Me a hapaanga buuna ve, tso hwaba hu nzo lisambulu yi Bayudaayo, tso pasi tsyelo hutso musyenge. <verse eid="ACT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13" />Baatu mobaniba a baatwala umweese, mu ki tooni batondi utsundasa me ve. <verse eid="ACT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14" />Ka, me ndi mu utsiinga li ŋa busu bwa we. Me miikoto mu usalila Nzila a Yisu, yi bo bali mu umono we kabu li latahuha na mikele. Ka me ndi mu utsalila Nzambi bakaaha ba bisu. Na me ndi mu utsa hiitu mu moosi ma baasonehe mutso Mikele na Mimbihuli. <verse eid="ACT 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15" />Me ndi na hiitu mu Nzambi. Hiitu hi bo mwakulu bali na hyo, ti baatu bababwe we bababi sa basuuha humbisa lipfu. <verse eid="ACT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16" />Ni mu buuna, me ndi mu utsa mifudi mu uveleba na dyaambu lilibi hutso mutima a me, ŋa busu bwa Nzambi, na ŋa busu bwa baatu.»<verse eid="ACT 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17" />«Bilima bi bilahi bu byavyohi, me anzapfutaha hu musyenge a Yeruselemi. Me anzapfutaha mu ubehe likumbasa la mbongo huli baatu ba tsi a me, na ubehe bungodu ŋa busu bwa Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18" />Mono ma me amba mu usa, ŋa bo baayabiisa me mu litandala la nzo a Nzambi. Me akoti mu utsyemese nyutu a me, a hwaba na tso konge a baatu mu paanga a me, tso kele ka ve. <verse eid="ACT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19" />Ka mwaana kabu li Bayudaayo ba itaandzi hya Asiya, baaba ŋaana. Ni bo baana bakiiteleme ŋa busu bwa we, mu uyakese me, tso bo bali na li usyembe me. <verse eid="ACT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20" />Buuve, baatu moba baleele ŋaniiŋa, ki dyaambu lilibi li bo baamono mu me, ŋa bo baakatsundasa me ŋa busu bwa pfuundu bakuutu ba Bayudaayo. <verse eid="ACT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21" />Peleve bo baakangila me piinga, mu tooni a ma me anzabisa na mifudi myosi, ŋa busu bwa bo. Me atelimi na me andeeli: “Bali mu utsundasa me loloyi ŋa busu bwa benu, mu tooni ati, me ndi mu utsa hiitu mu!”»<verse eid="ACT 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22" />Mutumi Felikisi, wu aba asinzatsikaha ndongisili ya nzila a Yisu, aswehisi mambu. Na aleeli huli bakesi baa Pahuli: «Ŋa mukuutu balwani Lisyasi hu uya, me tsa paanga musamu a benu.» <verse eid="ACT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23" />Nde atumi mukuutu masadaadu mu ukeelese Pahuli, na uva nde mwa bunyanga. Nde aviidi muswa huli bambaahi ba nde mu uva nde likumbasa. <verse eid="ACT 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24" />Mwa bilumbu bu byavyohi, Mutumi Felikisi ayidi na mukadi a nde Durusiile, wu aba Muyudaayo. Nde atsindihi baatu mu ubehele nde Pahuli. Nde ayuhi ma Pahuli haba na mo, mu uyabisa mu tsili a hiitu mu Yisu Kristo. <verse eid="ACT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25" />Pahuli hakalongese bo, mu dyaambu la mbiili yi yafwana ŋa busu bwa Nzambi, na buni hwafwana mu utuma nyutu, na mu dyaambu la tsundusu a Nzambi yi yuuya. Hu mbisa uyuha maana, Felikisi abahi boomo na aleeli nde: «Maana mamiikuha lolo yiniiyi. Ŋa me umbaha taangu, me tsambweteele we.» <verse eid="ACT 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26" />Nde aba na hiitu ti, Pahuli akiiva nde mbongo. Ni mu buuna, nde hakatsiha nde taangu yoosi mu ubaamoho na nde. <verse eid="ACT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27" />Bilima byole bivyoho, Polosiyusi Fesitusi akisini ŋa mbuha a Felikisi. Nde asiisi Pahuli mu kondaayi, mu umweese kinya huli Bayudaayo.<verse eid="ACT 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25" />
  <para style="s1">Pahuli li mu ukala nyutu a nde ŋa busu bwa Fesitusi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1" />Bilumbu bitatu bi byaduuki nziili a nde hutso itaanzi, pfumu Fesitusi amati musyenge a Sezare mu uyene hu musyenge a Yeruselemi. <verse eid="ACT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2" />Bakuutu ba bangaanga ba Nzambi na bangeele baa Bayudaayo, baayakese Pahuli ŋa busu bwa pfumu mo wunuuwu. Bo baalembisini nde, <verse eid="ACT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3" />mu uvangila bo dyaambu li lumweese bo kinya, mu ufutala Pahuli hu musyenge a Yeruselemi. Bo baasiidi buuna, mu tooni ati bo baakuti pfuundu mu uduba nde mu nzila. <verse eid="ACT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4" />Ka Fesitusi afutili na aleeli: «Pahuli mu kondaayi ali hu musyenge a Sezare. Me mwakulu a utaamba mu dwe huuna ve.» <verse eid="ACT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5" />Nde abweleele li: «Nyaha bakuutu ŋa hati la benu bakulamana na me hu musyenge a Sezare. Na bo bayakese bahala mo linili, tso nde avanga dyaambu lilibi.» <verse eid="ACT 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6" />Fesitusi avyosi ndulu bilumbu poombo buuve kuumi na bo, titswene nde afutihi hu musyenge a Sezare. Mu ilumbu hi hyaduuki, nde ayeni hu nzo a tsundusu na nde atumi babehele nde Pahuli. <verse eid="ACT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7" />Bu Pahuli hayato, Bayudaayo ba baamati hu musyenge a Yeruselemi baayadiinga nde. Bo baakwihili nde matooni ma malahi ma manono, hwavele utwala umweese bumbuli bwa mo. <verse eid="ACT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8" />Ka Pahuli akakala nyutu a nde. Na akaleele: «Me a hatsa lisumu tso limosi ve, tso ŋa busu bu mikele mi Bayudaayo, tso ŋa busu bwa nzo a Nzambi, tso ŋa busu bu lituma la pfumu a tsi, Kayisaali.» <verse eid="ACT 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9" />Fesitusi wu akasaha bukaanga na Bayudaayo, afuuli Pahuli: «We siingi uyene batsundasa we, mu dyaambu mo linili ŋa busu bwa me, hu Yeruselemi?» <verse eid="ACT 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10" />Pahuli afutili: «Me miiteleme ŋa busu bwa tsundusu yi yili hutso lituma la Kayisaali, ni ŋa baafwana utsundasa me. Me a hatsa dyaambu lilibi huli Bayudaayo ve, we bu we mwakulu yaabi lo bubwe-bubwe. <verse eid="ACT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11" />Tso me ndi na matooni, buuve tso me apaanga dyaambu li bafwana uduba me, me a humbata lipfu ve. Ka tso baatu mobaniba bali mu ukwiha me matooni ma upfuta, a huli na muutu wu uli na muswa mu uvahula me ŋa myoho mya bo ve. Me tondi ti lituma la Kayisaali, litsundasa me.» <verse eid="ACT 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12" />Buuna, Fesitusi bu hamani pfuundu na batsyengi ba nde, afutili: «We miitondo ti Kayisaali nde mwakulu nga tsi, atsundasa we. We sa yene ŋa busu bwa nde.»<verse eid="ACT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pahuli ŋa busu bwa pfumu Agilipa na Belinisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13" />Humbisa a mwa bilumbu, pfumu Agilipa na Belinisi kedi a nde, baayidi hu musyenge a Sezare mu uyasuula Fesitusi. <verse eid="ACT 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14" />Bu bo baavyosi bilumbu bi bilahi huuna, Fesitusi ayabisi huli mutumi musamu a Pahuli. Nde aleeli bu: «Me ndi ŋa na bahala limosi, li Felikisi hasiisa hutso a kondaayi. <verse eid="ACT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15" />Ŋa me anzyeni hu Yeruselemi, bakuutu ba bangaanga ba Nzambi, na bakuutu ba Bayudaayo, baayakese muutu mo wunuuwu. Na baayavondo me mu ukotese nde mu kondaayi. <verse eid="ACT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16" />Me anzabisa bo ti bisu Looma a bali na ipfu hi uvahula pasi nde hu lipfu, hwavele nde umaakala nyutu a nde ŋa busu bu matooni ma baakese nde ve. <verse eid="ACT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17" />Na bo baayidi ŋa na me. Mu mawasa, ilumbu hi hyaduuki, me atumi mu ubehele me bahala mo linili na me apaangi dyaambu. <verse eid="ACT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18" />Ba baayakese nde bu baayidi, me amoni ti matooni ma bo baakesi nde, a maaba we bu me akatsima ve. <verse eid="ACT 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19" />Tooni ndulu ukaakana mu biyusili bya Nzambi a bo mwakulu. Bo baakakaakana ka mu tooni a muutu mumosi wu bali mu uteele Yisu, wu akwa. Pahuli li mu usilasa ti, nde moonyi ali. <verse eid="ACT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20" />Aba pasi huli me, mu ukese musamu wa pila yina. Mono bu me apfuula nde tso nde tondi uyene hu musyenge a Yeruselemi, mana batsundasa nde huuna. <verse eid="ACT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21" />Ka Pahuli abisa buuna. Nde avondi ti bayavaanga dyaambu la nde ŋa busu bu lituma la nga tsi, Kayisaali. Buuna, me atuma bakeelese nde mu kondaayi, tswamina me tsindaha nde huli Kayisaali.» <verse eid="ACT 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22" />Agilipa aleeli Fesitusi: «Me kaka tondi uyuha bahala mo linili.» Fesitusi afutili: «Ngwali we uyuha nde.»<verse eid="ACT 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23" />Ilumbu hi hyaduuki, Agilipa na Belinisi baayidi mu konge na muyusu woosi, na baakoti mu nzo a tsundusu. Bo baakoti na bakuutu ba masadaadu na baa bubaatuma musyenge. Fesitusi atumi babehe Pahuli. <verse eid="ACT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24" />Na Fesitusi aleeli: «Pfumu Agilipa na benu baa lili na bisu, benu lili mu umono bahala mo linili. Buli li Bayudaayo loosi laayakese nde huli me, umata hu Yeruselemi natee huni. Bo bali mu ubafulaha mu mifudi, ti bafwana uduba nde. <verse eid="ACT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25" />Me amono ti nde a habuka dyaambu, li bafwana uduba nde mu love. Ka nde mwakulu, bu hatondi ti nga tsi Kayisaali avanga dyaambu la nde, me moni ti hwafwana me mu utsindaha nde ŋa busu bwa nga tsi. <verse eid="ACT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26" />Ka me a ndi na la tsiki mu usonehe huli nga tsi mu tooni a Pahuli ve. Ni mu buuna, me tondi ti batsundasa nde ŋa busu bwa we, pfumu Agilipa. Me atsiidi buuna, mana me mbaha ma me utsonehe, humbisa a byuhu bya we. <verse eid="ACT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27" />Mu tooni ati, a hwafwana mu utsindaha ikondaayi hu Looma, hwavele uyabisa mu tsiki, matooni ma kesili a nde ve.»<verse eid="ACT 25:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26" />
  <para style="s1">Pahuli akali nyutu a nde ŋa busu bwa pfumu Agilipa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1" />Agilipa aleeli Pahuli: «We na muswa mu ukala nyutu a we.» Buuna Pahuli alabi hoho, na abaandihi ukala nyutu a nde. Na aleeli: <verse eid="ACT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2" />«Me ndi na kinya, pfumu Agilipa, mu ukala nyutu a me loloyi, ŋa busu bwa we, mu moosi ma Bayudaayo bali mu ukese me. <verse eid="ACT 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3" />Mu tooni ati, we yaabi bukulu bu Bayudaayo boosi, na misamu myosi mi bo bubaakakana mu myo. Ni mu buuna, me pondi we mu uyuha me mu isuusi.»<verse eid="ACT 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4" />«Bayudaayo boosi bayaabi mbiili a me, umata bufudu bwa me. Bo bayaabi ka ndyatili a me, umata hu me akakula mu bufudu bwa me, ŋa hati la buli la me na hu Yeruselemi. <verse eid="ACT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5" />Bo bayaabi me umata beleve. Tso batondi, bo utwala uta imbangi, ti me andyati we mufarisi mu kwasili mikele mya kabu li Bafarisi. Kabu li laafulala kwadili mu makabu ma Bayudaayo moosi: ni kabu li Bafarisi. <verse eid="ACT 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6" />Bunuubu bali mu utsundasa me, mu tooni ati me ndi mu utsingama na kwadili mu nzuhisini li Nzambi hasiidi huli bakaaha ba bisu. <verse eid="ACT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7" />Bibandu kuumi byole (12) bya buli la bisu, bili mu usa hiitu mu umono tswihili a nzuhisini mo liina. Buuna, bibandu kuumi byole mo biina, bili mu usalila Nzambi na mukami nyangu na butsuhu. Ni mu tooni a hiitu mo hina, pfumu Agilipa, Bayudaayo bamiikese me.<verse eid="ACT 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8" />Benu Bayudaayo ba laavele na imiinu, mu matwala ma Nzambi, saani hiitu ti Nzambi ubaasuula babaakwa! <verse eid="ACT 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9" />Me mwakulu atsimi ti, aba hwafwana mu ulwanisa buli la Yisu musi Nazareti, mu manzila moosi. <verse eid="ACT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10" />Ni mambu mo maana me atsi ka hu Yeruselemi. Me anzaki lituma li bakuutu ba bangaanga ba Nzambi, na me akotisi mu kondaayi, ba banzuhisini mu ba baakasila Yisu hiitu. Na ŋa baakava kesili mu uduba bo, humbisa utsundasa bo, me akatsilasa. <verse eid="ACT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11" />Tangu yoosi, ŋa me akanzyene mu manzo ma lisambulu ma Bayudaayo, me akatsyembe bo na mifudi myosi. Me akakwamisa bo mu utunala Nzambi. Mu bunono bwa kesi a me mu bo, me akambingasa bo natee mu misyenge mi bumwenyi.»<verse eid="ACT 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pahuli ayabisi kinguli buyedi a nde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12" />«Ni mu buuna, me anzyeni hu musyenge a Damaseko, mu lituma na isalu bi bakuutu ba bangaanga ba Nzambi baaviidi me. <verse eid="ACT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13" />Pfumu Agilipa, bu me amba mu nzila, tswamina mu uto mwangulu, me amoni liyalala li laamati hu yulu. Liyalala mo, laaluta nyangu umwedeme. Lo laayadiinga me na bambaahi ba me baa mudyenge. <verse eid="ACT 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14" />Bisu boosi laabwidi ŋa toto. Na me anzuhi ndaha mosi yi yaakaleele me mu Ibeleho: “Sahuli, Sahuli, mu ki tooni we li mu ukwamisa me? Ndulu mu mwaana taangu hole, we li mu uruma ŋa busu bwa Nzambi, we ibulu ŋa busu bu likaanda la pfumu a hyo.” <verse eid="ACT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15" />Me apfuuli: “Pfumu, we na?” Na Pfumu afutili: “Me ni Yisu, wu we li mu ukwamisa. <verse eid="ACT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16" />Ka suuha na teleme. Me miinzamonehele na we, mana we ba musalili a me. We uba mbangi a me, mu uyayabisa bakima, buni we miibwana na me loloyi. We uyayabisa bo mambu moosi, ma me umbwemweese we. <verse eid="ACT 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17" />Me unzobolo we ŋa busu bwa buli li Bayudaayo, na ŋa busu bu mabuli makima ma me utsindaha we huli mo. <verse eid="ACT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18" />Me ndi mu utsindaha we, mana we dibula bo miisu. Me ndi mu utsindaha we, mana we palisa bo mu piipidi, mu uvyoso bo mu liyalala. Me ndi mu utsindaha we, mana we palisa bo hu tsina matwala ma Saatana, mu ususa bo hu tsina lituma la Nzambi. Bu bu usiila me hiitu, Nzambi unyahula masumu ma bo, na bo bu ubaha mbuha ŋa hati la ba Nzambi hamiisoolo.”»<verse eid="ACT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pahuli atoyi mu isalu hya nde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19" />«Ni mu buuna, pfumu Agilipa, me a hambisa ukuhasa imono-miisu hi hyamata hu yulu ve. <verse eid="ACT 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20" />Ka me anzabisa Musamu wu Mubwe, tsomi huli bisu Damaseko, bisu Yeruselemi, baa itaanzi hya Yuda yoosi na baa matsi makima. Me ateele bo mu usobo mbiili. Bo bakinguha huli Nzambi, na umweese mu mavaanga tsobiili mo yiina. <verse eid="ACT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21" />Ni mu buuna, Bayudaayo baayakaanga me, bu me amba mu litandala la nzo a Nzambi na baasahi uduba me. <verse eid="ACT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22" />Ka Nzambi li mu ukeelese me natee loloyi. Na me ndi ŋa mu uta imbangi hya me huli baatu boosi, huba bangebe tso bakuutu. Me ndi mu undongese pila mosi ma mimbihuli mya taangu yikulu na Moose, baayabisi, mi myafwana uvangama mu Kristo. <verse eid="ACT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23" />Kristo umono pasi, na nde uba muutu watsomi mu usuuha ŋa hati la babaakwa. Nde uyayabisa Musamu wu Mubwe, wu uli we liyalala li lu uyalusa nzila a bisu, ni we nzila yi mabuli makima moosi.»<verse eid="ACT 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24" />Bu nde haba mu ukala nyutu a nde, mutumi Fesitusi aleeli na mifudi: «Pahuli, we ka ladi! Bu we amiisinzayiha, buyedi bwaka mu uyamisa we ladi!» <verse eid="ACT 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25" />Pahuli afutili nde bu: «Me a handi na ladi ve, we Fesitusi nga mifwende, mambu ma me ndi mu undeele, mali ma mbuli na ma tsiki. <verse eid="ACT 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26" />Pfumu Agilipa kaka asiinzayaba misamu mo minimi, na me ndi mu unzabisa myo na ibahala hyoosi ŋa busu bwa nde. Mu tooni ati, me nzaabi ti nde a hadimbala pasi dyaambu ve, mambu mo maniima maayabana huli boosi. <verse eid="ACT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27" />Pfumu Agilipa, we li mu usa hiitu mu mambu ma mimbihuli myayabisa? Me nzaabi ti we li mu usa mo hiitu.» <verse eid="ACT 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28" />Agilipa afutili huli Pahuli: «We li mu utsima ti we ukiingula matsimi ma me, mu mwaana a taangu hoole moyi, mu usiingama mu Kristo a we?» <verse eid="ACT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29" />Pahuli aleeli: «Tso mu mawasa ma, tso hu busu, me ndi mu utsambila Nzambi, mana benu boosi ka lisiingama mu nde. Peyu a me ni ti, benu boosi ba lili mu uyuha me loloyi, likituha we me, hwavele mapanga mo maniima!»<verse eid="ACT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30" />Pfumu Agilipa, mutumi Fesitusi, Belinisi na boosi ba baaba na bo, baatelimi. <verse eid="ACT 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31" />Na bu bo baayeni, bo baakalelesene: «Bahala mo linili a hasa pasi dyaambu li lu uva nde lipfu, tso ukotese nde mu kondaayi ve.» <verse eid="ACT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32" />Na Agilipa aleeli Fesitusi: «Nde kiiba bunyanga, kini nde a hasaha umono Kayisaali ve.»<verse eid="ACT 26:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27" />
  <para style="s1">Pahuli bamiitsindaha hu musyenge a Looma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1" />Bu bisu laavoli kesili mu uyene hu Italiya mu likuumbi, batumi baayehuli Pahuli na mwa litangu li bikondaayi ŋa myoho mi mukuutu masadaadu Yuliyusi. Muutu mo wunuuwu akatuma kabu li balwani li baakateele «kabu la nga tsi». <verse eid="ACT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2" />Bisu laakoti mutso likuumbi la Adalamite li laaba mudwe hu ngulu makuumbi yi itaanzi hya Asiya, na bisu laayeni. Arisitake, musi Masedonya, wu musyenge a Tesalonika, aba na bisu. <verse eid="ACT 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3" />Ilumbu hi hyaduuki, bisu laayato hu musyenge a Sidoni. Yuliyusi wu aba na bukuhu ŋa busu bwa Pahuli, aviidi nde muswa mu uyamono bambaahi ba nde mu ubaha bi nde haba na byo nzala. <verse eid="ACT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4" />Bu laamati ŋaana, bisu laalondi simu li laasweme li iliiŋa hya Kipere, mu tooni ifula hi hyakayabwana bisu. <verse eid="ACT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5" />Bisu laasabuhi mubu wu alondo itaanzi hya Silisiya na Papfiliya, na bisu laayato hu musyenge a Myra, hu itaanzi hya Lisi. <verse eid="ACT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6" />Huuna, mukuutu masadaadu, amoni likuumbi li laapali mu musyenge a Alekizandi, mu uyene hu tsi a Italiya. Buuna, nde akotisi bisu mutso likuumbi mo. <verse eid="ACT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7" />Humbisa bilumbu bi bilahi, bisu laakayene mu nzali buke-buke, na bisu laamoni pasi yindahi, mu uyato ŋa masungimini ma musyenge a Kinide. Ifula hyakapfubasa bisu mu usungama mu nzila yi laakatalisa. Buuna, bisu laavyohili hu tsyelo a Salomone, mu upalila hu tsoso iliiŋa hya Kerete, hi hyaswemene bifula. <verse eid="ACT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8" />Bisu laalondi muvanga mubu na pasi yindahi. Laayato ŋa mbuha mosi nduhi Bonpore<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27.8 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Bonpore </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mbuha yi yayelemene mu usutaha mu likuumbi.</char></note>, ŋa pedu musyenge a Lazee. <verse eid="ACT 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9" />Bisu laavyosi taangu yindahi, na mubu aba aka tsisu. Bisu laamoni ti mubu ukala bisu mudyenge. Mudyenge mu likuumbi aba aka pasi mu ukuhasa, mu tooni ati ilumbu hi mukungi Bayudaayo wa ndiili ikaandi mu Nzambi, aba hyamiivyoho. Ni mu buuna, Pahuli hayibusi ba baakatuma likuumbi: <verse eid="ACT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10" />«Bambaahi ba me, me ndi mu umono ti mudyenge mo wunuuwu sa aba mudyenge wa pasi lipfu. Likuumbi na makatu ma lo, sa bitsamuha mu biteesi bibinono. Na bisu mwakulu ka, utwala ukoto mu pasi lipfu.» <verse eid="ACT 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11" />Mukuutu masadaadu aba asuusa hiitu fula-fula mu mubiti likuumbi na mu nga likuumbi, ka a mu mandoongi ma Pahuli ve. <verse eid="ACT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12" />Titswene, ngulu makuumbi a yaba yakuha mu uvyoso maangala huuna ve. Ni mu buuna, baatu ba baaba mutso likuumbi, fula-fula baatelimi mudwe. Bo baakasaha tso baakitwala uto hu Fenikisi, ngulu makuumbi ya Kerete. Ngulu makuumbi yi yaakatalisa hu tsyelo a Sude-Wesete na Noode-Wesete, huuna hwaba mbuha yimbwe mu uvyoso maangala.<verse eid="ACT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ifula hili mu unyingasa likuumbi la Pahuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13" />Mwa ifula hi hyakamata hu Sude hyatelimi, na bo baamoni ti bo baakitwala utswihasa makani ma bo. Bo baamaasi manya li baaba baadyamisa mu nzali mu ukangimasa likuumbi. Bo baayeni, na baakalondo muvanga mubu, ŋa pedu iliiŋa hya Kerete. <verse eid="ACT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14" />Ka masulubete, ifula hi mifudi hi baakatele «ifula hya Noode-Esete», hyayakulamana, umata hu yulu bisyelo bi iliiŋa mo. <verse eid="ACT 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15" />Ifula hyatsindihili likuumbi. Lo aba utwala ukunda ifula ve. Na bisu laakatwatwana. <verse eid="ACT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16" />Bu bisu laaba mu uvyoho hu Sude a iliiŋa hi ikeehe, hya nduhi a Koda, bisu laayehili usweme ifula. Buuna, na pasi yindahi bisu laatwali ulwanila hyabu hya pfuuhili, hi bubaasalila mu taangu ya pasi. <verse eid="ACT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17" />Basali ba hutso likuumbi baabwekumasa hyo. Baakuti hyo mikudu mu likuumbi, mu uhwadisa hyo. Bu bo baakabata uyabwa hu yulu musyeŋunyu a hu simu la tsi a Libi, bo baakulimisi mu mubu, isiha hi baaba bakutala mu likuumbi. Bo baasiidi buuna, mana likuumbi liveleyene mawasa. Na bo baakayene we bu ifula hyakabita bo. <verse eid="ACT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18" />Ifula hyahwadi mu ubaapfikasa bisu na mifudi. Ilumbu hi hyaduuki ŋa ngwali, basali ba hutso likuumbi baabumi ibadi hi makatu mu mubu. <verse eid="ACT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19" />Na mu ilumbu hi bitatu, bo baabumi bisalili bi likuumbi hutso mubu, mu makaka ma bo mwakulu. <verse eid="ACT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20" />Matsuhu ma malahi maavyohi, hwavele bisu umono tso nyangu, tso bamvwelele. Na bu ifula hyakavelefwa, hiitu hya bisu hi ufuuha hyafwidi. <figure style="fig" alt="Ifula hyatsindihili likuumbi" file="cn02044B.tif" size="col" loc="27.20" copy="David C. Cook New Testament Illustrations" ref="27.20">Ifula hyatsindihili likuumbi</figure><verse eid="ACT 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21" />Ba baaba mutso likuumbi, a baaba na isiha hyudya ve, umata taangu yinda. Buuna Pahuli, mu tele ŋa hati la bo, aleeli: «Bambaahi ba me, benu kini laayuhili me, na uvelemata iliiŋa hya Kerete. Tso benu laayuhili me, bisu a benu a likibwana mangoongo mo maniima na unyambasana biniibi byosi ve. <verse eid="ACT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22" />Bunuubu, me ndi mu upondo benu mu uhwada. Mu tooni ati tso mumosi mu bisu a benu a hukwa ve. Ka ndulu likuumbi lu utsamuha. <verse eid="ACT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23" />Pofi mumosi a Nzambi, wu abaha me na wu me umbaatsalila, ayamonehele na me butsuhu mo bunuubu. <verse eid="ACT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24" />Na nde aleele me: “Pahuli a haba na boomo! Baafwana utsundasa we ŋa busu bwa Kayisaali, mukuutu batumi. Ka mu tooni litondo la Nzambi mu we, boosi ba bali mu mudyenge na we mutso likuumbi, sa bafuuha.” <verse eid="ACT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25" />Ni mu buuna, hwadaani bambaahi ba me, me atsiingama mu Nzambi. Sa huba we bu nde haleeli me! <verse eid="ACT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26" />Ka tswamina bisu mu utsikama, bisu a benu lafwana mu ubumana simu li iliiŋa imosi.»<verse eid="ACT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ifula himiitsindahala likuumbi hu muvanga mubu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27" />Butsuhu bwa kuumi na bina, ifula hyakadyengese bisu mu mubu wa Miditirani. Hu hahati a busi, basali ba mutso likuumbi baasi tsimi ti, sa linama mu toto. <verse eid="ACT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28" />Bo baatsootsi idongi hi mubu, na bo baamoni ndoongi mubu aba mataka maku moole (20). Hu mwaana lala, bo baabwetsootso idongi, ndoongi aba ka mataka kuumi mataanu (15). <verse eid="ACT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29" />Bo baaba na boomo ti, likuumbi a liyabumana mamanya ma mutso mubu. Ni mu buuna, humbisa likuumbi, bo baabwahi mamanya mana ma maaleme, mu ukangimasa lo. Na bo baakakeele ti busi bukya mawasa. <verse eid="ACT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30" />Buuna, basali ba likuumbi, baasahi ubata mu tswehi mu ufuuha. Mu usaha ubata, bo baabaandihi upalisa hyabu hya pfuuhili, na ususa hyo ŋa yulu mubu. Na bo baapfuti uleele ti, bo baakayene hu ukulamasa mamanya, ma ukangimasa likuumbi hu busu. <verse eid="ACT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31" />Pahuli aleeli huli mukuutu na huli masadaadu: «Tso babahala mobaniba bapali mutso likuumbi, benu a lu utwala ufuuha ve.» <verse eid="ACT 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32" />Buuna masadaadu maakesi mikudu mi myakakaanga hyabu hya pfuuhili, na hyo hyayeni mu mubu.<verse eid="ACT 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33" />Bu bo baakakeele ti busi bukya, Pahuli avondi boosi mu udya. Nde aleeli: «Loloyi ni ilumbu hya kuumi na bina (14), bi benu laamihwada mu ubakeele, hwavele udya pasi isiha. <verse eid="ACT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34" />Me pondi benu mu udya. Mu tooni ati ŋa, byo bika na tsalu mu uhwadisa polo linyutu la benu. Tso mumosi mu benu, a hunyambasana linaanga li mutswe a nde ve.» <verse eid="ACT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35" />Bu nde hamani maana uleele, Pahuli avoli lipa, afutili matondo huli Nzambi ŋa busu bwa baatu boosi. Titswene, nde akesi lipa na nde abaandihi udya. <verse eid="ACT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36" />Na bana boosi kaka baadiidi. <verse eid="ACT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37" />Bisu laaba makama moole maku tsambu na baatu basamunu (276), mutso likuumbi. <verse eid="ACT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38" />Bu boosi baaywati, mu ulengese likuumbi, bo baabumi makatu ma mbutu yi baakasalila mu uvanga mapa, hutso mubu.<verse eid="ACT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Likuumbi laadyami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39" />Ka bu busi bwakiidi, basali ba likuumbi a baakayaba mbuha yi bo baaba ve. Bo baatalili hu lala ngulu yi yaaba na musyeŋunyu. Bo baataasi mu uyatelemese likuumbi huuna. <verse eid="ACT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40" />Ni mu buuna, basalili ba likuumbi baakesi mikudu na bikahu byosi bi byakakaanga likuumbi na baatimbi byo hutso mubu. Titswene bo baanyanguli mikudu mi manaangu ma maakasuungaha likuumbi mu nzila. Bo baatelimisi ngooto hu busu bu likuumbi, mana livupu litsindahala lo. Na bo baatalisi hu tsyelo a ngulu mubu. <verse eid="ACT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41" />Ka bo baayabumana ibaha hi musyeŋunyu. Likuumbi laadyami hutso a hyo, na laakangimi. Busu bu likuumbi loosi, laakoti hutso musyeŋunyu, hwavele utwala ubwenyingama. Itini hya mbisa hyabohihi, mu tooni mifudi mi mapo ma mubu.<verse eid="ACT 27:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42" />Masadaadu maatondi uduuba bikondaayi byosi, mana tso mumosi a habata mu ubwila. <verse eid="ACT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43" />Ka mukuutu wu akatondo ufuuhasa Pahuli, alihi bo mu usa buuna. Nde atumi boosi ba baaba baayaba ubwila, mu uba baatsomi mu ubwa mu mamba na uyene hu simu. <verse eid="ACT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44" />Bana baakiiduukala bo mu yulu mabaya, buuve mu yulu bibulaha bi likuumbi. Na boosi baatoodi hu simu, mbenze ve, muhahusunu ve.<verse eid="ACT 27:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28" />
  <para style="s1">Pahuli hu iliiŋa hya Malete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1" />Humbisa a hu laatoodi mbenze ve muhahusunu ve, ni huuna bisu laayaabi ti nduhi a iliiŋa mo hina aba Malete. <verse eid="ACT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2" />Bisu iliiŋa mo hina baayaki bisu na litondo li laafulala. Bu mvula haba mu unoho, na bu hwaba na piyu yindahi, bo baaduuki mbaahu yinene. Baayaki bisu boosi ŋa mukoho a mbaahu mo. <verse eid="ACT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3" />Pahuli atoli iko hi bapyapya ba baakanya mu ubwaha hutso a mbaahu. Ka mu tooni a ibabudu, pili apali hutso iko, akatiti na akahi nde mu kaka. <figure style="fig" alt="Pili apali hutso iko, akatiti Pahuli" file="CN02049B.TIF" size="col" loc="28.3" copy="David C. Cook New Testament Illustrations" ref="28.3">Pili apali hutso iko, akatiti Pahuli</figure> <verse eid="ACT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4" />Bu bisu iliiŋa baamoni taadi akatita mu kaka la Pahuli, bo baalelisini: «Bahala mo linili a huvele mudubi a baatu ve. Mu tooni ati, humbisa ufuuha mu mubu, nzambi wu akuha, a hali mu uva nde bunyanga mu uba moonyi ve.» <verse eid="ACT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5" />Ka Pahuli akubili pili hutso a mbaahu, na a hamoni pasi tso hole ve. <verse eid="ACT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6" />Baatu baakatsima ti nyutu a nde sa yiranda, buuve ti nde sa abwa na ukwa kabala. Ka bo barimbasa, a baamoni dyaambu la pasi li laabwili nde ve. Buuna, bo baasobi matsimi na uleele ti, Pahuli aba mumosi mu banzambi. <verse eid="ACT 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7" />Ŋa pedu a mbuha mo yiina, hwaba na ibuha hi mukuutu iliiŋa, nga nduhi a Pubiliyusi. Nde ni wu ayaki bisu mu litondo, na wu alaahi bisu mbuha yi ubwamina mu bilumbu bitatu. <verse eid="ACT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8" />Taata a Pubiliyusi aba ŋa taangi, mu tooni a baahu na wongo. Pahuli ayamono nde, asambili Nzambi, asuusili nde myoho na abelusi nde. <verse eid="ACT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9" />Humbisa, babeedu bakima baayidi, na nde abelusi kaka baana. <verse eid="ACT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10" />Baamweesi bisu butsitu bu bulahi. Bu taangu yi ufutaha mu likuumbi yaatoodi, baaviidi bisu bi bisu laaba na byo nzala mu mudyenge a bisu.<verse eid="ACT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pahuli miimata iliiŋa hya Malete mu uyene hu musyenge a Looma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11" />Humbisa batsungi batatu, bisu laanami mu likuumbi la nduhi «banzambi baa mavasa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28.11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">banzambi baa mavasa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">huli baatu ba ibiingi mo hina, ni banzambi baa bubaakeelese badyengi.</char></note>», li laakatalisa hu musyenge a Alekizandi. Likuumbi mo liina, laavyosi maangala hutso a ngulu makuumbi a iliiŋa mo hina. <verse eid="ACT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12" />Bisu laayato hu musyenge a Sirakusi, hu bisu laavyosi bilumbu bitatu. <verse eid="ACT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13" />Bu laamati ŋaana, bisu laalondi simu li mubu, mu uyato hu musyenge a Lezyo. Ilumbu hi hyaduuki, ifula hya Sude hyatelimi. Mu bilumbu byole, bisu laayato hu musyenge a Puzoole. <verse eid="ACT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14" />Hutso musyenge mo wunuuwu, bisu laamoni baa mu buli la Kristo, ba baavondi bisu mu uvyoso tsambu li bilumbu na bo. Ni mu nzila mo yiina, bisu laatoodi hu musyenge a Looma. <verse eid="ACT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15" />Baana baa ngu baa mu Kristo baa musyenge mowuna, baayuhi tsangu a bisu. Bo baayabwana bisu natee hu saandu la Apiyusi na hu «manzo matatu ma byenyi». Bu Pahuli hamoni bo, nde afutili matondo huli Nzambi na ahwadi. <verse eid="ACT 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16" />Bu bisu laayato hu Looma, bakuutu baaviidi muswa huli Pahuli mu utsahala mu nzo a siha, na lisadaadu li laakakeelese nde.<verse eid="ACT 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pahuli miilongese Musamu wu Mubwe hu Looma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17" />Bilumbu bitatu bu byavyohi, Pahuli atsihi bakuutu ba Bayudaayo ba hu musyenge a Looma. Bo baayakuukama huli nde mu uyuhala nde. Pahuli aleeli bo: «Baana baa ngu, me a hatsa pasi dyaambu lilibi ŋa busu bwa buli la bisu a benu ve, tso unyanza bipfu bi bataata ba bisu a benu. Ka baakangi me hu Yeruselemi hwavele a tooni, na baayehuli me ŋa myoho mi bakuutu ba Looma. <verse eid="ACT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18" />Bu bo baamani ufuula me byuhu, bo baatondi unyahula me. Bo a baabahi tooni tso mosi, yi yaafwana mu uduba me ve. <verse eid="ACT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19" />Ka bu Bayudaayo baabisi, me apondi ti nga tsi Kayisaali atsundasa me. Ka mu maana moosi, me a handi na dyaambu tso limosi li ukese baatu ba tsi a me ve. <verse eid="ACT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20" />Ni mu buuna, me miipondo mu umono benu, na mu umoho na benu. Nyaha me ndeele benu. Ni mu tooni a muutu mowuna, wu Isereli ubaasa hiitu, me ndi mu umbita mapanga mo maniima.»<verse eid="ACT 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21" />Bakuutu ba Bayudaayo baakaali nde: «Bisu a laayaka pasi muhanda, wu Bayudaayo ba hu tsi a Yuda baasonehe mu tooni a we ve. Na ŋa hati la bo, pasi muutu a hayabisa bisu dyaambu lilibi mu tooni a we ve. <verse eid="ACT 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22" />Ka bisu litondi ti, we mwakulu yabisa bisu matsimi ma we. Mu tooni ati bibiingi byosi, bisu liyaabi ti baatu bubaabisa kabu li we akangama mu lo.»<verse eid="ACT 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23" />Bo baabwesoolo ilumbu ikima, hi ubwepfuutana na Pahuli. Bu ilumbu mo hina hyatoodi, bo baayeni huli nde, mu litangu li lilahi li laafulala latsomi. Imoho hyabaandihi ŋa ngwali natee ŋa tsitsaha. Mu ndongisili a nde, Pahuli akalongese na ubindula mambu ma Ipfumu hya Nzambi. Nde akabindula bo mikele mya Moose, na mihanda mi mimbihuli mya Nzambi myasonihi, mana nde abita bo mu ukangama mu Yisu. <verse eid="ACT 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24" />Bamosi baasiidi hiitu mu ma nde hakaleele, ka bakima baabisi. <verse eid="ACT 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25" />Ka bo baafutihi hwavele uyuhasana. Pahuli aleeli bo: «Livupu la Ngidi laaba na mbiinga, ŋa lo laakaleele bakaaha ba benu mu munywa mumbihuli Esaya! <verse eid="ACT 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26" />Nde aleeli:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">“Yene yaleele huli buli mo linili:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">Benu tso laayuha mu matswi ma benu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:26">ka benu a luubaangula tso limosi ve.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">Benu tso laamono mu miisu ma benu mwakulu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:26">benu a lu ukaanga pasi isiha ve.<verse eid="ACT 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27" />Mu tooni ati, mutima a buli li Isereli aka wu munono.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">Bo baamiidibuha matswi ma bo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">baamiidibuha miisu ma bo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">Miisu ma bo a mamono,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">matswi ma bo a mayuha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">mutima a bo a habaangula,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">na bo a bakinguha huli me,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">mana me mbeeloso bo<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9-10">Esa 6.9-10</ref></char></note>.”»<verse eid="ACT 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28" />Titswene Pahuli abweleele: «Buuna, yaabaani li: yaabaani ti mu musamu wu liyobolo, Nzambi amiitsindaha nde huli ba bavele Bayudaayo. Ka bo bu uyaka mu mutima a bo, musamu liyobolo!»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 28:28">[ <verse eid="ACT 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:29" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28.29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Itsudu mohi hyo ve mu mabuuku makima: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Humbisa a maambu ma Pahuli haleeli, Bayudaayo baayeni na ubaasobosono minywa.</char></note>]<verse eid="ACT 28:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30" />Pahuli atsahili bilima byole bi bitindala mutso a nzo yi nde hayakoto mu tsoombi. Nde akayaka boosi ba baakayamono nde. <verse eid="ACT 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31" />Nde akayabisa bo mu dyaambu li Ipfumu hya Nzambi. Na nde akalongese baatu na isuusi hyoosi, hwavele ikahu, mana bo babaha nzaabili mu Pfumu Yisu Kristo.<verse eid="ACT 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28" />
</usx>